<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Travay</para>
  <para style="toc1">TRAVAY APÒT YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">Travay</para>
  <para style="toc3">Trav</para>
  <para style="mt1">TRAVAY APÒT YO (ZÈV APÒT YO)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Premye istwa ke m te ekri a, chè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luc 1:3</ref></char></note>Théophile, sou tout bagay ke Jésus te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:23">Luc 3:23</ref></char></note>kòmanse fè ak enstwi yo, <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>jis rive jou lè Li te monte nan syèl la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28:19</ref></char></note>apre Li te fin bay lòd selon Lespri Sen an, a apòt ke Li te chwazi yo. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>A sila yo osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:17">Mat 28:17</ref></char></note>Li te prezante tèt li vivan apre soufrans Li, e avèk anpil prèv konvenkan, Li te parèt a yo menm pandan karant jou, e te pale avèk yo de bagay ki te konsène wayòm syèl la.<verse eid="ACT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Li te rasanble yo ansanm e te kòmande yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luc 24:49</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Pa kite Jérusalem, men tann</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:24">Jn 14:24</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sa ke Papa a te pwomèt la; sa ke nou te tande de Mwen menm nan.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/><char style="wj">Paske Jean te batize avèk dlo, men nou va batize avèk Lespri Sen an</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-4">Trav 2:1-4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa a anpil jou de kounye a.” </char><verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Donk, lè yo te reyini ansanm, yo t ap poze Li kesyon, e t ap di: “Senyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:11">Mat 17:11</ref></char></note>èske se nan lè sa a ke W ap restore Wayòm lan an Israël?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Li te di yo: <char style="wj">“Se pa nou menm ki pou konnen ni lè ni tan ke</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24:36</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Papa a gen tan fikse pa otorite pa L. </char> <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/><char style="wj">Men Nou va resevwa pouvwa lè</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-4">Trav 2:1-4</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Lespri Sen an vini sou nou. Nou va </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:48">Luc 24:48</ref></char></note><char style="wj">temwen Mwen ni nan Jérusalem, ni nan Juda ak Samarie, e jis rive nan dènye ekstremite latè.” </char><verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Lè Li te fin di bagay sa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:50">Luc 24:50</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:51">51</ref></char></note>Li te vin leve anlè pandan yo t ap gade, e yon nyaj te resevwa L. Li te vin disparèt jiskaske yo pa t wè Li.<verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Pandan yo t ap toujou gade byen fikse nan syèl la, pandan Li t ap prale, epi vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:4">Luc 24:4</ref></char></note>de mesye ak vètman blan te kanpe akote L; <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>E yo menm osi te di: “Moun Galilée yo, poukisa nou kanpe ap gade nan syèl la? Jésus sila a, ki leve kite nou, pou ale nan syèl la, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref></char></note>vini menm jan ke nou wè L ale nan syèl la”.<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Alò, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:52">Luc 24:52</ref></char></note>retounen Jérusalem sòti nan mòn yo rele Olivier a, ki toupre Jérusalem, a distans mache yon jou Saba. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Lè yo te antre nan vil la, yo te ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:15">Mc 14:15</ref></char></note>chanm anlè kote yo t ap rete a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat 10:2-4</ref></char></note>sa vle di, Pierre Jean, Jacques André, Philippe, Thomas, Barthélemy, Matthieu, Jacques, ki te fis Alphée a, Simon, Zelòt la, ak Judas, fis a Jacques la. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Sa yo avèk yon sèl panse yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:42">Trav 2:42</ref></char></note>t ap toujou pèsevere nan lapriyè, ansanm avèk fanm yo, ak Marie, manman a Jésus, ak frè Li yo.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Nan lè sa a, Pierre te kanpe nan mitan frè yo (yon asanble de anviwon san ven moun ki te la ansanm) e te di: <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>“Frè m yo, Ekriti a te oblije vin akonpli, jan Lespri Sen an te anonse oparavan pa bouch David konsènan Judas <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:47">Mat 26:47</ref></char></note>ki te vin yon gid a sila ki te arete Jésus yo. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Paske li te konte pami nou, e te resevwa pati pa li, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:25">Trav 1:25</ref></char></note>èv sila a.<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>“Alò mesye sila te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Mat 27:3-10</ref></char></note>achte yon chan avèk pri mechanste li a; e te tonbe tèt devan; vant li te fann e zantray li te vide sòti. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Epi sa te vin byen koni pa tout sila ki te rete Jérusalem yo; pou ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:8">Mat 27:8</ref></char></note>nan pwòp lang pa yo, yo te rele chan sa a Hakeldama, ki vle di chan san an.<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>“Paske sa ekri nan liv Sòm Yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:25">Sòm 69:25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Kite kote li rete a vin devaste;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">e pa kite pèsòn rete ladan l’;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:8">Sòm 109:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Kite yon lòt moun vin pran pozisyon pa li a’. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 109:8">Sòm 109:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>“Donk, li nesesè ke pami moun ki akonpanye nou tout tan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:3">Luc 24:3</ref></char></note>Senyè Jésus te antre sòti pami nou yo, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>kòmanse nan batèm Jean, jis rive jou ke Li te anlève soti nan mitan nou an, youn nan sila yo ta dwe devni yon temwen avèk nou de rezirèksyon Li.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Konsa yo te mete devan de mesye, Joseph ke yo te rele Barsabbas, ki te anplis rele Justus, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:26">Trav 1:26</ref></char></note>Matthias. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Yo te priye, e te di: “Ou menm, Senyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat 3:16</ref></char></note>ki konnen kè tout moun, montre nou kilès nan de zòm sa yo Ou chwazi a, <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>pou okipe èv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:5">Wo 1:5</ref></char></note>apòt sila a ke Judas te vire kite pou ale nan pwòp plas li a.”<verse eid="ACT 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:8">Lev 16:8</ref></char></note>fè tiraj osò pou yo, e osò a te tonbe pou Matthias. Konsa, li te ajoute pami onz apòt yo.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15">Lev 23:15</ref></char></note>jou Pannkòt la te rive, yo tout te ansanm nan yon sèl plas. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Sibitman, te sòti nan syèl la yon bwi tankou yon van vyolan k ap kouri, e li te ranpli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:31">Trav 4:31</ref></char></note>tout kay kote yo te chita a. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Konsa, te parèt a yo menm, lang tankou dife, ki t ap gaye pou kont yo, e te vin poze sou yo chak. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Yo tout te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:8">Trav 4:8</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 4:31">31</ref></char></note>ranpli avèk Lespri Sen an, e yo te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:1">I Kwo 12:1</ref></char></note>pale avèk lòt lang jan Lespri a t ap bay yo kapasite eksprime.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Alò, te gen Jwif ki t ap viv Jérusalem; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:25">Luc 2:25</ref></char></note>lèzòm fidèl jwif ki te sòti nan tout nasyon anba syèl la. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Konsa, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:2">Trav 2:2</ref></char></note>bwi a te fèt, foul la te reyini ansanm, e te sezi, paske yo tout t ap tande yo pale nan pwòp lang pa yo.<verse eid="ACT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Yo te etone, yo te sezi e te di: “Alò, èske tout moun sa yo k ap pale la yo pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:73">Mat 26:73</ref></char></note>Galileyen? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>E kijan ke nou tout tande yo nan pwòp lang natal pa nou? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Patyen yo, Mèd yo, Elamit yo, moun Mésopotamie yo, Judée ak Cappadoce yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Trav 18:2</ref></char></note>Pont ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:9">Trav 6:9</ref></char></note>Asie yo <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Phrygie ak Pamphylie yo, Égypte ak teritwa Libye yo vwazen ak Cyrène, e sila ki t ap vizite Rome yo, Jwif ak pèp payen ki te konvèti a relijyon Jwif yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:15">Mat 23:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Crétois ak Arabe yo, Nou tande yo nan pwòp lang pa nou, k ap pale tout zèv pwisan Bondye yo!”<verse eid="ACT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:7">Trav 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo tout te toujou sezi, byen konfonn, e te di youn ak lòt: “Kisa sa vle di?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Men te gen lòt ki t ap moke yo, e t ap di: “Yo plen avèk diven dous”.<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Men Pierre, ki te kanpe fèm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:26">Trav 1:26</ref></char></note>onz yo, te leve vwa li e te deklare a yo menm: “Moun a Judée yo, ak nou tout ki rete Jérusalem yo, kite sa byen konnen pami nou, e prete atansyon a pawòl mwen. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Paske moun sa yo pa sou, tankou nou ta kwè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:7">I Tes 5:7</ref></char></note>paske se sèlman twazyèm è nan jounen an. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Men sa ki te pale pa pwofèt Joël la:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Jl 2:28-32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Epi li va fèt nan dènye jou yo’, Bondye di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Ke Mwen va vin vide Lespri Mwen sou tout Limanite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Fis nou yo ak fi nou yo va pwofetize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Jenn nonm nou yo va fè vizyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">e granmoun nou yo va fè rèv.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Menm sou sèvitè Mwen yo; ni fi, ni gason,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">nan jou sa yo Mwen va vide Lespri Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">e yo va pwofetize.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Mwen va fè parèt mèvèy anwo nan syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">ak sign anba sou latè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">san avèk dife, avèk vapè lafimen.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Solèy la va vin nwa, e lalin nan va tounen san,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">avan gran jou mèvèy Senyè a vini.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>E li va rive ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:13">Wo 10:13</ref></char></note>tout moun</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:21">ki rele Non Senyè a va sove.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>“Moun Israël yo, koute pawòl sila yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:6">Trav 3:6</ref></char></note>Jésus, yon nonm Nazareth, ke Bondye te temwaye devan nou pa mirak, mèvèy, ak sign, ke Bondye te acheve nan Li nan mitan nou, jan nou menm byen konnen an, <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>nonm sila a, livre selon plan ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:22">Luc 22:22</ref></char></note>avan konesans Bondye, nou te kloue sou yon kwa pa men lèzòm san prensip Bondye yo, e te mete li a lanmò. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5">Mat 28:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:6">6</ref></char></note>Bondye te fè L leve ankò, e te mete fen a doulè lanmò a, paske se te enposib pou li ta kapab kenbe L.<verse eid="ACT 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>‘Paske David te di sou Li:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Sòm 16:8-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Mwen te toujou wè Senyè a devan fas mwen an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">paske Li sou men dwat mwen, pou m pa janm ebranle”.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Donk, kè m te kontan, e lang mwen te bay lwanj.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Anplis de sa, chè mwen va repoze nan espwa,<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:31">Trav 2:31</ref></char></note>Ou p ap abandone nanm mwen nan sejou mò yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">ni kite Sen Ou an sibi dekonpozisyon an.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Ou fè m konnen chemen lavi yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">Ou va ranpli m ak kè kontan avèk Prezans Ou.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>“Frè m yo, mwen kapab di nou avèk konfyans selon zansèt nou David, ke li te mouri, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:10">I Wa 2:10</ref></char></note>antere, e ke tonm li la avèk nou jiska jodi a. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Konsa, akoz ke li David te yon pwofèt, e te konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Sòm 132:11</ref></char></note>Bondye te sèmante a li menm yon pwomès pou fè youn nan desandan li yo chita sou twòn li an, <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>li te gade pi lwen e te pale sou rezirèksyon Kris la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:23">Mat 11:23</ref></char></note>ke ‘Li pa t ni abandone nan sejou mò yo, ni kite chè L dekonpoze.’ <verse eid="ACT 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Jésus sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>Bondye te fè leve ankò a, de sa, nou tout te temwen.<verse eid="ACT 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>“Konsa, akoz Li te leve wo rive kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:31">Trav 5:31</ref></char></note>men dwat Bondye, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Trav 1:4</ref></char></note>te resevwa nan Papa a, pwomès Lespri Sen an, li te fè vide sa ke nou wè, ak tande a.<verse eid="ACT 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>“Paske se pa t David ki te monte nan syèl la, men se te li menm ki di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sòm 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘SENYÈ a te di a Senyè m nan, chita bò dwat Mwen<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>Jiskaske M fè lènmi ou yo vin yon ti ban pou mete pye ou.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>“Donk, kite tout lakay Israël la konnen san dout ke Bondye fè Li ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:11">Luc 2:11</ref></char></note>Senyè, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:23">Trav 2:23</ref></char></note>Kris la —Jésus sila a ke nou te krisifye a.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Alò, lè yo te tande sa, yo te vin santi doulè jis nan kè yo, e te di a Pierre ak lòt apòt yo: “Frè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:10">Luc 3:10</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:15">15</ref></char></note>kisa pou nou ta fè?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Pierre te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mc 1:15</ref></char></note>“Repanti e ke chak en de nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:12">Trav 8:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 8:16">16</ref></char></note>batize nan non Jésus Kri pou padon a peche nou yo, e nou va resevwa don Lespri Sen an. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Paske pwomès la se pou nou, pou pitit nou yo, e pou tout sila ki byen lwen yo, ak tout kantite ke Senyè a, Bondye nou an va rele a Li menm.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Avèk anpil lòt pawòl li te temwaye solanèlman e te kontinye egzòte ak ankouraje yo, e te di: “Sove nou de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Det 32:5</ref></char></note>jenerasyon moun mechan sila a!”<verse eid="ACT 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Alò, sa yo ki te resevwa pawòl li yo te batize. E konsa, te vin ogmante nan menm jou a, a anviwon twa mil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:23">Trav 3:23</ref></char></note>nanm. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:14">Trav 1:14</ref></char></note>toujou dilijan nan swiv enstriksyon apòt yo ak nan amitye fratènèl, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:30">Luc 24:30</ref></char></note>nan kase pen, ak lapriyè.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Tout moun te kontinye sanse gen lakrent ak gran respè, e anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:22">Trav 2:22</ref></char></note>mèvèy ak sign te toujou ap fèt pa apòt yo.<verse eid="ACT 2:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Tout sila ki te kwè yo te ansanm, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32">Trav 4:32</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 4:37">37</ref></char></note>te mete tout byen yo ansanm: <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:21">Mat 19:21</ref></char></note>vann tè yo ak byen yo, e t ap pataje yo avèk tout moun, selon bezwen a yo chak. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:42">Trav 5:42</ref></char></note>De jou an jou yo t ap kontinye nan tanp lan avèk inite nan panse yo. Yo t ap kase pen de kay an kay, e te pran repa yo ansanm avèk lajwa ak senserite de kè. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Yo t ap bay Bondye lwanj, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:14">Trav 5:14</ref></char></note>gen bon relasyon avèk tout moun yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 2:47">Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:41">Trav 2:41</ref></char></note>ogmante de jou an jou sila ki t ap sove yo.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Alò, Pierre avèk Jean t ap monte nan tanp lan vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 55:17">Sòm 55:17</ref></char></note>nevyèm è, lè lapriyè.<verse eid="ACT 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Konsa, yon sèten mesye ki te bwate depi li sòti nan vant manm l t ap pote pa kèk lòt moun. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:20">Luc 16:20</ref></char></note>te konn mete l chak jou nan pòtay tanp lan ke yo rele Bel, kote li te konn mande charite a moun ki t ap antre nan tanp yo. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Lè l te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:8">Luc 22:8</ref></char></note>Pierre avèk Jean prèt pou antre nan tanp lan, li te mande yo lacharite.<verse eid="ACT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Pierre te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:4">Trav 10:4</ref></char></note>fikse zye yo sou li. Ansanm avèk Jean, li te di: “Gade nou!”<verse eid="ACT 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Konsa, li te kòmanse koute yo, anatandan pou yo bay li yon kichòy.<verse eid="ACT 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Men Pierre te di: “Nou pa gen lajan, ni lò, men sa ke mwen genyen an, m ap bay ou li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:22">Trav 2:22</ref></char></note>Nan non Jésus Kri de Nazarèt, mache!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Li te sezi li pa men dwat li pou fè l leve. Lapoula, janm li avèk pye l te vin pran fòs.<verse eid="ACT 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:10">Trav 14:10</ref></char></note>li te vòltije e te vin kanpe dwat e mache. Li te antre nan tanp lan avèk yo, li t ap mache e vòltije pandan li t ap bay lwanj a Bondye.<verse eid="ACT 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:16">Trav 4:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout pèp la te wè li t ap mache e bay Bondye lwanj. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Yo te rekonèt li kòm sila ki te konn chita devan tanp lan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:8">Jn 9:8</ref></char></note>nan pòt ki te rele Bel la, pou mande lacharite, e yo te etone e sezi pou sa ki te rive l la.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Pandan li t ap kenbe sou Pierre ak Jean, tout moun, byen etone, te kouri bò kote yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:23">Jn 10:23</ref></char></note>pòtay yo rele Salomon an.<verse eid="ACT 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Lè Pierre te wè sa, li te reponn a pèp la: “Moun Israël yo, poukisa nou sezi de sa oubyen poukisa nou fikse nou konsa, kòmsi se pa pwòp pouvwa nou oubyen sentete nou ke nou te fè l mache a?<verse eid="ACT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>“Bondye Abraham nan, Isaac, ak Jacob la, Bondye a zansèt nou yo, te bay glwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:26">Trav 3:26</ref></char></note>sèvitè Li a, Jésus Kri ke nou te livre ak nye nan prezans a Pilate lè li menm te byen deside pou lage L.<verse eid="ACT 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>“Men nou te nye Sila ki Sen e Jis la, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:20">Mat 27:20</ref></char></note>mande yo livre bannou yon asasen, <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>e te touye Prens Lavi a, sila menm ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>Bondye te fè leve soti nan lanmò a, de sila, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:48">Luc 24:48</ref></char></note>temwen.<verse eid="ACT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>“Konsa, sou baz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:6">Trav 3:6</ref></char></note>lafwa nan non Li, se non Jésus ki bay mesye sa a, ke nou wè e konnen an, fòs. Wi, se lafwa ki sòti nan Li ki bay mesye sila a sante pafè, nan prezans a nou tout.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>“E koulye a, frè yo, mwen konnen ke nou te aji <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:21">Jn 15:21</ref></char></note>nan inyorans, menm jan ke chèf nou yo te fè osi. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Men bagay ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:23">Trav 2:23</ref></char></note>Bondye te anonse oparavan yo, pa bouch a tout pwofèt yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:3">Trav 17:3</ref></char></note>ke Kris Li a ta soufri; konsa, Li gen tan fin akonpli.<verse eid="ACT 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>“Donk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">Trav 2:38</ref></char></note>repanti e retounen, pou peche nou yo kapab efase e pou tan rafrechisman yo kapab sòti nan prezans Senyè a; <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>epi pou Li kapab voye Jésus, Kris la ki te deziye pou nou avan lè, <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Li menm ke syèl la oblije resevwa jiskaske tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:11">Mat 17:11</ref></char></note>restorasyon tout bagay ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:70">Luc 1:70</ref></char></note>Bondye te pale pa bouch a pwofèt sen Li yo depi nan tan ansyen an.<verse eid="ACT 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>“Moïse te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note>‘Senyè Bondye a va fè leve pou nou yon pwofèt tankou mwen ki sòti nan frè nou yo. A Li menm, nou va prete atansyon a tout sa Li di nou. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Det 18:19</ref></char></note>E li va rive ke tout nanm ki pa okipe pwofèt sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:29">Lev 23:29</ref></char></note>va detwi nèt pami pèp la.’<verse eid="ACT 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>“Epi menm jan an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:27">Luc 24:27</ref></char></note>tout pwofèt ki pale, depi Samuel ak tout sila ki te swiv li yo, osi te anonse jou sa yo.<verse eid="ACT 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>“Se nou menm ki se fis a pwofèt yo, ak akò ke Bondye te fè avèk zansèt nou yo, lè yo te di Abraham: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Jen 22:18</ref></char></note>‘Nan posterite ou, tout fanmi sou latè yo va beni’.<verse eid="ACT 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>“ Bondye te leve sèvitè Li a, e Li te voye Li kote nou avan, pou beni nou lè l fè chak en de nou vire kite mechanste nou yo.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Pandan yo t ap pale ak pèp la, prèt avèk kaptenn gad tanp lan avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mc 12:18</ref></char></note>Sadiseyen yo te rive kote yo. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Yo te byen deranje paske yo t ap enstwi pèp la e t ap pwoklame <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:15">Trav 3:15</ref></char></note>nan non Jésus rezirèksyon a lanmò yo. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Yo te mete men sou yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:18">Trav 5:18</ref></char></note>mete yo nan prizon pou jis rive nan demen, paske li te gen tan fènwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Men anpil nan sila yo ki te tande mesaj la te kwè, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:41">Trav 2:41</ref></char></note>fòs kantite moun ki te kwè yo te vini toupre senk-mil.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Nan landemen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:13">Luc 23:13</ref></char></note>chèf yo, avèk ansyen ak skrib yo te reyini ansanm nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:2">Luc 3:2</ref></char></note>Anne, wo prèt la te la, avèk Caïphe, Jean, Alexandre, ak tout sila ki te desandan wo prèt yo. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Lè yo te kanpe yo nan mitan yo, yo te kòmanse mande yo: “Pa ki pouvwa, oswa nan ki non nou te fè sa a?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Alò, Pierre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>ranpli avèk Lespri Sen an, te di yo: “Chèf ak ansyen a pèp la, <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>Si nou parèt devan tribinal jodi a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:7">Trav 3:7</ref></char></note>benefis ki fèt a yon moun malad, kòmsi, kijan nonm sa a te fè geri, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>kite li byen konnen pami nou tout, ak tout Israël, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:22">Trav 2:22</ref></char></note>pa non a Jésus Kri, Nazareyen ke nou te krisifye a, ke Bondye te fè leve soti nan lanmò a, pa non de sila a menm, mesye sa a a kanpe devan nou an bòn sante. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>‘Se Li menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sòm 118:22</ref></char></note>wòch ki te rejte pa nou menm ki t ap bati yo, men ki vin fè wòch ang prensipal la.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>“Konsa, pa gen sali nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mat 1:21</ref></char></note>okenn lòt. Paske nanpwen lòt non anba syèl la ki bay pami lòm pa kilès nou dwe sove.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Alò, lè yo te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:31">Trav 4:31</ref></char></note>konfyans a Pierre avèk Jean, e te konprann ke yo pa t gen anpil edikasyon ni enstriksyon, yo te etone. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:15">Jn 7:15</ref></char></note>te rekonèt yo kon moun ki te avèk Jésus yo. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Epi lè yo te wè mesye ki te geri a te kanpe la avèk yo, yo pa t gen repons pou bay.<verse eid="ACT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Men lè yo fin mande yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:22">Mat 5:22</ref></char></note>kite konsèy la, yo te fè konferans ansanm. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>Yo te di: “Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:47">Jn 11:47</ref></char></note>kisa pou nou fè avèk mesye sa yo? Paske li byen klè a tout sila ki rete Jérusalem yo ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:7-10">Trav 3:7-10</ref></char></note>yon mirak byen enpòtan te fèt pa yo, e nou pa kapab di ke se pa vrè.<verse eid="ACT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>“Men pou sa pa rive pi lwen pami pèp la, annou avèti yo pou yo pa pale ankò a okenn moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:21">Jn 15:21</ref></char></note>nan non sila a.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Yo te rele yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:28">Trav 5:28</ref></char></note>kòmande yo pou yo pa pale ni enstwi menm nan non Jésus a.<verse eid="ACT 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Men Pierre avèk Jean te reponn yo e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:28">Trav 5:28</ref></char></note>“Si li bon devan Bondye pou obeyi a nou menm olye a Bondye, nou mèt jije. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:16">I Kwo 9:16</ref></char></note>nou menm, nou pa kapab sispann pale sa ke nou te wè ak tande.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Konsa, lè yo te fin menase yo anplis, yo te lage yo, paske yo pa t kapab twouve baz pou pini yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:26">Trav 5:26</ref></char></note>akoz perèz a pèp la, paske yo tout t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:8">Mat 9:8</ref></char></note>bay Bondye glwa pou sa ki te rive a. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Paske mesye a ki te resevwa mirak sila a, te gen plis ke karant ane.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Lè yo te fin lage yo, yo te ale bò kote moun pa yo, e te rapòte a tout moun sa ke chèf prèt yo avèk ansyen yo te di yo. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Lè yo te tande sa, yo te leve vwa yo a Bondye ansanm, e te di: “O Bondye, se te Ou menm ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Egz 20:11</ref></char></note>fè syèl la ak tè a, lanmè, ak tout sa ki ladann, <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:16">Trav 1:16</ref></char></note>pa Lespri Sen an, selon bouch a Zansèt nou David te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:1">Sòm 2:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Poukisa nasyon yo anraje konsa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">e poukisa pèp yo anvizaje yon bagay anven?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:2">Sòm 2:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wa sou latè yo ap pran pòz yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">e gwo chèf yo ap mete tèt yo ansanm kont Senyè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">ak kont Kris Li a.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>“Paske vrèman, nan vil sa a, yo te rasanble ansanm kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:13">Trav 3:13</ref></char></note>sèvitè sen Ou an, Jésus, ke ou menm te onksyone a; Hérode ak Ponce Pilate ansanm avèk nasyon payen yo ak pèp Israël la, <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>pou fè nenpòt bagay ke men Ou ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:23">Trav 2:23</ref></char></note>volonte Ou te deja planifye, pou fèt. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>E koulye a, Senyè, byen gade menas ke yo fè, e kite sèvitè ki mare ak Ou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:14">Fil 1:14</ref></char></note>pale pawòl Ou avèk tout konfyans, <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>pandan W ap lonje men Ou pou fè gerizon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:48">Jn 4:48</ref></char></note>sign ak mirak yo k ap fèt nan non a sèvitè Sen Ou an, Jésus.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Lè yo te fin priye, plas kote yo te reyini an te vin souke. Yo tout te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>ranpli avèk Lespri Sen an, e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:14">Fil 1:14</ref></char></note>pale pawòl Bondye a avèk kouraj.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Tout nan gran foul a ki te kwè yo te vin yon sèl nan kè ak nanm. Pa t gen youn nan yo ki te gen byen ki te reklame pou pwòp tèt yo, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:44">Trav 2:44</ref></char></note>tout bagay te pou tout moun. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Trav 1:8</ref></char></note>Avèk gran pouvwa, apòt yo t ap bay temwayaj a rezirèksyon Jésus Kris la, e lagras an abondans te vini sou yo tout. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Paske pa t gen yon moun pami yo ki te nan bezwen, pwiske sila ki te mèt tè yo oubyen kay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:21">Mat 19:21</ref></char></note>te vann yo e pote benefis a vant lan bay, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:37">Trav 4:37</ref></char></note>mete yo nan pye apòt yo. Konsa, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:45">Trav 2:45</ref></char></note>te distribiye a chak en ki te gen nenpòt bezwen.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Joseph, yon Levit ki te ne an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:4">Trav 13:4</ref></char></note>Chypre ke yo te rele osi Barnabas, pa apòt yo, ki vle di Fis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:23">Trav 11:23</ref></char></note>Ankourajman an <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>te gen yon mòso tè. Li te vann li e te pote kòb la mete l nan pye apòt yo.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Men yon sèten mesye ke yo te rele Ananias ak Saphira, madanm li, te vann yon moso tè. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Men li te kenbe yon pati nan pri a pou li menm, avèk konesans madanm li. Konsa, li te pote yon sèten pati, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:35">Trav 4:35</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 4:37">37</ref></char></note>mete l nan pye apòt yo.<verse eid="ACT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Men Pierre, te di: “Ananias, poukisa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref></char></note>Satan ranpli kè ou pou bay manti a Lespri Sen an e pou kenbe yon pati nan pri tè a an kachèt. <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Pandan li te rete pa t vann nan, èske li pa t nan men ou? E lè li te fin vann nan, èske li pa t toujou sou kontwòl pa w? Poukisa ou kalkile bagay sa a nan kè ou? Se pa a moun ke ou bay manti a, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:3">Trav 5:3</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 5:9">9</ref></char></note>a Bondye.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Ananias, lè l te tande bagay sa yo, te tonbe atè e te respire dènye souf li. Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:43">Trav 2:43</ref></char></note>gwo laperèz te vini sou tout sila ki te tande bagay sa yo.<verse eid="ACT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Jennjan yo te leve li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:40">Jn 19:40</ref></char></note>vlope li nan yon twal e te pote l deyò pou te antere l.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Nan anviwon twazèdtan, madanm li, san konnen sa ki te rive a, te antre.<verse eid="ACT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Pierre te di li: “Di m si ou te vann tè a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:2">Trav 5:2</ref></char></note>yon pri konsa?” Li te di: “Wi, pou yon pri konsa”.<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Alò, Pierre te di li: “Poukisa ke nou dakò ansanm pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:10">Trav 15:10</ref></char></note>tante Lespri Senyè a? Vwala, pye a sila ki te antere mari ou yo parèt nan pòt la, e yo va pote ou deyò a tou.”<verse eid="ACT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:13">Éz 11:13</ref></char></note>li te tonbe atè e te rann dènye souf li. Jennjan yo te antre, yo twouve li tou mouri e te pote l ale. Yo te antere li bò kote mari li.<verse eid="ACT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:43">Trav 2:43</ref></char></note>gwo laperèz te vin tonbe sou tout legliz la, e sou tout sila ki te tande bagay sa yo.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Pa men apòt yo, anpil sign ak mirak te fèt pami pèp la, e yo tout te an akò nan Galri Salomon an.<verse eid="ACT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Pou lòt yo, pa t gen pèsòn ki te gen kouraj pou vin jwenn avèk yo, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:47">Trav 2:47</ref></char></note>pèp la te bay yo lwanj. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Konsa, anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:15">II Kwo 6:15</ref></char></note>kwayan nan non Senyè a, yon fòs kantite gason avèk fi t ap ajoute tout tan pami yo. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Yo t ap menm pote malad yo e mete yo nan lari; yo te fè yo kouche sou kabann ak palèt, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:12">Trav 19:12</ref></char></note>menm yon ti kras lonbraj Pierre, lè l pase, ta kapab tonbe sou nenpòt nan yo.<verse eid="ACT 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Te vini osi foul ki te sòti nan vil ki te antoure Jérusalem yo, ki t ap pote moun malad, ak sila ki te twouble pa move Lespri yo, e yo tout te geri.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Men wo prèt la te vin leve, ak tout sila ki te avèk li yo (sa vle di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat 3:7</ref></char></note>Sadiseyen yo), e yo te jalou anpil. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Yo te mete men sou apòt yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:3">Trav 4:3</ref></char></note>mete yo nan yon prizon piblik.<verse eid="ACT 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:20">Mat 1:20</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 1:24">24</ref></char></note>yon zanj Bondye te ouvri pòt prizon an pandan lannwit, e te fè yo sòti, e te di: <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>“Ale, kanpe pale ak pèp la nan tanp lan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:63">Jn 6:63</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:68">68</ref></char></note>tout pawòl lavi a.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Lè yo te tande sa, yo te antre nan tanp lan granmmaten, e yo te kòmanse enstwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Men lè<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:6">Trav 4:6</ref></char></note>wo prèt la te vini, ansanm ak sila ki te avèk li yo, yo te reyini yon gran konsèy avèk tout ansyen Israël yo. Konsa yo te voye kote prizon an pou fè yo vini.<verse eid="ACT 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Men lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:58">Mat 26:58</ref></char></note>jandam yo te vini, yo te twouve ke yo pa t nan prizon an. Konsa yo te retounen pou te bay rapò a. <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>Yo te di: “Nou te twouve prizon an byen fèmen e byen sere avèk gad yo ki te kanpe devan pòt la, men lè nou te louvri li, nou pa twouve pèsòn ladann.”<verse eid="ACT 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Lè wo prèt la avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:1">Trav 4:1</ref></char></note>kaptenn kò gad tanp lan te tande sa, yo te vin enkyete pou kote pwoblèm sa a ta vin rive.<verse eid="ACT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Men yon moun te vin di yo: “Gade, mesye sa yo ke nou te mete nan prizon an kanpe nan tanp lan e y ap enstwi pèp la.”<verse eid="ACT 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Alò, yo te ale avèk kaptenn lan ak jandam yo, e te mennen yo vini san vyolans; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:21">Trav 4:21</ref></char></note>yo te krent pèp la, pou yo pa ta lapide yo avèk wòch.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Lè yo te mennen yo, yo te fè yo kanpe devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:22">Mat 5:22</ref></char></note>konsèy la pou wo prèt la kesyone yo. <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>Li te di yo konsa: “Èske nou pa t bay nou yon lòd byen klè pou nou pa kontinye enstwi nan non sila a? E malgre sa a, nou fin ranpli tout Jérusalem avèk enstriksyon nou yo, e nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23:35</ref></char></note>gen entansyon voye san mesye sa a sou nou”.<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Alò Pierre avèk apòt yo te reponn e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:19">Trav 4:19</ref></char></note>“Nou oblije obeyi a Bondye olye a lòm. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:13">Trav 3:13</ref></char></note>Bondye a zansèt nou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>te fè leve Jésus, ke nou te touye pann sou yon kwa a. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:33">Trav 2:33</ref></char></note>Se Li menm Bondye te fè leve wo kote men dwat Li, tankou yon Prens, e yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:11">Luc 2:11</ref></char></note>Sovè, pou bay a Israël repantans, ak padon pou peche yo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:48">Luc 24:48</ref></char></note>temwen a bagay sa yo; e anplis Lespri Sen an ke Bondye bay a sila ki obeyi Li yo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Lè yo te tande sa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:37">Trav 2:37</ref></char></note>byen blese, e te fè plan pou touye yo.<verse eid="ACT 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Alò, yon nonm nan konsèy la ke yo te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Trav 22:3</ref></char></note>Gamaliel te kanpe, yon pwofesè nan Lalwa ki te gen bon repitasyon pami tout pèp. Li te mande yo mete apot yo deyò pou yon moman.<verse eid="ACT 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Li te di yo: “Moun Israël yo, veye nou menm ak sa nou gen entansyon fè avèk mesye sila yo, <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Paske pa anpil jou avan sa, te leve yon Theudas ki t ap pretann li menm te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:9">Trav 8:9</ref></char></note>yon pèsonaj, epi yon gwoup kat-san òm te vin jwenn avèk li. Men yo te touye li, e tout sila ki te swiv li yo te vin gaye, e pa t reyalize anyen.<verse eid="ACT 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>“Apre mesye sila a, Judas, Galileyen an, te leve nan jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:2">Luc 2:2</ref></char></note>resansman an, e li te atire kèk moun dèyè l. Li menm tou te peri, e tout sila ki te swiv li yo te vin gaye.<verse eid="ACT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>“Donk, nan ka prezan an, mwen di nou, rete lwen de moun sa yo, e pa okipe yo, paske si plan oubyen aksyon sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:30">Mc 11:30</ref></char></note>sòti nan lòm, li va boulvèse. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Men si se nan Bondye, nou p ap kab boulvèse yo; sinon nou kab menm twouve ke n ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 21:30">Pwov 21:30</ref></char></note>goumen kont Bondye menm.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Yo te koute konsèy li. Apre yo te rele apòt yo antre, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:17">Mat 10:17</ref></char></note>bat yo avèk fwèt, e te kòmande yo pou yo pa pale nan non Jésus, e te lage yo.<verse eid="ACT 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Donk yo te kite konsèy la; yo te al fè wout yo, e t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">I Pi 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="1PE 4:16">16</ref></char></note>rejwi ke yo te konsidere dign pou soufri mepri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:21">Jn 15:21</ref></char></note>pou non Li.<verse eid="ACT 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:46">Trav 2:46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi chak jou nan tanp lan, sòti nan yon kay a yon lòt, yo te kontinye enstwi ak preche Jésus kòm Kris la.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Alò nan lè sa a pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>disip yo t ap vin ogmante plis, yon plenyen te vin leve nan pati a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:29">Trav 9:29</ref></char></note>Jwif Grèk yo kont Jwif natal yo, paske vèv pa yo te neglije nan separasyon manje chak jou a.<verse eid="ACT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Donk, douz yo te rele rasanble ak disip yo e te di: “Li pa bon pou nou neglije pawòl Bondye a pou nou sèvi tab yo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Konsa, frè yo, chwazi pami nou sèt mesye ak bon jan repitasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>ranpli ak Lespri a e ak sajès, pou nou kapab mete an chaj tach sila a. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Men nou menm nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:14">Trav 1:14</ref></char></note>dedye nou a lapriyè ak ministè a pawòl Bondye a.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Pawòl sila a te fè plezi a tout asanble a, e yo te chwazi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:8">Trav 6:8</ref></char></note>Étienne, yon nonm ranpli ak lafwa e ak Lespri Sen an, ak Philippe, Prochore, Nicanor, Timon, Parménas, epi Nicolas, yon konvèti nan relijyon a Jwif yo ki sòti Antioche. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Epi sila yo te mennen devan apòt yo, e lè yo te fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:24">Trav 1:24</ref></char></note>fè lapriyè, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 8:10">Nonb 8:10</ref></char></note>poze men sou yo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Pawòl Bondye a te kontinye gaye, e kantite disip yo te kontinye ogmante anpil nan Jérusalem, e yon gran nonb pami prèt yo t ap vin obeyisan a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:8">Trav 13:8</ref></char></note>lafwa a.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Epi Étienne, ranpli avèk gras ak pouvwa, te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:48">Jn 4:48</ref></char></note>mèvèy ak mirak pami pèp la.<verse eid="ACT 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Men kèk moun ki te sòti nan sa ke yo te rele Sinagòg Dèzòm Lib, ki te gen moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:32">Mat 27:32</ref></char></note>Sireneyen ak moun Alexandryen yo, e kèk moun Cilicie ak Asie, te leve pou diskite avèk Étienne. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Men yo pa t kapab fè fas avèk sajès ak Lespri ki t ap fè l pale a.<verse eid="ACT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Alò, an sekrè yo te fè moun yo di: “Nou tande li pale pawòl blasfèm kont Moïse ak kont Bondye”.<verse eid="ACT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Konsa, yo te soulve pèp la, ansyen yo ak skrib yo. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 20:1">Luc 20:1</ref></char></note>sezi li, e te trennen li pou mennen l devan konsèy la. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Yo te mete devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:59-61">Mat 26:59-61</ref></char></note>fo temwayaj ki te di: “Nonm sila a tout tan ap pale kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24:15</ref></char></note>lye sakre sila a, ak Lalwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Paske nou konn tande li di ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref></char></note>Nazareyen sila a, Jésus, va detwi plas sila a e chanje koutim ke Moïse te bannou yo.”<verse eid="ACT 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Konsa, yo tout nan konsèy la te fikse zye yo sou li, e yo te wè figi li tankou figi a yon zanj.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Wo prèt la te di: “Èske bagay sa yo se vrè?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Li te di: “Koute m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:42">Jn 8:42</ref></char></note>frè m yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Jen 11:31</ref></char></note>ansyen mwen yo!” Bondye laglwa a te parèt devan zansèt nou, Abraham lè li te nan Mésopotamie, avan ke li te rete Charran. <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>E Li te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Jen 12:1</ref></char></note>“Kite peyi ou, ak fanmi ou, pou vini nan peyi ke Mwen menm va montre ou a”.<verse eid="ACT 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 11:31">Jen 11:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, li te kite peyi a Kaldeyen yo pou vin rete nan Charran. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:4">Jen 12:4</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 12:5">5</ref></char></note>Depi la, lè papa l te vin mouri, Bondye te fè l deplase vin nan peyi sila a kote nou rete koulye a. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Men Li pa t ba li yon eritaj ladann, ni menm yon moso tè, men menm lè li pa t gen pitit, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Jen 12:7</ref></char></note>Li te pwomèt li ke Li ta ba li sa kòm yon posesyon, e a desandan aprè li yo.<verse eid="ACT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:15">Jen 13:15</ref></char></note>Bondye te pale konsa: Ke desandan li yo ta etranje nan yon peyi etranje, pou yo ta nan esklavaj e maltrete pandan kat-san lane. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>“Epi nenpòt nasyon ki ta mete yo nan esklavaj, Bondye te di: ‘Mwen Menm, Mwen va jije’, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Egz 3:12</ref></char></note>epi apre sa, yo va sòti la pou sèvi Mwen nan plas sila a.”<verse eid="ACT 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Jen 17:10</ref></char></note>te bay li akò sikonsizyon an, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">Jen 21:2-4</ref></char></note>Abraham te vin papa a Isaac, Li te sikonsi li nan uityèm jou a. Isaac te vin papa a Jacob, e Jacob a douz patriyach yo.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>Patriyach yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:11">Jen 37:11</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 37:28">28</ref></char></note>te vin jalou de Joseph e yo te vann li an Égypte. Men Bondye te avèk li <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>e Li te delivre li nan tout afliksyon li yo. Konsa li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:21">Jen 39:21</ref></char></note>te bay li favè avèk sajès devan Pharaon, wa Égypte la, e te fè li vin gouvènè sou Égypte, ak tout lakay li.<verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:54">Jen 41:54</ref></char></note>yon gwo grangou te parèt nan tout Égypte ak Canaan, avèk gwo mizè, e zansèt nou yo pa t kab twouve manje. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:2">Jen 42:2</ref></char></note>lè Jacob te tande ke te gen manje an Égypte, li te voye zansèt nou yo la pou premye fwa a.<verse eid="ACT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Nan dezyèm vizit la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1-4">Jen 45:1-4</ref></char></note>Joseph te fè frè l yo dekouvri ki moun li te ye, e<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:16">Jen 45:16</ref></char></note>fanmi Joseph te vin entwodwi a Pharaon. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9">Jen 45:9</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:17">17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:18">18</ref></char></note>Joseph te voye envite Jacob, papa li avèk tout fanmi li pou vin kote l. Te gen swasann-kenz moun antou.<verse eid="ACT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Jen 46:1-7</ref></char></note>Jacob te desann an Égypte e li menm avèk zansèt nou yo te mouri la. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Depi la kò yo te deplase retounen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:16">Jen 23:16</ref></char></note>Sichem, pou te antere yo nan tonm nan ke Abraham te achte pou yon sòm lajan nan men fis a Hémor an Sichem yo.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>Men pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Jen 15:13</ref></char></note>tan a pwomès ke Bondye te pwomèt a Abraham nan t ap pwoche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Egz 1:7</ref></char></note>pèp la te vin ogmante e te miltipliye an Égypte, <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:8">Egz 1:8</ref></char></note>Yon lòt wa te leve sou Égypte ki pa t konnen anyen de Joseph. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Se te li menm ki te sèvi gwo koken pou pran avantaj sou ras nou an, e maltrete zansèt nou pou yo ta kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:22">Egz 1:22</ref></char></note>fè zanfan pa nou yo pa t kab viv.<verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>Se te nan tan sila a ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Egz 2:2</ref></char></note>Moïse te ne. Li te byen bèl nan zye Bondye, e li te okipe pandan twa mwa lakay papa li. <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Epi lè l te abandonen, fi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:5">Egz 2:5</ref></char></note>Pharaon an te pran li e te nouri li kòm pwòp fis pa li. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Moïse te enstwi nan tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:30">I Wa 4:30</ref></char></note>konesans Ejipsyen an, e li te vin yon nonm byen fò nan pawòl ak nan zak.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>Men lè l t ap pwoche laj karant ane, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:1">Egz 2:1</ref></char></note>sa te antre nan tèt li pou vizite frè li yo, fis Israël yo.<verse eid="ACT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Konsa, lè l te wè youn nan yo byen maltrete, li te defann li, e te vanje pou sila ki te oprime a, e konsa, te touye Ejipsyen an. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Li te sipoze ke frè li yo te konprann ke Bondye t ap bay yo delivrans atravè li menm, men yo pa t konprann.<verse eid="ACT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:1">Egz 2:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Nan jou swivan an, li te parèt a yo menm pandan yo t ap goumen youn avèk lòt. Li te eseye rekonsilye yo nan lapè e te di: ‘Moun yo, se frè nou ye. Poukisa nou ap fè mal a youn lòt?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>“Men sila ki t ap fè frè l la mal la te bourade l e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Egz 2:14</ref></char></note>‘Kilès ki te fè ou yon chèf ak jij sou nou? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Egz 2:14</ref></char></note>Èske ou gen entansyon touye m menm jan ke ou te touye Ejipsyen an ayè a?’<verse eid="ACT 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>“Akoz pawòl sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:15">Egz 2:15</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 2:22">22</ref></char></note>Moïse te sove ale, e te vin yon etranje nan peyi Madian, kote li te vin papa a de fis.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>“Apre karant ane te pase, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1">Egz 3:1</ref></char></note>Yon zanj te parèt a li menm nan dezè Mòn Sinaï nan flanm a yon touf bwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Lè Moïse te wè l, li te etone de sa l te wè a. Lè l te pwoche pou gade pi pre, vwa Senyè a te vini sou li: <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Egz 3:6</ref></char></note>‘Mwen menm se Bondye a zansèt nou yo, Bondye Abraham nan, Isaac ak Jacob la’. Moïse te tranble avèk laperèz e pa t menm vle pran chans gade.<verse eid="ACT 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:5">Egz 3:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Men SENYÈ a te di l: ‘Retire sapat nan pye ou, paske lye kote ou kanpe a se tè sen. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Egz 3:7</ref></char></note>Mwen anverite wè soufrans pèp Mwen an an Égypte e tande plent yo, e Mwen gen tan vini desann pou delivre yo. Vini koulye a e Mwen va voye ou an Égypte.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>“Menm Moïse sila a ke yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Egz 2:14</ref></char></note>rejte lè yo te di: ‘Kilès ki te fè ou yon chèf e yon jij?’ Se sila a ke Bondye te voye pou li ta kapab non sèlman yon chèf, men yon liberatè avèk èd zanj ki te parèt kote li nan touf bwa a. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:41">Egz 12:41</ref></char></note>Mesye sila a te mennen yo sòti, e te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Egz 7:3</ref></char></note>mèvèy ak sign nan peyi Égypte, ak nan Lamè Wouj, epi pandan karant ane nan dezè a. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>Se te Moïse sila a ki te di a fis Israël yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note>‘Bondye va fè leve pou nou yon pwofèt tankou mwen ki sòti nan frè nou yo.’<verse eid="ACT 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>“Sa se li menm ki te nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:17">Egz 19:17</ref></char></note>asanble nan dezè a; ki te avèk zanj ki t ap pale avè l sou Mòn Sinaï a, e avèk zansèt nou yo, ki te te resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:47">Det 32:47</ref></char></note>pawòl vivan yo pou pase bannou.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>“Zansèt nou yo pa t dakò obeyisan a li menm, men yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:3">Nonb 14:3</ref></char></note>rejte l, e nan kè yo, yo te vire tounen an Égypte. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Egz 32:1</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 32:23">23</ref></char></note>Konsa yo di a Aaron: ‘Fè pou nou dye yo ki va ale devan nou. Paske Moïse sila a ki te mennen nou sòti an Égypte la, nou pa menm konnen kisa ki rive li.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Nan tan sa a yo te fè yon jenn bèf. Yo te pote yon sakrifis pou zidòl la, e yo t ap rejwi yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:20">Rev 19:20</ref></char></note>zèv a pwòp men yo.<verse eid="ACT 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>“Men Bondye te vire do Li, e te livre yo pou adore dye a zetwal syèl yo, jan sa ekri nan liv pwofèt yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:25">Am 5:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Se pa t a Mwen menm ke nou te ofri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">ofrann ak sakrifis</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">karant ane nan dezè a, O lakay Israël.<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:26">Am 5:26</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 5:27">27</ref></char>
    </note>Men nou te pran anplis, tabènak Moloch la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ak zetwal a dye Remphan an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">imaj ke nou te fè pou adore yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Pou sa a Mwen osi va retire nou jis rive lòtbò Babylone.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>“Zansèt nou yo te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:8-9">Egz 25:8-9</ref></char></note>tabènak temwayaj nan dezè a, menm jan ke Sila ki te pale avèk Moïse la te kòmande li pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Egz 25:40</ref></char></note>fè, selon modèl ke li te wè a.<verse eid="ACT 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>“Konsa, zansèt nou yo ki te resevwa li nan lè pa yo, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:49">Det 32:49</ref></char></note>pote li avèk Josué lè l te depouye nasyon ke Bondye te chase devan yo jis rive nan tan David la. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:8">II Sam 7:8</ref></char></note>David te twouve favè nan zye Bondye, e te mande pou li ta kapab jwenn yon mezon pou Bondye Jacob la abite. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Men se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">I Wa 6:1-38</ref></char></note>Salomon ki te bati yon kay pou Li.<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>“Poutan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:32">Luc 1:32</ref></char></note>Trè Wo a pa rete nan kay ki fèt pa men moun, jan pwofèt la di a:<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:49 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:2">És 66:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Syèl la se twòn Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">E tè a se ban pou pye Mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ki kalite kay ou kapab fè pou Mwen?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">‘Oubyen ki plas ki gen pou repo Mwen?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Se pa t men Mwen ki te fè tout bagay sa yo?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>“Nou menm, ki se moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:9">Egz 32:9</ref></char></note>kou rèd e ensikonsi nan kè, avèk zòrèy ki toujou ap reziste a Lespri Sen an, n ap fè menm bagay ke zansèt nou yo te konn fè yo. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:1">II Kwo 36:1</ref></char></note>Kilès nan pwofèt yo ke zansèt nou yo pa t pèsekite? Yo te touye sila yo ki avan lè te anonse ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:14">Trav 3:14</ref></char></note>Sila Ki Jis la t ap vini; ke nou menm koulye a trayi e asasine. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Nou menm ki te resevwa Lalwa kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:2">Det 33:2</ref></char></note>òdonans pa zanj yo, te vyole li.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Alò, lè yo te tande sa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:33">Trav 5:33</ref></char></note>blese byen fon, e t ap manje dan yo sou li.<verse eid="ACT 7:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>ranpli avèk Lespri Sen an, li te fikse zye l anwo nan syèl la e te wè glwa Bondye ak Jésus ki t ap kanpe bò men dwat Bondye. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Li te di: “Gade byen, Mwen wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Jn 1:51</ref></char></note>syèl la vin louvri, e Fis a lòm nan ki kanpe bò men dwat Bondye.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Konsa yo te kriye fò avèk yon gwo vwa, e te kouvri zòrèy yo. Yo te kouri sou li ansanm a lafwa, <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>e lè yo te fin pouse li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:14-16">Lev 24:14-16</ref></char></note>deyò vil la, yo te kòmanse lapide l avèk wòch. Temwen sila yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:20">Trav 22:20</ref></char></note>depoze vètman yo nan pye a yon jennonm yo te rele Saul.<verse eid="ACT 7:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Yo te kontinye lapide Étienne pandan li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:21">Trav 9:21</ref></char></note>rele Senyè a, e te di: “Senyè Jésus, resevwa Lespri mwen”. <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:41">Luc 22:41</ref></char></note>li te tonbe sou jenou li, e te kriye avèk yon gwo vwa: “Senyè, pa kenbe peche sa a kont yo!” Lè l fin di sa, li te mouri.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Saul te fin dakò nèt ak lanmò li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Depi nan jou sa a, yon gran pèsekisyon te kòmanse kont legliz la nan Jérusalem. Yo tout, sof ke apòt yo, te gaye toupatou nan rejyon Juda avèk Samarie yo. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Kèk moun fidèl te antere Étienne. Yo te fè yon gwo lamantasyon sou li.<verse eid="ACT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1">Trav 9:1</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:21">21</ref></char></note>Saul te kòmanse ravaje legliz la. Li t ap antre de kay an kay pou rale fè sòti ni fanm, ni gason pou mete yo nan prizon.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:1">Trav 8:1</ref></char></note>sila ki t ap gaye konsa yo, te ale toupatou e te preche pawòl la.<verse eid="ACT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 6">Trav 6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Philippe te desann nan vil Samarie. Li te kòmanse preche Kris la bay yo.<verse eid="ACT 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Foul la avèk yon sèl panse t ap bay atansyon yo a sa ke Philippe te di yo, paske yo te wè e te tande mèvèy ke li t ap fè yo. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Paske nan ka anpil moun ki te genyen lespri enpi yo, lespri yo t ap sòti nan yo. Yo te sòti pandan yo t ap rele avèk yon gwo vwa, e anpil moun ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:24">Mat 4:24</ref></char></note>paralize e bwate te geri. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Donk, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:40-42">Jn 4:40-42</ref></char></note>anpil moun ki t ap rejwi nan vil sila a.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Alò, te gen yon nonm yo te rele Simon, ki te konn pratike <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:11">Trav 8:11</ref></char></note>maji nan vil la. Li t ap fè pèp Samarie a sezi, konsi li t ap vante tèt li, ke li menm te yon moun pwisan.<verse eid="ACT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Konsa, yo tout, soti nan pi piti jiska pi gran, te ba li anpil atansyon, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:11">Trav 14:11</ref></char></note>“Mesye sila a se li ke yo rele Gran Pouvwa Bondye a.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Yo te koute li, paske pandan anpil tan li te konn etone yo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:9">Trav 8:9</ref></char></note>metye maji sila a.<verse eid="ACT 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Men lè yo te kwè Philippe ki t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Trav 1:3</ref></char></note>preche bòn nouvèl wayòm Bondye a nan non Jésus Kris la, yo t ap batize; fanm, kou gason menm jan an. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Menm Simon te vin kwè, epi apre li te batize li te kontinye avèk Philippe. Akoz li te wè anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:6">Trav 8:6</ref></char></note>sign ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:11">Trav 19:11</ref></char></note>mirak ki t ap fèt, li te etone tout tan.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:1">Trav 8:1</ref></char></note>apòt nan Jérusalem yo te tande ke Samarie te resevwa pawòl Bondye a, yo te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:8">Luc 22:8</ref></char></note>Pierre avèk Jean bay yo. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Lè yo te vin desann, yo te priye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">Trav 2:38</ref></char></note>pou yo ta kapab resevwa Lespri Sen an. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Paske Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28:19</ref></char></note>potko tonbe sou okenn nan yo. Yo te sèlman batize nan non Senyè a Jésus. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Alò, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:6">Trav 6:6</ref></char></note>mete men sou yo, epi yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>resevwa Lespri Sen an.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Koulye a, lè Simon te wè ke Lespri a te bay lè apòt yo te poze men sou moun yo, li menm te ofri yo lajan. <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>Li te di: “Ban mwen otorite sila a osi, pou tout sila ke m poze men m sou yo kapab resevwa Lespri Sen an.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Men Pierre te di li: “Ke lajan ou an peri avè w, paske ou te panse ke ou ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:16">II Wa 5:16</ref></char></note>vin genyen don Bondye a avèk lajan. <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Ou pa gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:9">Det 10:9</ref></char></note>ni pati ni plas nan bagay sa a, paske kè ou pa dwat devan Bondye. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Pou sa, repanti de mechanste ou, e priye Senyè a pou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:7">És 55:7</ref></char></note>si posib, entansyon kè ou kapab vin padone. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Paske mwen wè ke ou nan fyèl anmè e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:6">És 58:6</ref></char></note>mare nan inikite.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Men Simon te reponn e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:7">Jen 20:7</ref></char></note>“Priye a Senyè a pou mwen, nou menm, pou anyen nan sa nou di yo pa vin rive m.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Alò, lè yo te fin temwaye solanèlman, e te pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:12">Trav 13:12</ref></char></note>pawòl Senyè a, yo te fè wout yo pou retounen Jérusalem. Konsa, tou, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:40">Trav 8:40</ref></char></note>preche bòn nouvèl la nan anpil vilaj Samariten.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:19">Trav 5:19</ref></char></note>yon zanj Senyè a te pale ak Philippe e te di: “Leve, ale nan sid nan wout ki desann soti Jérusalem vè Gaza a.” (Sa se yon wout nan dezè.)<verse eid="ACT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Konsa, li te leve ale, epi konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:31">Sòm 68:31</ref></char></note>te gen yon lenik Etyopyen, yon ofisye atache a Candace, larèn Etyopyen yo. Li te an chaj tout trezò li, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:41">I Wa 8:41</ref></char></note>te la nan Jérusalem pou adore Bondye. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Li t ap retounen, epi pandan li chita nan cha li, li t ap li liv pwofèt Ésaïe a.<verse eid="ACT 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:39">Trav 8:39</ref></char></note>Lespri a te di Philippe: “Ale jwenn cha sila a”.<verse eid="ACT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Philippe te kouri kote li. Konsa, li te tande ke li t ap li Ésaïe pwofèt la, epi li te mande l: “Èske ou konprann sa w ap li a?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Li te reponn: “Kijan mwen ta kapab, amwenske yon moun gide m?” Li te envite Philippe monte chita avè l.<verse eid="ACT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Alò, pòsyon lekriti li t ap li a se te sila a:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">És 53:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Li te mennen kon yon mouton nan labatwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Kon yon jenn mouton an silans</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">devan sa k ap taye lenn sou do l,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">li pa t louvri bouch li.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:8">És 53:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan imilyasyon, jistis li te rachte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Kilès ki va deklare a jenerasyon pa L la?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Paske vi Li retire sou tè a.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Lenik lan te reponn Philippe e te di: “Silvouplè, a kilès pwofèt la ap di sa a? A li menm, oubyen a yon lòt?”<verse eid="ACT 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Alò, Philippe te louvri bouch li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:27">Luc 24:27</ref></char></note>kòmanse soti nan lekriti sen sila a, li te preche Jésus a li menm.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Pandan yo t ap prale nan wout la, yo te vin toupre yon dlo. Konsa, linik lan te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:47">Trav 10:47</ref></char></note>“Men gade, dlo! Kisa ki anpeche m ta batize.” <verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Philippe te reponn: “Si ou kwè avèk tout kè ou, ou kapab.” Li te reponn e te di: “Mwen kwè ke Jésus Kris se Fis Bondye a.” <verse eid="ACT 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Li te kòmande cha a rete. Yo tou de te desann nan dlo a, Philippe avèk lenik lan, e li te batize li.<verse eid="ACT 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Lè yo te sòti nan dlo a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:12">I Wa 18:12</ref></char></note>Lespri Senyè a te vin pran Philippe, e lenik lan pa t wè l ankò, men te kontinye wout li ak rejwisans.<verse eid="ACT 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Men Philippe te twouve li menm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:22">Jos 11:22</ref></char></note>Azot. Pandan li t ap travèse, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:25">Trav 8:25</ref></char></note>kontinye preche bòn nouvèl la nan tout vil yo jiskaske li te rive Césarée.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:1-22">Trav 9:1-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Saul, toujou t ap respire menas ak asasina kont disip a Senyè yo, jis li rive devan wo prèt la. <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Li te mande li bay li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:14">Trav 9:14</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:21">21</ref></char></note>lèt a sinagòg Damas yo pou si li te twouve nenpòt moun ki nan Chemen an, fanm kou gason, li ta kapab mennen yo mare a Jérusalem.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Pandan li t ap fè wout la, li rive ke li t ap pwoche Damas, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:8">I Kwo 15:8</ref></char></note>sibitman, yon gran limyè ki sòti nan syèl la te klere tout ozanviwon li. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:7">Trav 22:7</ref></char></note>Li te tonbe atè e te tande yon vwa ki t ap di l: <char style="wj">“Saul, Saul, poukisa w ap pèsekite M?” </char><verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Li reponn: “Kilès Ou ye, Senyè?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Li te di: <char style="wj">“Mwen se Jésus ke w ap pèsekite a.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/><char style="wj">Men leve, antre nan vil la, e </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:16">Trav 9:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ou va tande kisa ou dwe fè.” </char><verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Mesye ki te vwayaje avè l yo te kanpe san di anyen. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:29">Jn 12:29</ref></char></note>te tande vwa a, men yo pa t wè pèsòn.<verse eid="ACT 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Saul te leve atè a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:18">Trav 9:18</ref></char></note>malgre zye li te louvri, li pa t kab wè anyen. Yo te mennen li pa lamen, e te fè l rive Damas. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Li pa t kab wè pandan twa jou, ni li pa t manje, ni bwè.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Alò, te gen yon disip nan Damas ke yo te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:12">Trav 22:12</ref></char></note>Ananias. Senyè a te di l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:3">Trav 10:3</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 10:17">17</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 10:19">19</ref></char></note>nan yon vizyon: “Ananias!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Li te reponn: “Men mwen, Senyè.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Senyè a te di li: <char style="wj">“Leve ale nan ri ke yo rele Dwat la, e mande lakay Judas, pou yon mesye </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:30">Trav 9:30</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Tarse ke yo rele Saul. Paske, gade byen, l ap priye.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/><char style="wj">Li gen tan wè deja nan yon vizyon yon mesye ke yo rele Ananias antre pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:23">Mc 5:23</ref></char></note><char style="wj">poze men l sou li, pou l wè ankò.” </char><verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Men Ananias te reponn: “Senyè, mwen tande de anpil moun sou mesye sila a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Trav 8:3</ref></char></note>kijan li te fè sen ou yo mal Jérusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Isit la menm, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:2">Trav 9:2</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:21">21</ref></char></note>gen otorite ki sòti nan chèf prèt yo pou mare tout sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:59">Trav 7:59</ref></char></note>rele Non Ou yo.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Men Senyè a te di li: “Ale paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:2">Trav 13:2</ref></char></note>li menm se yon enstriman ki chwazi pa Mwen pou pote non Mwen devan etranje, wa yo, ak fis Israël yo. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:23">Trav 20:23</ref></char></note>Mwen va montre li konbyen li oblije soufri pou non Mwen.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Konsa, Ananias te sòti. Li te antre nan kay la, e lè l fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>poze men l sou li, li te di: “Frè Saul, Senyè Jésus a ki te parèt devan ou nan wout la lè ou t ap vini an, Li voye m pou ou kapab wè ankò e pou ou kapab ranpli avèk Lespri Sen an.”<verse eid="ACT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Imedyatman bagay tankou kal te sòti tonbe nan zye li, e li vin wè ankò. Li te leve e te batize. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Li te pran manje e te reprann fòs li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Alò, pandan kèk jou, li te avèk disip ki te Damas yo. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Epi imedyatman, li te kòmanse pwoklame Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:5">Trav 13:5</ref></char></note>nan sinagòg yo e t ap di: “Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:33">Trav 13:33</ref></char></note>Fis Bondye a”.<verse eid="ACT 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Tout sila ki t ap tande li yo te etone tout tan, e t ap di: “Èske sa se pa sila ki nan Jérusalem te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Trav 8:3</ref></char></note>detwi sila yo ki te envoke non sa a, e ki te vini isit la ekspre pou mennen yo mare devan chèf prèt yo?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Men Saul te kontinye ap vin pi fò, e t ap konfonn Jwif ki te rete Damas yo avèk prèv ke Jésus sila a se Kris la.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:17">Gal 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="GAL 1:18">18</ref></char></note>anpil jou te fin pase, Jwif yo te fè konplo ansanm pou yo ta touye li, <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>men konplo yo te vin konnen pa Saul. Yo te veye pòtay yo lajounen kon lannwit pou yo ta kapab mete l a lanmò.<verse eid="ACT 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Men disip li yo te pran li nan lannwit, e yo te fè l desann sou miray la nan yon gwo panyen.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:17-20">Trav 22:17-20</ref></char></note>lè Saul te vini Jérusalem, li te eseye pran kontak avèk disip yo, men yo te pè l. Yo pa t kwè ke li te yon disip.<verse eid="ACT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref></char></note>Barnabas te pran li e te mennen l devan apòt yo. Paul te eksplike yo kijan li te wè Senyè a sou wout la. Ke Li te pale avèk li, epi kijan nan Damas li te pale avèk kouraj nan non Jésus.<verse eid="ACT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Li te avèk yo pou antre nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Li t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:13">Trav 4:13</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 4:29">29</ref></char></note>pale avèk anpil kouraj nan non Senyè a. Li t ap pale e diskite avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:1">Trav 6:1</ref></char></note>Jwif Grèk yo men yo t ap eseye mete l a lanmò. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Men lè tout frè yo te vin konprann sa, yo te mennen li desann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:40">Trav 8:40</ref></char></note>Césarée, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:21">Gal 1:21</ref></char></note>te voye li ale Tarse.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Donk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:11">Trav 5:11</ref></char></note>legliz la nan tout Juda, Galilée, ak Samarie te vin gen lapè, e te vin fò. Yo te kontinye nan lakrent Senyè a, ak rekonfò Lespri Sen an, e te kontinye grandi.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Alò pandan Pierre t ap vwayaje nan rejyon sa yo, li te desann osi bò kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:13">Trav 9:13</ref></char></note>fidèl ki te rete nan Lydde yo. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>La li te twouve yon sèten mesye ke yo te rele Enée, ki pa t kab leve sou kabann li depi uit ane, paske li te paralize.<verse eid="ACT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Pierre te di li: “Enée, Jésus Kri geri ou. Leve e fè kabann ou.” Nan menm enstan li te leve.<verse eid="ACT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Tout moun ki te rete nan Lydde ak Saron yo te wè l, e yo te vire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:47">Trav 2:47</ref></char></note>vè Senyè a.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Alò, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:46">Jos 19:46</ref></char></note>Joppé te gen yon sèten disip ke yo te rele Tabitha (ki tradwi an Grèk kon Dorcas). Fanm sa a te ranpli avèk zèv konpasyon ak charite ke li t ap fè tout tan. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Li te rive nan lè sa a ke fanm sila a te tonbe malad e te mouri. Lè yo te lave kò li, yo te fè l kouche nan yon chanm anlè. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Lydde te toupre Joppé, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>disip yo te tande Pierre te la. Konsa yo te voye de mesye bò kote li pou sipliye l: “Pa fè reta! Vin kote nou”!<verse eid="ACT 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Pierre te leve e te ale avèk yo. E lè l vini, yo te mennen li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:13">Trav 1:13</ref></char></note>chanm anlè a. Tout vèv yo te kanpe bò kote li e t ap kriye. Yo te montre li tout vètman ak rad ke Dorcas te konn fè lè l te avèk yo.<verse eid="ACT 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Men Pierre te voye yo tout deyò, e te mete l sou jenou l pou l priye, e pandan l ap vire bò kote kò a, li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:41">Mc 5:41</ref></char></note>“Tabitha, leve.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:40">Li te louvri zye li, e lè l te wè Pierre, li te chita.<verse eid="ACT 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Li te bay li men li e te fè l leve. Konsa Pierre te rele tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:13">Trav 9:13</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:32">32</ref></char></note>fidèl yo avèk vèv yo e li te prezante li vivan.<verse eid="ACT 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Sa te vin konnen toupatou nan Joppé, e<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:35">Trav 9:35</ref></char></note>anpil moun te kwè nan Senyè a.<verse eid="ACT 9:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Apre sa li te rete anpil jou nan Joppé avèk yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:6">Trav 10:6</ref></char></note>bòs tanè ke yo rele Simon.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Alò, te gen yon sèten nonm nan Césarée ke yo te rele Corneille, yon santenye nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:40">Trav 8:40</ref></char></note>kowòt Italyen an. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Li te yon mesye fidèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:22">Trav 10:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 10:35">35</ref></char></note>ki te gen lakrent Bondye avèk tout lakay li, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:4">Luc 7:4</ref></char></note>bay anpil charite a pèp Jwif la, e li te priye Bondye kontinyèlman.<verse eid="ACT 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Anviwon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:1">Trav 3:1</ref></char></note>nevyèm è nan jounen an, li te wè byen klè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:10">Trav 9:10</ref></char></note>nan yon vizyon, yon zanj Bondye ki te vin kote li e te di l: “Corneille!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Ak zye l fikse sou li, e gwo laperèz, e te di: “Kisa li ye, Senyè?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Zanj la te di li: “Priyè ou avèk charite ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:10">Eb 6:10</ref></char></note>kon yon rekèt, gen tan monte devan Bondye. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Koulye a, voye kèk moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:36">Trav 9:36</ref></char></note>Joppé e mande pou yon mesye yo rele Simon, ki rele osi Pierre. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Li rete lakay a yon bòs tanè yo rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:43">Trav 9:43</ref></char></note>Simon ki rete bò lanmè a.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Lè zanj ki t ap pale avè l la te ale, li te rele de nan sèvitè li yo, avèk yon sòlda fidèl nan lafwa ki te sèvi li tout tan. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Lè l te fin eksplike yo tout bagay, li te voye yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:36">Trav 9:36</ref></char></note>Joppé.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Nan jou apre a, pandan yo te nan chemen yo, ap pwoche vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:9-32">Trav 10:9-32</ref></char></note>Pierre te ale sou do kay la nan anviwon sizyèm è pou priye. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Men li te vin grangou, e li te vle manje. Men pandan yo t ap fè preparasyon an, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:5">Trav 11:5</ref></char></note>tonbe nan yon rèv. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Konsa, li te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Jn 1:51</ref></char></note>syèl la louvri, epi yon bagay tankou yon gwo dra te lonje desann bò kat kwen li yo jiska atè. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Ladann l te gen tout kalite bèt kat pye ak kreyati ki rale atè ak zwazo syèl yo. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Yon vwa te vini sou li: “Leve, Pierre, touye e manje!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Men Pierre te di: “Sa p ap janm fèt, Senyè, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:20-25">Lev 11:20-25</ref></char></note>Mwen pa janm manje anyen ki pa sen e pwòp.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Ankò yon vwa te vini a li menm, pou dezyèm fwa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:11">Mat 15:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Sa ke Bondye gen tan fè pwòp, pa konsidere l ankò pa sen.”</char><verse eid="ACT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Sa te rive twa fwa; epi imedyatman, bagay la te vin remonte nan syèl la.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Alò, Pierre te byen twouble nan lespri li sou sa vizyon li te wè te siyifi a. Epi konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:8">Trav 10:8</ref></char></note>mesye ki te voye pa Corneille yo, lè yo te fin mande tout direksyon pou kay Simon, te parèt nan pòtay la. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Yo te rele anlè, pou mande si Simon, ke yo rele osi Pierre a te rete la.<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Pandan Pierre t ap reflechi sou vizyon an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:29">Trav 8:29</ref></char></note>Lespri a te di l: “Gade, gen twa mesye k ap chache ou. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Alò, leve desann eskalye a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:7-9">Trav 15:7-9</ref></char></note>akonpanye yo san doute anyen. Paske se Mwen menm ki voye yo.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Pierre te desann vè moun yo. Li te di yo: “Se mwen menm nou ap chache a. Se pou ki rezon nou vini an?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Yo te di: “Corneille, yon sòlda santenye, yon nonm dwat e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:2">Trav 10:2</ref></char></note>ki krent Bondye, e ki byen pale pa tout nasyon Jwif la, te dirije pa yon zanj pou voye kote ou pou vini lakay li pou tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:14">Trav 11:14</ref></char></note>yon mesaj de ou menm.”<verse eid="ACT 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Konsa, li te envite yo antre, e li te bay yo lojman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Nan jou swivan a, li te leve. Li te sòti avèk yo, e kèk nan frè Joppé yo te akonpanye li.<verse eid="ACT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Nan youn jou pi tà, li te antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:40">Trav 8:40</ref></char></note>Césarée.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:24">Alò, Corneille t ap tann yo. Li te rele ansanm fanmi ak zanmi ki pwòch li yo. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Lè Pierre te antre, Corneille te rankontre li, e te tonbe nan pye li pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:2">Mat 8:2</ref></char></note>adore li.<verse eid="ACT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Men Pierre te leve l e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:15">Trav 14:15</ref></char></note>“Kanpe non, mwen menm se sèlman yon moun.”<verse eid="ACT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Pandan li t ap pale avèk li, li te antre, e te twouve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:24">Trav 10:24</ref></char></note>anpil moun deja reyini. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Pierre te di yo: “Nou menm nou konnen kijan sa kont lalwa pou yon nonm ki se yon Jwif vin asosye avèk yon etranje, ni pou vizitè li. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:14">Trav 10:14</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 10:35">35</ref></char></note>Bondye te deja montre m ke mwen pa dwe rele pèsòn pa sen oubyen pa pwòp. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Se pou rezon sa ke m te vini menm san okenn objeksyon lè yo te fè mwen vini an. Konsa, mwen mande pou ki sa nou fè mwen vini an?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Corneille te di: “Kat jou pase jis nan menm lè sa a, mwen t ap fè jèn e priye lakay mwen nan nevyèm è a; epi vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:3-6">Trav 10:3-6</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 10:30-32">30-32</ref></char></note>yon nonm te kanpe devan mwen avèk vètman ki t ap briye. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>Li te di: ‘Corneille, priyè ou gen tan tande e ofrann ou yo gen tan sonje devan Bondye. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Pou sa, voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:9">Jn 4:9</ref></char></note>Joppé pou envite Simon, ke yo rele osi Pierre, pou vin kote nou. Li rete lakay Simon, ki se bòs tanè bò lanmè a.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Pou sa, mwen te fè ou vin touswit, e ou tèlman emab, ke ou vini. Alò, koulye a, nou tout isit la, prezan devan Bondye pou tande tout sa ke ou kòmande pa Senyè a.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:2">Mat 5:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè l louvri bouch li, Pierre te di: “Vrèman, mwen konprann koulye a, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Det 10:17</ref></char></note>Bondye se pa youn ki fè patipri pou pèsòn, <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>men nan tout nasyon yo, sila a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:2">Trav 10:2</ref></char></note>gen lakrent Li, e ki fè sa ki bon, byen resevwa devan Li menm. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Pawòl ke Li te voye a fis Israël yo, pou preche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:17">Ef 2:17</ref></char></note>lapè atravè Jésus Kri a—Ke Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:12">Wo 10:12</ref></char></note>Senyè a tout moun.<verse eid="ACT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>“Nou menm nou konnen bagay ki te pase nan tout Judée a, ki te kòmanse nan Galilée, apre batèm ke Jean te pwoklame a; <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>sou Jésus de Nazareth la, jan Bondye te bay li onksyon avèk Lespri Sen an, e avèk pwisans, Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note>te ale toupatou e t ap fè byen, jan Li te geri tout moun ki te oprime pa dyab la, paske Bondye te avè L.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>“Nou se temwen a tout bagay ke Li te fè nan peyi Jwif yo, ak nan Jérusalem. Anplis yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:30">Trav 5:30</ref></char></note>mete Li a lanmò lè yo te pann Li sou yon kwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>Bondye te fè l leve nan twazyèm jou a, e te pèmèt ke Li te vin vizib <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:19">Jn 14:19</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 14:22">22</ref></char></note>pa a tout pèp la, men a temwen ki te chwazi oparavan pa Bondye yo; a nou menm ki te manje e bwè avèk Li apre Li te leve soti nan lanmò a. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Konsa, Li te kòmande nou pou preche a pèp la, epi solanèlman, temwaye ke Li se Sila a ki te nome pa Bondye, kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:22">Jn 5:22</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 5:27">27</ref></char></note>Jij a vivan e a mò yo.<verse eid="ACT 10:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>“A Li menm, tout pwofèt yo pote temwayaj, ke selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:47">Luc 24:47</ref></char></note>non Li tout moun ki kwè nan Li resevwa padon pou peche yo.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Pandan Pierre te toujou ap pale pawòl sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:15">Trav 11:15</ref></char></note>Lespri Sen an te tonbe sou tout sila yo ki t ap koute mesaj la.<verse eid="ACT 10:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 10:23">Trav 10:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout kwayan sikonsi ki te vini avèk Pierre yo te etone paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:33">Trav 2:33</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 2:38">38</ref></char></note>don Lespri Sen an te vèse sou etranje yo tou. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Paske yo te tande yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>pale an lang, e egzalte Bondye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Alò, Pierre te reponn: <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:36">Trav 8:36</ref></char></note>“Èske pèsòn kapab refize dlo pou sa yo ta kapab batize, sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>ki te resevwa Lespri Sen an, menm jan ak nou?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Epi li te kòmande yo pou batize <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">Trav 2:38</ref></char></note>nan non Jésus Kri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:48">Alò, yo te mande li pou rete la avèk yo pandan kèk jou.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Alò, apòt yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:15">Trav 1:15</ref></char></note>frè fidèl yo ki te nan tout Judée te tande ke pèp etranje yo osi te resevwa pawòl Bondye a. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Men lè Pierre te vin monte Jérusalem, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:45">Trav 10:45</ref></char></note>sila ki te sikonsi yo te vin pa dakò avèk li. <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>Yo t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:11">Mat 9:11</ref></char></note>“Ou te ale kote moun ensikonsi yo, e te manje avèk yo.”<verse eid="ACT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Konsa, Pierre te kòmanse eksplike yo istwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luc 1:3</ref></char></note>nan lòd ke tout bagay te rive yo. Li te di: <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:9-32">Trav 10:9-32</ref></char></note>“Mwen te nan vil Joppé, e mwen te nan lapriyè. Nan yon pwofon somèy mwen te fè yon vizyon; yon sèten objè ki te vin desann kon yon gwo dra ki kenbe nan kat kwen soti nan syèl la, e li te vini tou dwat devan mwen. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Lè m te fikse zye m sou li, e t ap gade l, mwen te wè bèt latè a kat pye, bèt sovaj, reptil, ak zwazo syèl yo. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Konsa, mwen te tande yon vwa ki te di m: <char style="wj">‘Leve Pierre; touye e manje.’ </char><verse eid="ACT 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>“Men mwen te di: ‘Non Senyè, paske anyen ki pa sen, oswa ki pa pwòp pa janm antre nan bouch mwen.’<verse eid="ACT 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>“Men yon vwa ki soti nan syèl la te reponn yon dezyèm fwa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:15">Trav 10:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Sa ke Bondye fè pwòp, pa konsidere l ankò pa sen.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Sa te fèt twa fwa, epi tout bagay yo te rale monte ankò nan syèl la.<verse eid="ACT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>“Epi gade byen, nan moman sa a, twa mesye ki te voye kote mwen sòti Césarée, te parèt devan kay la kote nou te rete a.<verse eid="ACT 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>“Lespri a te di m ale avèk yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:9">Trav 15:9</ref></char></note>san krent. Sis frè sila yo osi te ale avè m, e nou te antre nan kay mesye a.<verse eid="ACT 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>“Epi li te rapòte kijan li te wè zanj lan kanpe lakay li a, e te di: ‘Voye Joppé pou fè Simon, ke yo rele osi Pierre, vin isit la. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Li va pale nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:22">Trav 10:22</ref></char></note>pawòl yo. Ak yo menm nou va sove, nou menm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:53">Jn 4:53</ref></char></note>tout lakay nou.’<verse eid="ACT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>“Epi lè mwen te kòmanse pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44">Trav 10:44</ref></char></note>Lespri Sen an te vin tonbe sou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>menm jan ke li te fè sou nou nan kòmansman an. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Konsa, mwen te sonje pawòl Senyè a, jan Li te konn di a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Trav 1:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Jean te batize avèk dlo, men nou va batize avèk Lespri Sen an.’</char><verse eid="ACT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>“Donk, si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:45">Trav 10:45</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 10:47">47</ref></char></note>Bondye te bay yo menm don ak nou, lè nou te vin kwè nan Senyè Jésus Kri a, kilès mwen te ye pou m ta kab anpeche Bondye?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Lè yo te tande sa a, yo te vin kalme, e te bay Bondye glwa. Yo te di: “Ebyen konsa, Bondye akòde a lòt nasyon yo tou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:10">II Kwo 7:10</ref></char></note>repantans ki mennen a lavi a.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1">Trav 8:1</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 8:4">4</ref></char>
    </note>Answit, moun ki te gaye akoz pèsekisyon ki te leve a, ansanm ak zafè Étienne nan, te fè wout yo pou Phénicie, Chypre, ak Antioche, e yo t ap pale pawòl la a Jwif yo sèlman.<verse eid="ACT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Men te gen nan yo, moun Chypre ak Cyrène ki te vini Antioche. E yo te kòmanse pale ak Grèk yo osi, e t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:42">Trav 5:42</ref></char></note>preche Senyè Jésus a.<verse eid="ACT 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:66">Luc 1:66</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men la a Senyè a te avèk yo, e yon gran kantite ki te kwè te vire vè Senyè a.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Nouvèl yo te rive nan zòrèy a legliz la nan Jérusalem, e yo te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref></char></note>Barnabas Antioche.<verse eid="ACT 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Konsa, lè l rive, e te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:43">Trav 13:43</ref></char></note>gras Bondye a, li te rejwi. Li te kòmanse ankouraje yo tout, pou yo avèk yon sèl panse, ta rete fidèl a Senyè a. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Paske li te yon bon moun. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>ranpli ak Lespri Sen an, ak lafwa. Konsa, anpil moun te adisyonen a Senyè a.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Barnabas te kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:11">Trav 9:11</ref></char></note>Tarse pou ale jwenn Saul. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Lè li te twouve li, li te mennen l Antioche. Pandan yon ane antye yo te reyini avèk legliz la, e yo te enstwi anpil moun.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 11:26">Disip yo te premyèman rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:28">Trav 26:28</ref></char></note>“Kretyen” la a, nan Antioche.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Alò nan tan sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:49">Luc 11:49</ref></char></note>kèk pwofèt te sòti Jérusalem pou rive Antioche.<verse eid="ACT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Youn nan yo ke yo te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Trav 21:10</ref></char></note>Agabus te kanpe. Li te kòmanse endike pa Lespri a, ke an verite, t ap gen yon gwo grangou nan tout mond lan. Epi se sa menm ki te rive sou règn Claude la.<verse eid="ACT 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Epi selon mwayen ke nenpòt disip te genyen, yo chak te detèmine pou voye asistans pou sekou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:1">Trav 11:1</ref></char></note>frè yo nan Judée. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:25">Trav 12:25</ref></char></note>Se konsa yo te fè, e te voye l pa men Barnabas ak Saul pou livre bay ansyen yo.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Alò, vè lè sila a, Wa Hérode te mete men l sou kèk moun ki te apatyen a legliz la pou l maltrete yo. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:21">Mat 4:21</ref></char></note>te mete Jacques, frè a Jean a lanmò avèk yon nepe.<verse eid="ACT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Lè l te wè ke sa te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:27">Trav 24:27</ref></char></note>fè Jwif yo kontan, li te avanse pou l arete Pierre tou. Sa se te pandan jou Pen San Ledven yo. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Lè l te sezi li, li te mete l nan prizon, e te livre li a kat ekip sòlda pou yo te veye l, avèk entansyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Egz 12:1-27</ref></char></note>apre Pak la, pou mennen l devan pèp la.<verse eid="ACT 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Yo te kenbe Pierre nan prizon an, men legliz Bondye a t ap priye fò pou li.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Nan menm nwit lan lè Hérode te prèt pou mennen l devan l, Pierre t ap dòmi antre de sòlda. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:33">Trav 21:33</ref></char></note>byen anchene avèk de chenn, e jandam yo devan pòt la t ap veye prizon an.<verse eid="ACT 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Epi vwala <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:19">Trav 5:19</ref></char></note>yon zanj Senyè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:9">Luc 2:9</ref></char></note>te parèt sibitman, e yon limyè te briye nan kacho a. Li te frape bò kote Pierre. Li fè l leve, e te di l: “Leve vit!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:7">Konsa, chenn yo te tonbe kite men l.<verse eid="ACT 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Zanj lan te di l: “Mare senti ou e mete sapat ou”. Li te fè sa, epi li te di li: “Vlope ou ak manto a e swiv mwen.”<verse eid="ACT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Konsa, li te ale deyò e te kontinye swiv li. Li pa t fin konnen si sa ki t ap fèt pa zanj lan te vrè, men te sipoze ke se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:10">Trav 9:10</ref></char></note>yon vizyon ke li t ap fè. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Lè yo te fin pase premye ak dezyèm gad yo, yo te rive a yon pòtay an fè ki te mennen nan lantre vil la. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:19">Trav 5:19</ref></char></note>ouvri pou yo pou kont li. Yo te pase ale deyò, e te desann nan yon ri. Imedyatman zanj lan te kite li.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Lè Pierre te vin reflechi klè, li te di: “Koulye a mwen konnen san dout ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:28">Dan 3:28</ref></char></note>Senyè a te voye zanj Li pou te delivre m nan men Hérode, ak tout sa ke pèp Jwif la t ap atann.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Lè li te fin konprann sa, li te ale lakay Marie, manman a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:25">Trav 12:25</ref></char></note>Jean ki osi te rele Marc. La, anpil moun te reyini ansanm e t ap priye. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Lè l te frape nan pòtay la, yon sèvant kay la ki te rele Rhode te vin reponn. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Lè l te rekonèt vwa Pierre a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:41">Luc 24:41</ref></char></note>akoz kè kontan li, li pa t ouvri pòt la, men te kouri anndan, e te anonse ke Pierre te kanpe devan pòtay la.<verse eid="ACT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Yo te di li: “Ou fin pèdi tèt ou!” Men li te kontinye ensiste ke se te konsa. Yo t ap di: “Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mat 18:10</ref></char></note>zanj li”.<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Men Pierre te kontinye frape sou pòtay la. Lè yo te louvri pòt la, yo te wè li. Yo te etone. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Men li te fè yon sinyal avèk men l, pou yo fè silans, e te eksplike yo jan Senyè a te mennen li sòti nan prizon an. Li te di: “ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mc 6:3</ref></char></note> Fè Jacques ak frè yo konnen bagay sa yo.” Konsa, li te pati e te ale yon lòt kote.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Lè jounen an te rive, se pa ti kras tenten ki te genyen pami sòlda yo sou sa ki te rive Pierre a.<verse eid="ACT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Lè Hérode te chache li e li pa t twouve l, li te egzamine gad yo e te kòmande pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:27">Trav 16:27</ref></char></note> yo te egzekite. Li te desann, soti Judée pou ale Césarée e t ap pase tan an la.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Alò, Hérode te byen fache avèk moun Tyr ak Sidon yo. Men yo te vin kote l ansanm lè yo te fin fè zanmi avèk Blaste, asistan pèsonèl a wa a, yo t ap fè demann lapè, akoz ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:11">I Wa 5:11</ref></char></note>peyi pa yo te resevwa, manje nan men a peyi wa a.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Nan jou apwente a, Hérode te mete sou li tout rad wayal yo. Li te pran chèz li sou twòn nan, e te kòmanse livre yon diskou piblik a yo menm.<verse eid="ACT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Konsa, pèp la t ap kriye: “Se vwa a yon dye, pa a yon moun!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Imedyatman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:16">II Sam 24:16</ref></char></note>yon zanj Senyè a te frape l paske li pa t bay Bondye glwa. Konsa li te vin manje pa vè, e te mouri.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:7">Trav 6:7</ref></char></note>pawòl Senyè a te kontinye grandi e te vin miltipliye.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Barnabas ak Saul te retounen Jérusalem <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Trav 12:12</ref></char></note>lè yo te fin akonpli misyon pa yo a. Yo te pran Jean avèk yo ki te osi rele Marc.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Alò te gen nan Antioche, nan legliz ki te la a, pwofèt ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6">Wo 12:6</ref></char></note>mèt yo; Barnabas ak Simon ki te rele Niger, ak Lucius de Cyrène, ak Manaen ki te grandi avèk Hérode, tetrak la (youn nan kat wa yo), ak Saul.<verse eid="ACT 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Pandan yo t ap fè sèvis pou Senyè a, e t ap jene, Lespri Sen an te di: “Mete apa pou Mwen Barnabas ak Saul, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note>travay ke mwen rele yo a.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Alò, lè yo te fin fè jèn nan ak lapriyè, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:6">Trav 6:6</ref></char></note>poze men sou yo e te voye yo ale.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, ranvoye pa Lespri Sen an, yo te desann Séleucie. Depi la yo te pran yon bato pou Chypre. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Lè yo te rive Salamine, yo te kòmanse pwoklame pawòl Bondye a nan sinagòg Jwif yo. Anplis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Trav 12:12</ref></char></note>Jean te la pou ede yo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Lè yo te fin travèse tout lil la, jis rive nan Paphos yo twouve yon sèten <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:9">Trav 8:9</ref></char></note>majisyen Jwif, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mat 7:15</ref></char></note>fo pwofèt ke yo te rele Bar-Jésus <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>ki te avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:8">Trav 13:8</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:12">12</ref></char></note>pwokonsil la, Sergius Paulus, yon nonm byen entèlijan. Mesye sa te rele Barnabas avèk Saul pou vini pou l ta kapab tande pawòl Bondye a.<verse eid="ACT 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Men majisyen an, Elymas (se konsa non li tradwi) t ap opoze yo, e t ap chache detounen pwokonsil la kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:7">Trav 6:7</ref></char></note>lafwa a. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Men Saul, ki te osi konnen kon Paul, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>ranpli avèk Lespri Sen an, te fikse zye li sou li. <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>Li te di: “Ou menm ki ranpli ak desepsyon ak fwod, ou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:38">Mat 13:38</ref></char></note>fis a dyab la, ou menm lènmi a tout ladwati, èske ou p ap janm sispann fè kwochi chemen dwat a Senyè a? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Koulye a, gade byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:3">Egz 9:3</ref></char></note>men Bondye sou ou, ou va vin avèg e ou p ap wè solèy la pandan yon tan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Imedyatman, yon brouya avèk yon fènwa te tonbe sou li, e li te ale toupatou pou chache moun pou ta mennen l pa lamen.<verse eid="ACT 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Answit, pwokonsil la te vin kwè lè li te wè sa ki te rive a, byen etone de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:25">Trav 8:25</ref></char></note>doktrin Senyè a.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Alò, Paul avèk konpanyon li yo te monte sou lanmè a soti Paphos. Yo te rive nan vil Perge nan Pamphylie. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Trav 12:12</ref></char></note>Jean te kite yo la pou retounen Jérusalem.<verse eid="ACT 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Men kontinye soti Perge yo te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:19">Trav 14:19</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:21">21</ref></char></note>Antioche Pisidie a. Nan jou Saba a yo te antre nan sinagòg la, e yo te chita. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Aprè Lalwa ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:27">Trav 13:27</ref></char></note>Pwofèt yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:21">Trav 15:21</ref></char></note>te fin li, ofisye yo te voye kote yo e te di: “Frè yo, si nou gen nenpòt pawòl pou egzòte pèp la, pale.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Paul te kanpe. Li te fè sinyal avèk men l, e te di: “Lezòm Israël yo, ak nou menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:2">Trav 10:2</ref></char></note>krent Bondye, koute: <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Bondye a pèp Israël sa a te chwazi zansèt nou yo, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Egz 1:7</ref></char></note>fè pèp la onore pandan sejou yo nan peyi Égypte. Epi avèk yon bra leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Egz 12:51</ref></char></note>Li te mennen yo sòti ladann. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Nonb 14:34</ref></char></note>Pandan anviwon yon tan de karant ane, konsa, li te sipòte yo nan dezè a.<verse eid="ACT 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>“Lè L te fin detwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Det 7:1</ref></char></note>sèt nasyon nan tè Canaan an, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:1">Jos 14:1</ref></char></note>divize tè pa yo a kòm eritaj. Sa te pran anviwon kat san senkant ane. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Apre bagay sa yo, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Jij 2:16</ref></char></note>bay yo jij yo jiska Samuel, pwofèt la.<verse eid="ACT 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>“Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">I Sam 8:5</ref></char></note>mande pou yon wa, epi Bondye te bay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:1">I Sam 9:1</ref></char></note>Saul, Fis a Kis la, yon nonm nan tribi Benjamin an pou karant ane.<verse eid="ACT 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>“Lè L te fin retire li, Li te fè leve David pou l ta kapab wa sou yo. Selon Li, te temwaye e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">I Sam 13:14</ref></char></note>‘Mwen twouve David, fis a Jessé a, yon nonm selon pwòp kè Mwen ki va fè tout volonte M’.<verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>“Soti nan desandan a nonm sila a, selon pwomès la, Bondye te fè vini a Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:11">Luc 2:11</ref></char></note>yon Sovè, Jésus.<verse eid="ACT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>“Avan Li te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-4">Mc 1:1-4</ref></char></note>Jean te preche yon batèm repantans pou tout pèp Israël la. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Alò, pandan Jean t ap konplete pakou li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref></char></note>li te kontinye ap mande: ‘Kisa nou sipoze ke mwen ye? Mwen se pa Li menm nan. Men gade byen, youn ap vini aprè mwen e sapat a pye li, mwen pa menm dign pou delase.<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>“Frè yo, Fis a fanmi Abraham yo, sila pami nou ki krent Bondye yo, a nou mesaj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref></char></note>sali sila a voye. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Paske sila ki rete Jérusalem yo, avèk gouvernè pa yo, pa t rekonèt ni Li menm, ni pawòl a pwofèt yo, malgre, yo konn li toupatou chak Saba a. Men yo te akonpli bagay sa yo lè yo te kondane Li. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Malgre yo pa t twouve okenn choz ki merite lanmò, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mat 27:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:23">23</ref></char></note>mande Pilate pou li ta fè l mouri. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Epi lè yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:22">Trav 26:22</ref></char></note>fin akonpli tout sa ki te ekri konsènan Li yo, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:53">Luc 23:53</ref></char></note>retire Li sou kwa a, e yo te mete l nan yon tonm.<verse eid="ACT 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>“Men Bondye te leve Li soti nan lanmò. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Konsa, pandan anpil jou, sa yo ki te sòti Galilée pou monte Jérusalem avè L yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Trav 1:3</ref></char></note> te wè li, menm sila yo ki koulye a se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:48">Luc 24:48</ref></char></note>temwen Li a pèp la.<verse eid="ACT 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>“Konsa, nou preche a nou menm bòn nouvèl a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Wo 4:13</ref></char></note>pwomès ki te fèt a zansèt nou yo, <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>ke Bondye te akonpli pou zanfan pa nou yo, lè l te resisite Jésus a, menm jan ke sa osi ekri nan dezyèm Sòm nan:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sòm 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Ou se Fis Mwen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">jodi a Mwen fè Ou.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>“Selon reyalite ke Li te leve soti nan lanmò, pou l pa ankò retounen nan pouriti, Li te pale konsa: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">És 55:3</ref></char></note>‘Mwen va bannou benediksyon a David ki sen e byen asire yo.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>“Konsa, Li pale osi nan yon lòt Sòm ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Sòm 16:10</ref></char></note>‘Ou p ap kite pa W, Sila Ki Sen an, sibi pouriti.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>“Paske David, apre li te sèvi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:22">Trav 13:22</ref></char></note>plan Bondye a nan jenerasyon pa l la, te dòmi. Li te vin plase pami zansèt li yo, e li te sibi dekonpozisyon. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Men Sila ke Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>fè leve a, pa t sibi dekonpozisyon menm.<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>“Konsa, kite sa vin konnen a nou menm, frè yo, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:47">Luc 24:47</ref></char></note>atravè Li menm, padon pou peche yo pwoklame a nou menm. <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>Selon Li menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:43">Trav 10:43</ref></char></note>tout moun ki kwè yo, vin lib de tout bagay ke nou pa t kapab libere pa Lalwa Moïse la.<verse eid="ACT 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>“Konsa, fè atansyon, pou sa ki te pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:44">Luc 24:44</ref></char></note>nan pwofèt yo pa vini sou nou:<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Gade byen mokè yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Vin etone, e peri!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Paske M ap acheve yon zèv nan jou nou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">yon zèv ke nou p ap janm kwè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">menmsi yon moun ta eksplike nou li.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Pandan Paul ak Barnabas t ap sòti, pèp la te kontinye mande pou yo ta kapab pale yo bagay sa yo ankò nan pwochen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Trav 13:14</ref></char></note>Saba a. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Alò, lè sinagòg la te lage, anpil nan Jwif yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:4">Trav 17:4</ref></char></note>pèp etranje ki te vin krent Bondye yo, te swiv Paul ak Barnabas. Yo te pale avèk yo pou ankouraje yo kontinye nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:23">Trav 11:23</ref></char></note>gras Bondye a.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Trav 13:14</ref></char></note>pwochen Saba a, prèske tout vil la te vin rasanble pou koute pawòl Bondye a.<verse eid="ACT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Men lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:50">Trav 13:50</ref></char></note>Jwif yo te wè foul la, yo te ranpli avèk jalouzi, e yo te kòmanse pale kont bagay ke Paul te pale yo, e t ap fè blasfèm.<verse eid="ACT 13:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Paul ak Barnabas te pale avèk gwo kouraj. Yo te di: “Li te nesesè pou pawòl Bondye a ta pale a nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:26">Trav 3:26</ref></char></note>avan. Men akoz ke nou refize l, e jije pwòp tèt nou endign pou lavi etènèl la, gade byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:6">Trav 18:6</ref></char></note>n ap vire bò kote pèp etranje yo. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Paske konsa Senyè a te kòmande nou:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">És 42:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Mwen plase nou kòm yon limyè pou pèp etranje yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">pou nou ta pote delivrans jiska dènye ekstremite tè a.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Lè pèp etranje yo te tande sa, yo te kòmanse rejwi e t ap bay glwa a pawòl Bondye a. Konsa, tout sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:28">Wo 8:28</ref></char></note>te nome pou lavi etènèl yo te kwè. <verse eid="ACT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:12">Trav 13:12</ref></char></note>Pawòl Senyè a te gaye nan tout rejyon an.<verse eid="ACT 13:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Men Jwif yo te chofe fanm fidèl yo, ak chèf ki t ap dirije vil yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:14">Trav 16:14</ref></char></note>fòmante yon pèsekisyon kont Paul ak Barnabas, e te chase yo deyò teritwa yo.<verse eid="ACT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat 10:14</ref></char></note>yo te souke pousyè a, fè l sòti nan pye yo, kòm yon sign kont yo, e yo te ale Icone.<verse eid="ACT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Epi disip yo te kontinye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>ranpli avèk jwa, e avèk Lespri Sen an.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Nan Icone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:5">Trav 13:5</ref></char></note>yo te antre nan sinagòg a Jwif yo ansanm, e yo te pale nan yon jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:47">Trav 2:47</ref></char></note>ki te fè yon gran foul, ni Jwif, ni Grèk kwè.<verse eid="ACT 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Men Jwif ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Jn 3:36</ref></char></note>pa t kwè yo te boulvèse lespri pèp etranje yo, e te vin fè yo vin egri kont frè fidèl yo.<verse eid="ACT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Malgre sa, yo te rete la pou anpil tan, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:29">Trav 4:29</ref></char></note>t ap pale avèk kouraj. Yo te depann de Senyè a, ki t ap temwaye de pawòl lagras Li a, e te pèmèt ke sign ak mèvèy te vin fèt pa men pa yo.<verse eid="ACT 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:4">Trav 17:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men moun vil yo te divize. Kèk te pran pati a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:45">Trav 13:45</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref></char></note>Jwif yo, e kèk vè apòt yo.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Lè Jwif yo avèk ofisye yo ansanm ak pèp etranje yo te tante maltrete yo, e te fè plan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:19">Trav 14:19</ref></char></note>lapide yo, <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>yo te vin okouran de sa a, e te sove ale nan vil Lycaonie, Lystre, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:20">Trav 14:20</ref></char></note>Derbe yo, ak tout rejyon ozanviwon an. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Epi la Yo te kontinye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:15">Trav 14:15</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:21">21</ref></char></note>preche bòn nouvèl la.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Nan Lystre te chita yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:2">Trav 3:2</ref></char></note>sèten mesye, ki pa t gen fòs nan pye li. Li te bwate depi li sòti nan vant manman L, e li pa t janm te mache. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Mesye sa a t ap koute Paul pandan li t ap pale. Lè Paul te fikse zye l sou li, e te wè ke li te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:28">Mat 9:28</ref></char></note>lafwa pou l ta geri, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>li te di avèk yon vwa fò: “Kanpe dwat sou pye ou!” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:8">Trav 3:8</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te vòltije kanpe, e te kòmanse mache.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Lè foul la te wè sa Paul te fè a, yo te leve vwa yo nan langaj Likaonyen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:6">Trav 28:6</ref></char></note>“Se dye yo ki vin sanble ak moun e ki desann vè nou.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Konsa, yo te rele Barnabas Jupiter, e Paul Mercure, akoz ke se te li menm ki te chèf pou pale.<verse eid="ACT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Alò, prèt Jupiter a, ki te gen tanp li fenk deyò vil la, te mennen towo bèf avèk kolye flè yo devan pòtay yo pou l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:46">Dan 2:46</ref></char></note>te ofri sakrifis yo ansanm avèk foul la.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Men lè apòt yo, Barnabas ak Paul te tande sa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:6">Nonb 14:6</ref></char></note>chire rad yo. Yo te kouri nan mitan foul la e t ap rele <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>“Mesye yo, poukisa nou ap fè bagay sa yo? Nou menm tou se lòm, ki fèt menm jan ak nou. Nou pòte bòn nouvèl la a nou menm, pou nou kapab vire kite vye bagay sila yo pou vire vè Bondye vivan an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Egz 20:11</ref></char></note>ki te fè syèl la, tè a, lanmè a ak tout sa ki ladann. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Nan jenerasyon ki pase yo, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:30">Trav 17:30</ref></char></note>pèmèt tout nasyon yo fè pwòp chemen yo. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Men malgre sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:26">Trav 17:26</ref></char></note>Li pa t kite tèt Li menm san temwayaj. Li te fè sa ki bon e te bay nou lapli ki te sòti nan syèl la. Anplis Li te bay sezon ak fwi yo, ki te satisfè kè nou avèk manje, ak kè kontan.”<verse eid="ACT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Malgre tout pawòl sa yo, se te avèk difikilte ke yo te anpeche foul la fè sakrifis a yo menm.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Men Jwif ki te sòti Antioche ak Icone yo te vin parèt e te mennen foul la. Pou sa a, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:5">Trav 14:5</ref></char></note>te lapide Paul avèk wòch e te rale l sòti nan vil la. Yo te konnen se mouri, li te mouri.<verse eid="ACT 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Men pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>disip yo te kanpe antoure li, li te leve, e te antre nan vil la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 14:20">Nan pwochen jou a, li te sòti avèk Barnabas pou rive Derbe. <verse eid="ACT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Aprè yo te fin preche levanjil nan vil sa a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:47">Trav 2:47</ref></char></note>te fè anpil disip, yo te retounen Lystre, Icone ak Antioche. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>La yo t ap ranfòse nanm a disip yo. Yo t ap ankouraje yo pou kontinye nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:7">Trav 6:7</ref></char></note>lafwa, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:33">Jn 16:33</ref></char></note>“Se ak anpil tribilasyon nou oblije antre nan Wayòm Bondye a.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:5">Tit 1:5</ref></char></note>Lè yo te fin nome ansyen yo nan chak legliz, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:3">Trav 13:3</ref></char></note>priye ak jene, yo te plase yo nan men Senyè a, de Li menm ke yo te vin kwè a.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Konsa, yo te travèse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Trav 13:14</ref></char></note>Pisidie, pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Trav 13:13</ref></char></note>Pamphylie. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Lè yo te fin pale pawòl la nan Perge, yo te desann Attalie.<verse eid="ACT 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Soti la yo te pran bato a vwal pou rive Antioche. Se te la menm yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:23">Trav 11:23</ref></char></note>premyèman kòmande pa gras Bondye a pou zèv ke yo te fenk fin akonpli a. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Yo te rive e reyini tout legliz la ansanm. Yo te komanse bay rapò a tout bagay ke Bondye te fè avèk yo, ak jan Li te louvri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:9">I Kwo 16:9</ref></char></note>pòt lafwa a pèp etranje yo. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>La yo te pase anpil tan avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>disip yo.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:24">Trav 15:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò kèk mesye te desann sòti Judée e te kòmanse enstwi frè yo: “Amwenske nou vin sikonsi selon koutim Moïse la, nou pa kapab sove.”<verse eid="ACT 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Lè Paul ak Barnabas te fè yon gran diskisyon ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:7">Trav 15:7</ref></char></note>deba avèk yo, lòt frè yo te detèmine ke Paul ak Barnabas ak kèk lòt nan yo ta dwe monte Jérusalem vè lòt apòt yo ak lansyen yo konsènan pwoblèm sila a. <verse eid="ACT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:38">Trav 20:38</ref></char></note>voye pa legliz la, yo t ap travèse Phénicie ak Samarie, e t ap bay an detay istwa konvèsyon pèp etranje yo. Sa te fè kè a tout frè yo kontan anpil.<verse eid="ACT 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Lè yo te rive Jérusalem, yo te resevwa pa legliz la avèk tout apòt ak ansyen yo. Konsa, yo te bay yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:27">Trav 14:27</ref></char></note>rapò konple de tout sa ke Bondye te fè avèk yo.<verse eid="ACT 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:5">Trav 26:5</ref></char></note>kèk nan gwoup Farizyen ki te kwayan yo te kanpe e te di: “Li nesesè pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 7:18">I Kwo 7:18</ref></char></note>sikonsi yo, e pou fè yo swiv Lalwa Moïse la.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:30">Trav 11:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Apòt ak ansyen yo te vin reyini ansanm pou egzamine afè sila a.<verse eid="ACT 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Apre anpil diskisyon, Pierre te kanpe e te di yo: “Frè yo, nou konnen ke nan tan pase yo, Bondye te fè yon chwa pami nou, ke pa bouch mwen, pèp etranje yo ta dwe tande pawòl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:24">Trav 20:24</ref></char></note>levanjil la, e vin kwè. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:24">Trav 1:24</ref></char></note>ki konnen kè a, te temwaye a yo menm, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>bay yo Lespri Sen an, menm jan ke Li te fè nou an. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:28">Trav 10:28</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 10:34">34</ref></char></note>Li pa t fè distenksyon antre nou ak yo, e te netwaye kè yo pa lafwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>“Alò konsa, poukisa nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:9">Trav 5:9</ref></char></note>mete Bondye a leprèv la a lè nou plase sou kou a disip yo yon jouk ke ni zansèt nou yo, ni nou menm pa t kapab pote? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Men nou kwè ke nou sove pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:24">Wo 3:24</ref></char></note>lagras a Senyè Jésus a, menm jan ak yo menm.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Tout foul la te rete an silans. Yo t ap koute Barnabas ak Paul lè yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:27">Trav 14:27</ref></char></note>eksplike ki sign ak mirak Bondye te fè atravè yo menm pami pèp etranje yo.<verse eid="ACT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Apre yo te fin pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:17">Trav 12:17</ref></char></note>Jacques te reponn e te di: “Frè yo, koute mwen. <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:7">Trav 15:7</ref></char></note>Simon eksplike nou jan Bondye te premyèman pran pami pèp etranje yo, yon pèp pou non Li. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Epi avèk sa a, pawòl a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:40">Trav 13:40</ref></char></note>pwofèt yo dakò, jis jan sa ekri a:<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11">Am 9:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Apre bagay sa yo Mwen va retounen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Mwen va rebati tabènak David ki te tonbe a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Mwen va rebati ranblè li yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">e Mwen va restore li<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:12">Am 9:12</ref></char></note>tout rès limanite a kapab chache Bondye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">ak tout pèp etranje yo ki rele pa non Mwen,’<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>di Senyè a ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:21">És 45:21</ref></char></note>fè tout bagay sila yo konnen depi nan tan ansyen an.<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>“Konsa, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:28">Trav 15:28</ref></char></note>jijman pa m pou nou pa twouble sila k ap tounen vè Bondye yo ki soti pami pèp etranje yo, <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>men pou nou ekri yo pou yo evite bagay ki sèvi kon sakrifis pou zidòl, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">Lev 18:6-23</ref></char></note>imoralite seksyèl, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:14">Lev 17:14</ref></char></note>vyann sa ki toufe, ak san. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:15">Trav 13:15</ref></char></note>Moïse, depi nan ansyen jenerasyon yo gen kwayan nan chak vil sa yo ki preche li, paske li kon li nan sinagòg yo chak Saba.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Answit li te sanble bon pou disip ak ansyen yo, avèk tout legliz la, pou chwazi moun pami yo pou voye Antioche avèk Paul ak Barnabas: Jude ki rele Barsabas, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:27">Trav 15:27</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:32">32</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref></char></note>Silas, mesye ki te konn dirije pami frè yo. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Yo te voye lèt sa a avèk yo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">“<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:2">Trav 15:2</ref></char></note>Apòt ak frè yo ki se ansyen yo, a frè yo nan Antioche ak Syrie, ak Cilicie, ki sòti nan pèp etranje yo, salitasyon.<verse eid="ACT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>“Akoz ke nou tande ke kèk nan nou ki pa t resevwa enstriksyon de nou menm, ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:7">Gal 1:7</ref></char></note>twouble nou avèk pawòl k ap boulvèse nanm nou, <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:28">Trav 15:28</ref></char></note>li te sanble bon pou nou, akoz nou tout te vin dakò ansanm, pou chwazi kèk mesye pou voye kote nou avèk byeneme nou yo, Barnabas ak Paul. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Se mesye yo ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Trav 9:23</ref></char></note>riske lavi yo pou non a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="ACT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>“Konsa, nou voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Trav 15:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:32">32</ref></char></note>Jude ak Silas ki yo menm va osi bay rapò a menm bagay sila yo pa pawòl nan bouch yo.<verse eid="ACT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>“Paske li te parèt bon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:32">Trav 5:32</ref></char></note>pou Lespri Sen an ak nou menm pa mete sou nou okenn fado ke lesansyèl sa yo: <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>pou nou evite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:20">Trav 15:20</ref></char></note>bagay ki sèvi kon sakrifis pou zidòl, san, bagay ki toufe, ak imoralite seksyèl. Si nou kenbe tèt nou lib de bagay sila yo, nou va fè byen. Orevwa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Donk, lè yo te voye yo ale, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Trav 15:22</ref></char></note>desann Antioche. Yo te ransanble tout asanble a ansanm pou te livre lèt la. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Lè yo te li li, yo te rejwi yo akoz ankourajman li te bay. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Jude ak Silas, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:1">Trav 13:1</ref></char></note>pwofèt yo menm osi, te ankouraje e ranfòse frè yo avèk yon mesaj byen long.<verse eid="ACT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Apre yo fin pase tan la a, frè yo te voye yo anpè, pou retounen kote sila ki te voye yo. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>Men li te sanble bon pou Silas pou l te rete la.<verse eid="ACT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Konsa, Paul ak Barnabas te rete Antioche ansanm ak anpil lòt, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:4">Trav 8:4</ref></char></note>preche e enstwi pawòl Senyè a.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Apre kèk tan, Paul te di Barnabas: “Annou retounen pou vizite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:4">Trav 13:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:51">51</ref></char></note>chak vil kote nou te pwoklame pawòl Senyè a pou nou wè kijan yo ye.”<verse eid="ACT 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnabas te vle pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Trav 12:12</ref></char></note>Jean Marc pou ale avèk yo tou.<verse eid="ACT 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Men Paul te ensiste ke yo pa ta dwe pran li ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Trav 13:13</ref></char></note>abandone yo nan Pamphylie, e pa t akonpanye yo nan travay la.<verse eid="ACT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Yo te vin tèlman pa dakò ke yo te separe youn de lòt. Barnabas te pran Marc avè l e te pran bato a vwal pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref></char></note>Chypre.<verse eid="ACT 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Men Paul te chwazi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Trav 15:22</ref></char></note>Silas e te pati. Frè yo te remèt li nan gras Senyè a. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Li te vwayaje travèse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:24">Mat 4:24</ref></char></note>Syrie ak Cilicie, pou ranfòse legliz yo.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Paul te vini osi nan Derbe ak Lystre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:1">Yon disip yo te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:14">Trav 17:14</ref></char></note>Timothée te la, Fis a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:5">II Tim 1:5</ref></char></note>fanm Jwif ki te yon kwayan, men papa li te yon Grèk. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:40">Trav 16:40</ref></char></note>frè fidèl ki te nan Lystre avèk Icone yo te pale byen de li. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Paul te vle Timothée ale avè l. Pou rezon sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal 2:3</ref></char></note> li te fè li sikonsi, akoz Jwif ki te nan landwa sila yo. Paske yo tout te konnen ke papa l se te yon Grèk.<verse eid="ACT 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Alò, pandan yo t ap travèse vil yo, yo t ap livre bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:28">Trav 15:28</ref></char></note>desizyon a ki te detèmine pa apòt yo ak ansyen yo nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Donk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:31">Trav 9:31</ref></char></note>legliz yo t ap ranfòse nan lafwa, e yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:47">Trav 2:47</ref></char></note>grandi an nonb chak jou.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Yo te travèse rejyon a Phrygie ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:23">Trav 18:23</ref></char></note>Galatie, akoz ke yo te anpeche pa Lespri Sen an pou pale pawòl la an Asie. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Lè yo te vini Mysie, yo te eseye antre Bithynie, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luc 24:49</ref></char></note>Lespri Jésus a pa t pèmèt yo. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Lè yo te kite Mysie, yo te desann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:11">Trav 16:11</ref></char></note>Troas.<verse eid="ACT 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Konsa, yon vizyon te parèt a Paul nan nwit lan. Yon sèten mesye Macédoine te kanpe e t ap di l: “Vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:10">Trav 16:10</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 16:12">12</ref></char></note>Macédoine pou ede nou.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Lè li te wè vizyon an, imedyatman nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:10-17">Trav 16:10-17</ref></char></note>chache ale Macédoine, byen konprann ke Bondye te rele nou pou preche levanjil la a yo menm.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Donk, nou te pran vwal sou lanmè soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:8">Trav 16:8</ref></char></note>Troas. Nou te kouri tou dwat pou Samothrace, e nan jou swivan an, pou Néapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Nou te kite la pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:6">Trav 20:6</ref></char></note>Philippes, yon vil prensipal nan distri Macédoine nan, yon koloni Women.Nou te rete nan vil sa pandan kèk jou.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Trav 13:14</ref></char></note>jou Saba a, nou te ale deyò pòtay la bò kote yon rivyè kote nou te sipoze ta genyen yon kote pou lapriyè. Nou te chita e te kòmanse pale ak fanm ki te vin rasanble la yo.<verse eid="ACT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Yon sèten fanm yo te rele Lydie, ki te sòti nan vil Thyatire, yon machann twal mov, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:7">Trav 18:7</ref></char></note>adoratris Bondye, te tande nou. Senyè a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:45">Luc 24:45</ref></char></note>louvri kè l pou reponn a bagay ke Paul t ap pale yo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Lè li menm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:4">Trav 11:4</ref></char></note>tout lakay li te batize, li te ankouraje nou e te di: “Si nou jije mwen fidèl a Senyè a, vin lakay mwen pou rete.” E li te konvenk nou de sa.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Li te vin rive ke pandan nou t ap ale nan plas lapriyè a, te gen yon sèten jenn fanm-esklav avèk yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19:31</ref></char></note>Lespri divinasyon. Li te konn fè anpil kòb pou mèt li yo akoz ke li te konn pale moun davans sa ki t ap rive yo. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Li te swiv Paul avèk nou menm, e li t ap kriye fò san sès, e t ap di: “Mesye sa yo se sèvitè yo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:7">Mc 5:7</ref></char></note>Bondye Trè Wo a, k ap pwoklame a nou menm, youn chemen sali a.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Li te kontinye ap fè sa pandan anpil jou.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:18">Men Paul te vrèman enève. Li te vire e te di a Lespri a: “Mwen kòmande ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:17">Luc 10:17</ref></char></note>nan non Jésus Kri a pou sòti nan li!” E lespri a te sòti de li nan menm moman an.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Men lè mèt li yo te wè ke tout espwa yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:16">Trav 16:16</ref></char></note>fè kòb te disparèt, yo te sezi Paul ak Silas. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:6">Trav 17:6</ref></char></note>trennen yo nan mache a devan otorite yo. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Lè yo te mennen yo a chèf majistra yo, yo te di: “Mesye sa yo se Jwif yo k ap boulvèse vil nou an. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Y ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:8">Est 3:8</ref></char></note>pwoklame koutim ki pa pèmèt pou nou aksepte ni obsève kòm Women.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Konsa, foul la te leve ansanm kont yo. Chèf majistra yo te chire rad yo. Yo te kòmande pou yo bat yo avèk baton.<verse eid="ACT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Lè yo te fin bay yo anpil kou, yo te jete yo nan prizon, e te kòmande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:27">Trav 16:27</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 16:36">36</ref></char></note>jandam prizon an pou veye yo de prè. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Li menm, akoz ke li resevwa lòd sa a, te jete yo nan prizon pa anndan an, e te tache pye yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:27">Job 13:27</ref></char></note>nan chèn.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Men anviwon minwi Paul avèk Silas t ap priye e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Ef 5:19</ref></char></note>chante chan lwanj a Bondye. Lòt prizonye yo t ap koute yo.<verse eid="ACT 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Konsa, sibitman te vin gen yon gwo tranbleman detè, ki souke menm fondasyon kay prizon an. Imedyatman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:10">Trav 12:10</ref></char></note>tout pòt prizon an te vin louvri, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:7">Trav 12:7</ref></char></note>chèn tout moun te vin detache.<verse eid="ACT 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:23">Trav 16:23</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 16:36">36</ref></char>
    </note> Jandam prizon an te leve nan dòmi, e lè l te wè tout pòt yo te vin ouvri, li te rale nepe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:19">Trav 12:19</ref></char></note>pou touye tèt li, paske li te sipoze ke prizonye yo te chape.<verse eid="ACT 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Men Paul te kriye ak yon vwa fò pou di l: “Pa fè tèt ou mal! Nou tout la!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Jandam nan te rele pou limyè, e te kouri antre ap tranble avèk laperèz. Konsa, li te tonbe devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19">Trav 16:19</ref></char></note>Paul ak Silas, <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>te mennen yo deyò, e li te mande yo: “Mesye yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:37">Trav 2:37</ref></char></note>kisa mwen dwe fè pou m ta sove?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Yo te reponn: “Kwè nan Senyè a Jésus, e ou va sove, ou menm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:14">Trav 11:14</ref></char></note>lakay ou.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Yo te pale li pawòl Senyè a, ansanm ak tout sila ki te lakay li yo.<verse eid="ACT 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Li te pran yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:25">Trav 16:25</ref></char></note>nan menm lè nwit sa a, li te lave blesi yo, e imedyatman, li te batize, li menm avèk tout lakay li. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Li te mennen yo lakay li e te mete manje devan yo. Li te rejwi anpil, akoz li te kwè nan Bondye avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:14">Trav 11:14</ref></char></note>tout lakay li.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Alò, lè jounen an te rive, chèf majistra yo te voye jandam yo pou di: “Lage moun sa yo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:27">Trav 16:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jandam prizon an te fè rapò sa a bay Paul. Li te di: “Chèf majistra yo gen tan voye lage nou. Konsa, vin deyò kounye a e ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:33">Trav 15:33</ref></char></note>anpè.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Men Paul te di yo: “Yo gen tan bat nou an piblik san jijman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:25-29">Trav 22:25-29</ref></char></note>moun ki se sitwayen Women, e yo te jete nou nan prizon. Alò, koulye a y ap voye nou ale an sekrè? Anverite, non! Men kite yo vini yo menm, pou mete nou deyò.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Jandam yo te bay rapò a pawòl sila yo bay chèf majistra yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:29">Trav 22:29</ref></char></note>Yo te pè lè yo te tande ke se te Women yo te ye. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Yo te vini pou te fè apèl ak yo, e lè yo te fin lage yo, yo te mande yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:34">Mat 8:34</ref></char></note>pou kite vil la.<verse eid="ACT 16:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Yo te kite prizon an e te antre lakay Lydie. Lè yo te wè frè yo, yo te ankouraje yo, e yo te pati.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Alò, lè yo te fin vwayaje travèse Amphipolis ak Apollonie, yo te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:11">Trav 17:11</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref></char></note>Thessalonique, kote te gen yon sinagòg Jwif.<verse eid="ACT 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Selon abitid Paul, li te ale kote yo. Pandan twa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Trav 13:14</ref></char></note>Saba li te rezone avèk yo sou Ekriti Sen yo. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Li te bay eksplikasyon ak evidans ke Kris la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:18">Trav 3:18</ref></char></note>te oblije soufri e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:9">Jn 20:9</ref></char></note>leve ankò soti nan lanmò. Li t ap di: “Jésus sila a, ke mwen ap pwoklame a nou an, se Kris la.”<verse eid="ACT 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Kèk nan yo te vin kwè, e te vin jwenn avèk Paul ak Silas, ansanm avèk yon gran kantite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:43">Trav 13:43</ref></char></note>Grèk ki te krent Bondye, ak yon kantite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:50">Trav 13:50</ref></char></note>fanm enpòtan.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:13">Trav 17:13</ref></char></note>Jwif yo te vin jalou, e te mennen kèk mesye mechan sòti nan mache a. Yo te fòme yon ekip ajitatè, e te mete tout vil la nan yon tapaj. Lè yo te rive lakay Jason, yo t ap chache mennen yo deyò bay pèp la.<verse eid="ACT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Men lè yo pa t twouve yo, yo te kòmanse rale Jason ak kèk lòt nan frè yo devan otorite vil yo. Yo t ap rele: “Mesye sa yo k ap boulvèse tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:14">Mat 24:14</ref></char></note>mond lan rive isit la tou. <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Se Jason ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luc 10:38</ref></char></note>resevwa yo. Yo tout aji kont dekrè César a. Y ap di gen yon lòt wa, Jésus!” <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Foul la ak chèf yo te byen twouble lè yo tande bagay sa yo.<verse eid="ACT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Lè yo te resevwa yon bon garanti nan men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Trav 17:5</ref></char></note>Jason ak lòt yo, yo te lage yo.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Frè yo, konsa, te voye Paul ak Silas ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:13">Trav 17:13</ref></char></note>Bérée pandan nwit lan. Lè yo te rive, yo te antre nan sinagòg Jwif yo.<verse eid="ACT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Alò, Jwif sila yo te pi nòb pase sila nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Trav 17:1</ref></char></note>Thessalonique yo, paske yo te resevwa pawòl la avèk yon gwo anvi. Yo te egzamine Ekriti yo chak jou pou wè si bagay sa yo se te konsa. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Konsa, anpil nan yo te vin kwè, ansanm avèk plizyè mesye ak fanm Grèk enpòtan yo.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Men lè Jwif Thessalonique yo te vin konprann ke pawòl Bondye a te pwoklame pa Paul nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:10">Trav 17:10</ref></char></note>Bérée, yo te vini la osi pou yo ajite ak chofe foul la.<verse eid="ACT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Alò, imedyatman frè yo te voye Paul deyò pou ale jis kote lanmè a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Trav 15:22</ref></char></note>Silas ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Trav 16:1</ref></char></note>Timothée te rete la. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Alò, sila ki t ap gide Paul yo te mennen li jiska <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:16">Trav 17:16</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:21">21</ref></char></note>Athènes. Yo te kite li la, epi lè yo fin resevwa lòd pou fè Silas ak Timothée vin kote l pi vit ke posib, yo te ale.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Pandan Paul t ap tann yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Trav 17:15</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:21">21</ref></char></note>Athènes, lespri li te pwovoke anndan l akoz li te wè ke vil la te ranpli nèt avèk zidòl.<verse eid="ACT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Konsa, li t ap rezone <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Trav 9:20</ref></char></note>nan sinagòg la avèk Jwif yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:4">Trav 17:4</ref></char></note>ak pèp etranje ki te krent Bondye yo, e nan mache a chak jou avèk sila ke li te konn rakontre.<verse eid="ACT 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Anplis, kèk nan filosòf Epikiryen ak Stoyik yo t ap diskite avè l. Kèk t ap di: “Kisa mesye ki renmen pale anpil sa a ta vle di?” Lòt yo t ap di: “Li sanble ke l ap pwoklame kèk lòt kalite dye etranje” —akoz ke li t ap preche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:2">Trav 4:2</ref></char></note>Jésus ak rezirèksyon an.<verse eid="ACT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Konsa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:19">Trav 23:19</ref></char></note>pran li e te mennen li nan Aréopage la. Yo te di l: “Èske ou kapab eksplike nou nouvo ansèyman sila a, ke w ap pwoklame a. <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Paske w ap pote kèk bagay byen dwòl nan zòrèy nou. Konsa, nou vle konnen kisa bagay sa yo vle di.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>(Alò, tout Atenyen yo ak lòt etranje ki t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:10">Trav 2:10</ref></char></note>vizite la yo te konn pase tout tan yo nan pale, oswa nan tande kèk lide nèf.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Konsa, Paul te kanpe nan mitan Aréopage la, e te di: “Mesye Athènes yo, mwen wè ke nou se moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:19">Trav 25:19</ref></char></note>ki renmen adore nan tout sans. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Paske pandan mwen t ap travèse e t ap egzamine <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:4">II Tes 2:4</ref></char></note>objè adorasyon nou yo, mwen te twouve yon otèl avèk enskripsyon sa a: “A Dye Enkoni an!” Konsa, sila ke nou ap adore san konnen an, mwen pwoklame L a nou.<verse eid="ACT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:5">És 42:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Bondye ki te fè mond lan avèk tout bagay ki ladann yo, akoz Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:14">Det 10:14</ref></char></note>Senyè syèl la ak tè a, pa rete nan tanp ki fèt pa men a lòm. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Ni li pa sèvi pa men moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:2">Job 22:2</ref></char></note>kòmsi Li te bezwen yon bagay. Paske se Li menm ki bay moun lavi, souf ak tout bagay.<verse eid="ACT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>“Se Li menm ki te fè sòti nan yon sèl òm, tout nasyon a lòm yo, pou viv sou tout sifas tè a, e ki te deja <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:8">Det 32:8</ref></char></note>detèmine fòs tan yo ta pase ladann, ak lizyè pou kote yo ta viv yo; <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>pou yo ta chèche Bondye, si petèt yo ta lonje men yo e twouve L, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:7">Det 4:7</ref></char></note>malgre ke Li pa lwen de chak en de nou.<verse eid="ACT 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>“‘Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:10">Job 12:10</ref></char></note>nan Li nou viv, nou fè mouvman, e nou egziste menm, jan kèk nan powèt nou yo konn di: paske nou menm tou se pitit Li.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Konsa, akoz ke nou se pitit a Bondye, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:18">És 40:18</ref></char></note>pa dwe panse ke lanati diven an se tankou lò, lajan, oswa wòch; yon imaj ki fòme pa da ak refleksyon a lòm.<verse eid="ACT 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>“Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:16">Trav 14:16</ref></char></note>pa t konte tan inyorans sa yo, men koulye a Li deklare ke lòm toupatou dwe repanti, <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>paske Li deja fikse yon jou ladann ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:8">Sòm 9:8</ref></char></note>Li va jije lemonn nan ladwati atravè yon nonm ke Li nome, e te founi prèv a tout moun lè L te fè L leve, sòti nan lanmò a.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Alò, lè yo te tande de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:18">Trav 17:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:31">31</ref></char></note>rezirèksyon lanmò a, kèk te kòmanse moke l, men lòt yo te di: “Nou dwe tande ou ankò konsènan sa a”.<verse eid="ACT 17:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Konsa Paul te sòti nan mitan yo.<verse eid="ACT 17:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Men kèk moun te vin jwenn li e te kwè. Pami sila yo te gen osi Denys, moun Aréopage la, yon fanm ki te rele Damaris, e kèk lòt avèk yo.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo li te kite Athènes e te ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">Trav 18:8</ref></char></note>Corinthe.<verse eid="ACT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Epi li te twouve yon sèten Jwif la ki te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:18">Trav 18:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 18:26">26</ref></char></note>Aquilas, yon moun Pont ki te fenk vin sòti Italie avèk madanm li Priscille, paske Claude te kòmande tout Jwif yo pou kite Rome. Paul te ale kote yo. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>Akoz li te gen menm metye a, li te rete avèk yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:34">Trav 20:34</ref></char></note>yo t ap travay, paske se moun ki fè tant yo te ye. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Li t ap rezone nan sinagòg la chak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Trav 13:14</ref></char></note>Saba pou l konvenk Jwif yo ak Grèk yo pou kwè.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Men lè Silas ak Timothée te desann soti Macédoine, Paul te kòmanse dedye tèt li nèt a pawòl la, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:21">Trav 20:21</ref></char></note>temwaye solanèlman a Jwif yo ke se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:3">Trav 17:3</ref></char></note>Jésus ki te Kris la. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Men lè yo te reziste, e te fè blasfèm, li te souke rad li, e te di yo: “Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:16">II Sam 1:16</ref></char></note>san nou vini sou pwòp tèt nou! Mwen inosan. Depi koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:46">Trav 13:46</ref></char></note>mwen va ale kote pèp etranje yo.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Answit li te kite la pou ale lakay a yon sèten nonm ki te rele Titius Justus, yon adoratè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:43">Trav 13:43</ref></char></note>Bondye, ki te gen kay li toupre sinagòg la.<verse eid="ACT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 1:16">II Sam 1:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Crispus, dirijan sinagòg la, te vin kwè nan Senyè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:46">Trav 13:46</ref></char></note>avèk tout lakay li, e anpil nan Korentyen yo, lè yo te tande sa, yo te vin kwè, e yo te batize.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Epi Senyè a te di Paul nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:10">Trav 9:10</ref></char></note>vizyon pandan nwit lan: <char style="wj">“Pa pè ankò, men kontinye pale, e pa fè silans;</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/><char style="wj">paske Mwen avèk ou, e nanpwen moun k ap atake ou pou fè ou mal, paske Mwen gen anpil moun nan vil sa a.” </char> <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Konsa, li te rete la pandan en an si mwa, e li t ap enstwi pawòl Bondye a pami yo.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Men pandan Gallion te pwokonsil Achaië <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:1">I Tes 2:1</ref></char></note>Jwif yo avèk yon sèl vwa te leve kont Paul, e te mennen l devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:19">Mat 27:19</ref></char></note>chèz jijman an. <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>Yo t ap di: “Nonm sila ap fè moun kwè pou adore Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:7">Jn 19:7</ref></char></note>kont lalwa a.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Men lè Paul te prèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:2">Mat 5:2</ref></char></note>louvri bouch li, Gallion te di a Jwif yo: “Si se te yon ka a yon enjistis, oswa yon krim visye, O Jwif yo, li ta rezonab pou m ta bay nou soutyen. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Men si gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:29">Trav 23:29</ref></char></note>kesyon konsènan pawòl, oswa non, oswa pwòp lwa pa nou, okipe sa nou menm. Mwen pa gen enterè nan jije bagay sa yo.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Epi li te chase yo sòti devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:19">Mat 27:19</ref></char></note>chèz jijman an.<verse eid="ACT 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Konsa, yo tout te sezi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:1">I Kwo 1:1</ref></char></note>Sosthène, mèt sinagòg la, e te kòmanse bat li devan chèz jijman an. Men Gallion pa t okipe bagay sa yo menm.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Paul, apre li te rete pandan anpil jou ankò, te kite frè yo pou te monte sou lanmè a pou rive Syrie, e avèk li te gen Priscille ak Aquilas. Nan Cenchrées <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:2">Nonb 6:2</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 6:5">5</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 6:9">9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 6:18">18</ref></char></note>li te fè yo pase razwa sou cheve tèt li, paske li t ap swiv yon ve.<verse eid="ACT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Yo te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:21">Trav 18:21</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 18:24">24</ref></char></note>Éphèse, e li te kite yo la. Alò, li menm te antre nan sinagòg la pou te rezone avèk Jwif yo. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Lè yo te mande li pou rete avèk yo pou plis tan, li pa t dakò, <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>men li te kite yo e t ap di: “Mwen va retounen kote nou ankò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:10">Wo 1:10</ref></char></note>si Bondye vle”. E li te pran bato a vwal pou soti Éphèse.<verse eid="ACT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Lè l te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:40">Trav 8:40</ref></char></note>Césarée, li te monte pou salye legliz la, e li te desann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:19">Trav 11:19</ref></char></note>Antioche.<verse eid="ACT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Lè l te fin pase kèk tan la, li te sòti e te travèse youn apre lòt, nan rejyon a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:6">Trav 16:6</ref></char></note>Galatie a ak Phrygie kote li te ranfòse tout disip yo.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Alò, yon sèten Jwif ki te rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:1">Trav 19:1</ref></char></note>Apollos, ki te ne nan Alexandrie, yon nonm ki te konn pale byen, e ki te fò nan Ekriti Sen yo te vini Éphèse. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Mesye sa te enstwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:2">Trav 9:2</ref></char></note>nan chemen Bondye a. E avèk fevè Lespri a, li t ap pale e t ap enstwi byen klè tout bagay konsènan Jésus, men te konnen sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luc 7:29</ref></char></note>batèm a Jean an. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Li te kòmanse pale avèk gwo kouraj nan sinagòg la. Men lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Trav 18:2</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 18:18">18</ref></char></note>Priscille ak Aquilas te tande l, yo te rale l akote pou te eksplike li chemen Bondye a pi klè.<verse eid="ACT 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Lè Apollos te vle travèse a Achaïe, frè yo te ankouraje li, e te ekri a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>disip yo pou ankouraje li. Lè l te rive, li te anpil èd pou sila ki te kwè pa gras yo. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Paske avèk pouvwa li te demanti Jwif yo an piblik, e li te montre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:35">Trav 8:35</ref></char></note>atravè Ekriti Sen yo ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Trav 18:5</ref></char></note>Jésus se te Kris la.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Li te rive pandan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:12">I Kwo 1:12</ref></char></note>Apollos te Corinthe, Paul te travèse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:23">Trav 18:23</ref></char></note>peyi pi wo a e te vini Éphèse pou twouve kèk disip. <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>Li te mande yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:15">Trav 8:15</ref></char></note>“Èske nou te resevwa Lespri Sen an lè nou te kwè a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Yo te reponn li: “Non, nou pa menm konn tande si gen yon Lespri Sen.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Li te di: “Ebyen, nan kisa konsa nou te batize?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Yo te reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luc 7:29</ref></char></note>“Nan batèm a Jean an”.<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Konsa, Paul te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref></char></note>“Jean te batize avèk batèm a repantans lan, e te di pèp la pou kwè nan Sila ki t ap vini apre li a, sa vle di, nan Jésus.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Lè yo te tande sa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:12">Trav 8:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 8:16">16</ref></char></note>batize nan non Senyè a Jésus Kri. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Pandan Paul te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:17">Trav 8:17</ref></char></note>poze men l sou yo, Lespri Sen an te vini sou yo, e yo te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Trav 2:4</ref></char></note>pale avèk lang ak pwofetize. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Te gen an tou, anviwon douz mesye.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Paul te antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Trav 9:20</ref></char></note>sinagòg la, e te kontinye pale avèk gran kouraj pandan anviwon twa mwa. Li t ap rezone pou fè yo kwè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Trav 1:3</ref></char></note>selon wayòm Bondye a.<verse eid="ACT 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Men lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:4">Trav 14:4</ref></char></note>kèk t ap vin ensansib e dezobeyisan, e t ap pale mal de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:2">Trav 9:2</ref></char></note>Chemen an devan foul la, li te kite yo e te separe disip yo. Konsa, yo t ap rezone chak jou nan lekòl Tyrannus la. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Sa te fèt pandan dezan, pou tout sila ki te rete an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:6">Trav 16:6</ref></char></note>Asie yo ta tande pawòl Senyè a, ni Grèk, ni Jwif.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Bondye t ap fè mirak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:13">Trav 8:13</ref></char></note>ekstrawòdinè pa men Paul <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:5">Trav 5:5</ref></char></note>jiskaske yo te kòmanse pote menm mouchwa avèk rad kò li pou malad yo; konsa malad yo te vin geri, e move Lespri yo te vin sòti.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Men osi kèk nan Jwif <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:27">Mat 12:27</ref></char></note>ki te konn chase move lespri yo, ki te ale soti yon kote a yon lòt, te eseye rele non Jésus sou sila ki te gen move lespri yo, e t ap di: “Mwen bay ou lòd pa Jésus ke Paul preche a.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Sèt fis a Scéva yo, yon chèf prèt Jwif, t ap fè sa a.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Epi move lespri yo te reponn e te di yo: “Mwen rekonèt Jésus, e mwen konnen Paul, men ki moun nou ye?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Mesye ki te gen move Lespri a te vòltije sou yo tout e te tèlman domine yo, ke yo te kouri kite kay la toutouni, e blese.<verse eid="ACT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Bagay sa te vin konnen pa tout moun, ni Jwif, ni Grèk ki te rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19">Trav 18:19</ref></char></note>Éphèse. Lakrent te vin tonbe sou yo tout, e non Jésus Kri a t ap vin pi gran.<verse eid="ACT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Anpil osi, nan sila ki te kwè yo, yo te kontinye vini pou konfese e devwale tout sa ke yo te konn pratike yo. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Anpil nan sila ki te konn pratike maji yo te vin pote liv yo, e te kòmanse boule yo devan zye a tout moun. Yo te kontwole pri a yo e te twouve l kòm senkant mil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:8">Luc 15:8</ref></char></note>pyès dajan. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Konsa pawòl Senyè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:7">Trav 6:7</ref></char></note>t ap grandi ak pwisans, e t ap renye.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Alò apre bagay sa yo te fini, Paul te pwopoze nan Lespri a, pou lè l te fin travèse Macédoine ak Achaïe, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:16">Trav 20:16</ref></char></note>ale Jérusalem. Li te di: “Apre mwen fin rive la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:11">Trav 23:11</ref></char></note>mwen dwe wè Rome tou.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Li te rete an Asie pandan yon tan, men te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Trav 16:1</ref></char></note>Timothée ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:23">Wo 16:23</ref></char></note>Érastre, de moun ki te konn sèvi li yo, pou yo antre Macédoine.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Anviwon lè sa a, te vin pase yon gwo tapaj konsènan Chemen an.<verse eid="ACT 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Paske te gen yon sèten nonm ki te rele Démétris, yon òfèv ki te konn fè imaj an ajan pou tanp Artimis la, e afè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:16">Trav 16:16</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 16:19">19</ref></char></note>kòb ke li t ap ranmase pa t yon ti kras bagay pou moun ak metye sila a. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Li te vin rasanble moun sa yo, avèk tout ouvriye ki te gen metye parèy a sa a, e te di: “Mesye yo, nou konnen ke lavi nou depann de biznis sila a. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Nou wè ak tande ke non sèlman an Éphèse, men nan prèske tout Asie a, Paul sila a gen tan fè kwè e detounen yon kantite konsiderab nan pèp la. L ap di ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:28">Det 4:28</ref></char></note>dye ki fèt pa men yo se pa dye yo ye menm. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Se pa sèlman yon gwo danje ke metye sa va tonbe nan malgade, men osi ke tanp gwo deyès la, Artimis va vin san valè, e ke li menm ke tout Asie a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:14">Mat 24:14</ref></char></note>lemonn adore, va menm rache sou twòn li, e pèdi mayifisans li.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Lè yo te tande sa, yo te vin ranpli ak raj. Yo te kòmanse kriye fò e t ap di: “Gran se Artimis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19">Trav 18:19</ref></char></note>Efezyen yo!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Vil la te ranpli avèk boulvèsman sa a. Yo te kouri avèk yon sèl panse antre nan teyat la, e te trennen Gaïus ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Trav 20:4</ref></char></note>Aristarque, vwayajè parèy ak Paul ki sòti Macédoine yo.<verse eid="ACT 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Lè Paul te vle antre nan asanble a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:19">Trav 19:19</ref></char></note>disip yo te anpeche li. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Anplis, kèk nan ofisye Lazi ki te zanmi li yo te voye di l plizyè fwa pou l pa antre nan teyat la.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:34">Trav 21:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò konsa, kèk nan yo t ap rele yon bagay, e kèk yon lòt, paske tout asanble a te nan konfizyon. Pifò pa t menm konnen pou ki rezon yo te vin reyini ansanm nan.<verse eid="ACT 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Jwif yo te mennen Alexander devan foul a. Li t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:17">Trav 12:17</ref></char></note>fè sinyal avèk men l, konsi li t ap prezante yon defans a foul la. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Men lè yo te vin konprann ke se te yon Jwif li te ye, yon gwo kri te leve pami foul la. Yo te kontinye rele pandan anviwon dezè de tan: “Gran se Artimis a Efezyen yo!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Apre li te fin kalme foul la, sekretè vil la te di: “Mesye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19">Trav 18:19</ref></char></note>Éphèse yo, se ki moun pami nou ki pa konnen, lavil Éphèse se gadyen tanp a gran Artimis la, imaj a sila ki te tonbe sòti nan syèl la? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Alò akoz ke bagay sa yo pa kapab demanti, nou ta dwe rete kalm e pa fè anyen ki pa saj. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Paske nou fè mesye sila yo vini isit la, ki pa ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:22">Wo 2:22</ref></char></note>vòlè tanp lan, ni yo pa blasfeme deyès nou an. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Donk alò, si Démétris ak ouvriye ki avè l yo gen yon plent kont nenpòt moun, tribinal yo louvri, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:7">Trav 13:7</ref></char></note>pwokonsil yo disponib; kite yo pote plent kont youn lòt.<verse eid="ACT 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>“Men si nou vle yon bagay anplis ke sa, sa gen pou regle nan asanble jistis la. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Paske vrèman, nou an danje akizasyon de soulèvman akoz sa ki pase la jodi a. Nanpwen rezon pou li. Konsa, nou p ap kapab rann kont pou asanble a ki an dezòd konsa.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Lè l fin di sa, li te ranvwaye asanble a.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Aprè tapaj la te fin sispann, Paul te voye pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>disip yo. Lè l fin ekzòte yo, li te pran konje de yo, e li te sòti pou ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:9">Trav 16:9</ref></char></note>Macédoine. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Lè l te fin travèse tout distri sila yo e te bay yo anpil ekzòtasyon, li te rive nan peyi Grèce.<verse eid="ACT 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>Li te pase twa mwa la, epi lè Jwif yo te fè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Trav 9:23</ref></char></note>konplo kont li, pandan li t ap pral pran bato a vwal pou Syrie a, li te fè desizyon pou retounen pa Macédoine. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Li te akonpanye pa Sopater de Bérée, fis a Pyrrhus la, anplis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Trav 19:29</ref></char></note>Aristarque ak Second, de Théssalonique, ak Gaius de Derbe ak Timothée ak Tychique ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:29">Trav 21:29</ref></char></note>Trophime ki sòti an Asie. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Men sila yo te ale avan, e t ap tann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:10">Trav 16:10</ref></char></note>nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:8">Trav 16:8</ref></char></note>Troas.<verse eid="ACT 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Nou te pran bato a vwal soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:12">Trav 16:12</ref></char></note>Philippes, apre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:3">Trav 12:3</ref></char></note>jou a Pen San Ledven yo. Nou te vin jwenn yo Troas nan senk jou, e te rete la pandan sèt jou. <verse eid="ACT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Nan premye jou nan semèn nan, lè nou te rasanble ansanm pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:42">Trav 2:42</ref></char></note>kase pen, Paul te kòmanse pale avèk yo. Li te gen entansyon pati nan pwochen jou a, e li te pwolonje mesaj li a jiska minwi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Te gen anpil lanp nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:13">Trav 1:13</ref></char></note>chanm anlè kote nou te reyini ansanm nan.<verse eid="ACT 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Alò, te gen yon sèten jennonm ke yo te rele Eutychus, ki te chita nan rebò fenèt la, k t ap tonbe nan yon pwofon somèy.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 20:9">Pandan Paul te kontinye ap pale, dòmi te vin pran l, e li te tonbe soti nan twazyèm etaj la, e yo te vin ranmase l mouri.<verse eid="ACT 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Men Paul te desann e te tonbe sou li, epi apre li fin anbrase l, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:23">Mat 9:23</ref></char></note>li te di: “Pa twouble, paske lavi li nan li.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Lè Paul te fin remonte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:42">Trav 2:42</ref></char></note>e te fin kase pen pou manje, li te pale avèk yo pandan anpil tan jis rive nan granmmaten, e answit te pati. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Yo te pran jennonm nan ale tou vivan, e yo te byen rekonfòte.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:10">Trav 16:10</ref></char></note>nou menm, nou te fè avan pou pran bato k ap rive Asòs, kote nou te fè plan pou Paul ta monte bato a. Se konsa li te aranje sa, akoz ke li menm t ap pase pa tè. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Epi lè l te rankontre nou Asòs, nou te pran li abò, e te vini Mitilèn.<verse eid="ACT 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Soti la nan bato a vwal la, jou swivan an, nou te rive anfas Chios. Jou apre a nou te travèse Samòs, e jou swivan a nou te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:17">Trav 20:17</ref></char></note>Milèt.<verse eid="ACT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Paske Paul te fè desizyon pou depase Éphèse pou l pa ta oblije pase tan an Asie. Li t ap prese pou l te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Trav 19:21</ref></char></note>rive Jérusalem, si se te posib <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:1">Trav 2:1</ref></char></note>nan jou Fèt Lapannkot la.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Soti nan Milèt li te voye Ephèse pou rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:30">Trav 11:30</ref></char></note>ansyen a legliz yo pou rive kote l. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Lè yo te vin kote l, li te di yo: “Nou menm, nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19">Trav 18:19</ref></char></note>depi premye jou ke m te mete pye m an Asie a, kijan mwen te avèk nou tout tan <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>pou sèvi Senyè a avèk tout imilite, ak dlo nan zye m, e avèk gwo traka ki te vini sou mwen akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:3">Trav 20:3</ref></char></note>konplo a Jwif yo. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Kòman mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:27">Trav 20:27</ref></char></note>pa t fè bak pou m te kab deklare a nou tout bagay ki te itil, e te enstwi nou an piblik, e de kay an kay. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Se Konsa mwen t ap temwaye seryezman e konplètman a Jwif yo e a Grèk yo, de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">Trav 2:38</ref></char></note>repantans anvè Bondye, ak lafwa nan Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>“Koulye a, gade byen, mare pa Lespri a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:16">Trav 17:16</ref></char></note>mwen sou chemen pou rive Jérusalem, san menm konnen sa ki va rive m la, <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>sof ke Lespri Sen an temwaye solanèlman a mwen nan chak vil, pou di ke se kout kòd mare, avèk afliksyon k ap tann mwen. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:13">Trav 21:13</ref></char></note>mwen pa konsidere lavi m nan okenn sans gen gwo valè pou mwen menm, pou m ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:25">Trav 13:25</ref></char></note>fini ak kous mwen e ak ministè ke mwen te resevwa soti nan Jésus Kri a, pou m temwaye seryezman e konplètman, de levanjil gras Bondye a.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>“Epi koulye a, veye byen, mwen konnen ke nou tout, pami sila mwen te pase, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note>preche wayòm nan, p ap wè figi m ankò. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Alò, mwen temwaye a nou nan jou sa, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:6">Trav 18:6</ref></char></note>mwen inosan de san tout moun. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Paske mwen pa t fè bak pou deklare a nou tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:36">Trav 13:36</ref></char></note>volonte a Bondye a nèt.<verse eid="ACT 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>“Veye byen pou nou menm, e pou tout bann twoupo a, pami sila Lespri Sen an te fè nou gadyen, pou fè bèje a legliz Bondye a, legliz ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Ef 1:7</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 1:14">14</ref></char></note>Li te achte avèk pwòp san Li.<verse eid="ACT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>“Mwen konnen ke apre mwen pati, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:27">Éz 22:27</ref></char></note>lou sovaj va vini pami nou, loup ki p ap fè gras menm a bann twoupo a. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Pami nou menm lèzòm va leve e va pale move bagay, pou antrene <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>disip yo pou yo ta swiv yo. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Konsa, rete vijilan. Byen sonje ke pou yon dire a twa zan, lannwit kon lajounen mwen pa t sispann egzòte nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:19">Trav 20:19</ref></char></note>avèk dlo nan zye m.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>“Epi koulye a, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:23">Trav 14:23</ref></char></note>rekòmande nou a Bondye ak pawòl lagras Li, ki kapab ranfòse nou, e bannou eritaj pami tout sila ki sen yo.<verse eid="ACT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 9:4-18">I Kwo 9:4-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mwen pa janm anvi ni lajan, ni lò, ni rad a lòt moun. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Nou menm nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Trav 18:3</ref></char></note>men sa yo te sèvi a pwòp bezwen m yo ak mesye ki te avè m yo. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Nan tout bagay, mwen te montre nou ke nan travay di konsa, nou dwe toujou ede fèb yo, e sonje pawòl a Senyè Jésus yo, ke Li menm te di: <char style="wj">‘Li pi beni pou bay, pase resevwa.’ </char>”<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Lè l te fin di bagay sa yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:40">Trav 9:40</ref></char></note>mete l a jenou, e te priye avèk yo tout.<verse eid="ACT 20:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Konsa, yo te kòmanse kriye fò. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:20">Luc 15:20</ref></char></note>anbrase Paul, e t ap bo l anpil. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Yo te ranpli ak gwo lapèn, sitou sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:25">Trav 20:25</ref></char></note>pawòl li te pale a, ke yo pa t ap wè fas li ankò. Konsa yo te akonpanye li rive nan bato a.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Lè nou te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:10">Trav 16:10</ref></char></note>nou te kite yo pou pran bato a vwal.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:1">Nou te kouri toudwat pou Cos, jou apre a pou Rhodes, epi soti la a pou Patara.<verse eid="ACT 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Lè nou te twouve yon bato ki t ap travèse vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:19">Trav 11:19</ref></char></note>Phénicie, nou te monte e pran vwal. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Lè nou te vin wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref></char></note>Chip, kite l agoch, e te kontinye kouri bato pou Syrie, e te rive nan Tyr, paske se la bato a te gen pou debake chaj li.<verse eid="ACT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Apre nou fin twouve disip yo, nou te rete la pandan sèt jou. Yo menm te kontinye ap di Paul <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:23">Trav 20:23</ref></char></note>selon Lespri a pou l pa mete pye l Jérusalem.<verse eid="ACT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Lè l rive ke jou nou yo pou rete la te fini, nou te pati fè wout nou, pandan yo menm avèk madanm ak timoun yo te akonpanye nou jiskaske nou te kite vil la. Apre nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:41">Luc 22:41</ref></char></note>mete nou ajenou bòdmè a pou fè lapriyè, nou te di orevwa a youn lòt. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Answit, nou te monte bato a, e yo te retounen<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:27">Jn 19:27</ref></char></note>lakay yo ankò.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Lè nou te fin fè vwayaj la sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:20">Trav 12:20</ref></char></note>Tyr, nou te rive Ptolémaïs. Lè nou te fin salye frè yo, nou te rete avèk yo pandan yon jou.<verse eid="ACT 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Nan jou apre a nou te sòti e te rive Césarée. Nou te antre lakay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Trav 6:5</ref></char></note>Philippe, evanjelis la, ki te youn nan sèt yo. Nou te rete avèk li. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Alò, nonm sa te gen kat fi vyèj ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:36">Luc 2:36</ref></char></note>pwofetès.<verse eid="ACT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Pandan nou te rete la pandan kèk jou, yon sèten pwofèt ki te nome Agabus te desann sòti Judée. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Epi lè l te vini kote nou, li te pran sentiwon a Paul; li te mare pwòp pye l ak men l, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:29">Trav 8:29</ref></char></note>“Men sa ke Lespri Sen an di: Se konsa ke Jwif nan Jérusalem yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:33">Trav 21:33</ref></char></note>va mare nonm ki mete sentiwon sila a e va livre li nan men pèp etranje yo.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Lè nou te tande sa, nou menm, menm jan avèk rezidan lokal yo, nou te kòmanse mande l pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:15">Trav 21:15</ref></char></note>pa monte Jérusalem.<verse eid="ACT 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Paul te reponn yo: “Kisa nou ap fè la a, n ap kriye pou kase kè m? Paske mwen prepare non sèlman pou m mare, men menm pou m ta mouri Jérusalem pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:41">Trav 5:41</ref></char></note>non Senyè Jésus a.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Epi Akoz ke li pa t kab konvenk, nou te tonbe an silans e t ap di: “Ke volonte a Senyè a fèt!”<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Apre jou sa yo, nou te prepare pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:12">Trav 21:12</ref></char></note>kòmanse fè wout nou pou monte Jérusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Anplis, Kèk nan disip Césarée yo te vini avèk nou, e te mennen nou kote Mnanson ki sòti Chypre, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:7">Trav 15:7</ref></char></note>disip depi anpil tan avèk sila nou te vin rete.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Apre nou te rive Jérusalem <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:15">Trav 1:15</ref></char></note>frè fidèl yo te resevwa nou avèk kè kontan.<verse eid="ACT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Jou swivan an Paul te antre avèk nou vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:17">Trav 12:17</ref></char></note>Jacques, epi tout ansyen yo te la. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Apre li te salye yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:27">Trav 14:27</ref></char></note>kòmanse pale youn pa youn, tout bagay ke Bondye te fè pami pèp etranje yo atravè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:17">Trav 1:17</ref></char></note>ministè pa li a.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Lè yo te tande sa yo te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:8">Mat 9:8</ref></char></note>bay glwa a Bondye. Yo te di li: “Ou wè, frè, konbyen milye ki gen pami Jwif yo nan sila ki te kwè yo, e yo tout te ranpli ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:1">Trav 15:1</ref></char></note>zèl pou Lalwa a. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Konsa, yo konn tande de ou, ke w ap enstwi tout Jwif k ap viv pami pèp etranje yo pou renonse a Moïse, e k ap pale yo pou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 7:18">I Kwo 7:18</ref></char></note>pa sikonsi pitit yo, ni pou yo pa mache selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:14">Trav 6:14</ref></char></note>koutim nou yo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Alò, kisa ki dwe fèt? Sètènman yo va tande ke ou gen tan vini.<verse eid="ACT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>“Alò, fè sa ke nou di ou a. Nou gen kat mesye ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Nonb 6:13-21</ref></char></note>anba yon ve. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Pran yo avèk ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:55">Jn 11:55</ref></char></note>pirifye ou menm ansanm avèk yo, e peye depans pou yo kapab taye tèt yo. Konsa, tout moun va konnen ke pa gen anyen nan tout sa ke moun di de ou yo, men ke ou menm osi mache nan lòd, epi swiv Lalwa a.<verse eid="ACT 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>“Men konsènan pèp etranje, ki te kwè yo, nou te ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:19">Trav 15:19</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:29">29</ref></char></note>selon desizyon nou, ke yo ta dwe evite vyann ki ofri kon sakrifis a zidòl, ak san, ak sa ki toufe, e ak imoralite seksyèl.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Alò Paul te pran mesye yo avè l nan jou swivan an. Li te pirifye li menm ansanm avèk yo. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13">Nonb 6:13</ref></char></note>antre nan tanp lan e te bay avètisman ke yo t ap konplete jou pirifikasyon yo jiskaske sakrifis la te ofri pou yo chak.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:9">Nonb 6:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 13:20">13:20</ref></char></note>sèt jou yo te prèske fini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:19">Trav 20:19</ref></char></note>Jwif Asie yo, lè yo te wè l nan tanp lan, te kòmanse soulve foul la pou mete men sou li. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Yo t ap kriye fò: “Mesye Israël yo, vin bay nou konkou! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:13">Trav 6:13</ref></char></note>Sa se mesye ki preche a tout moun kont pèp nou an ak Lalwa a, ak kote sila a. Anplis de sa, li gen tan fè Grèk yo antre nan tanp lan, e te souye lye sen sa a.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Paske avan yo te konn wè Trophime, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19">Trav 18:19</ref></char></note>Efezyen an nan vil la avèk li, e yo te sipoze ke Paul te mennen l nan tanp lan.<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Alò tout vil la te leve, e pèp la te kouri ansanm pou te kenbe Paul. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:15">II Wa 11:15</ref></char></note>rale l deyò tanp lan, epi nan menm moman an, pòt yo te vin fèmen. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Pandan yo t ap chache pou touye l, yon rapò te rive devan kòmandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1">Trav 10:1</ref></char></note>Kowòt Women an, ke tout Jérusalem te boulvèse. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Lapoula li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:27">Trav 23:27</ref></char></note>pran sòlda yo avèk santenye yo, e te kouri desann kote yo. Lè yo te wè sòlda yo avèk kòmandan an, yo te sispann bat Paul.<verse eid="ACT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Kòmandan an te parèt, e te kenbe li. Li te kòmande pou li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:23">Trav 20:23</ref></char></note>mare avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:16">Trav 12:16</ref></char></note>de chenn, e li te kòmanse mande l ki moun li te ye, ak kisa li fè. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Men pami foul la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:32">Trav 19:32</ref></char></note>kèk t ap rele yon bagay, e kèk yon lòt bagay. Lè l pa t kapab twouve laverite ki koze tout boulvèsman an, li te mande yo mennen l nan kazèn nan. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Lè l te rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:40">Trav 21:40</ref></char></note>eskalye a, sòlda yo te pote li akoz vyolans a foul la; <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>paske yon gran foul moun te kontinye ap swiv yo, e t ap rele: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:18">Luc 23:18</ref></char></note>“Touye li!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Pandan Paul te prèt pou antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:34">Trav 21:34</ref></char></note>kazèn nan, li te mande kòmandan an: “Èske m kapab di ou yon bagay?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">E li te reponn: “Ou konn pale Grèk? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Alò se pa ou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:36">Trav 5:36</ref></char></note>Ejipsyen an ki kèk tan pase te soulve yon revòlt, e te mennen kat mil òm asasen pou rive nan dezè a?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Men Paul te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:11">Trav 9:11</ref></char></note>“Mwen se yon Jwif ki sòti Tarse nan Cilicie, yon sitwayen a yon vil ase enpòtan. Mwen mande w, kite m pale avèk pèp la.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Lè l te bay permisyon, Paul, te vin kanpe sou eskalye a. Li te fè sinyal a foul la avèk men l. Lè te vin gen yon gwo silans, li te pale avèk yo nan lang <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:2">Jn 5:2</ref></char></note>Ebre, e te di,<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:2">Trav 7:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Frè yo ak papa yo, tande defans mwen ke m ap ofri nou koulye a.”<verse eid="ACT 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Epi lè yo te tande ke li t ap pale avèk yo an Ebre, yo te vin kalme plis; e li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:40">Trav 21:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-22">Trav 9:1-22</ref></char></note>“Mwen menm se yon Jwif, fèt a Tarse nan Cilicie, men leve nan vil sila a, edike anba <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34">Trav 5:34</ref></char></note>Gamaliel, byen disipline selon lalwa zansèt nou yo, avèk anpil zèl pou Bondye, menm jan ke nou menm ye jodi a. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Trav 8:3</ref></char></note>Mwen te pèsekite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:2">Trav 9:2</ref></char></note>Chemen sila a jiska lanmò. Mwen te mare e te mete nan chenn ni fanm, ni gason pou mete nan prizon, <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>kòm osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1">Trav 9:1</ref></char></note>wo prèt la ak tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:66">Luc 22:66</ref></char></note>konsèy ansyen yo kapab temwaye. Nan men yo, mwen te resevwa osi lèt pou tout frè yo, e te pati pou Damas, pou m ta kapab mennen menm sila ki te la Jérusalem yo kòm prizonye, pou yo ta kab pini.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:3-8">Trav 9:3-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Men li te rive ke lè m te nan wout, e t ap pwoche Damas nan anviwon midi, sibitman yon limyè briyan te klere sòti nan syèl la, tou antoure mwen. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Mwen te tonbe atè e te tande yon vwa ki te di m: <char style="wj">‘Saul, Saul, poukisa w ap pèsekite M?’ </char><verse eid="ACT 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>“Epi mwen te reponn: “Kilès ou ye, Senyè?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">“E Li te di mwen: <char style="wj">‘Mwen se </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:9">Trav 26:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Jésus de Nazareth, ke w ap pèsekite a.’</char><verse eid="ACT 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>“Sila ki te avè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:13">Trav 26:13</ref></char></note>te wè limyè a, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:7">Trav 9:7</ref></char></note>pa t konprann vwa a Sila a ki t ap pale avèk mwen an.<verse eid="ACT 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>“Epi mwen te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:30">Trav 16:30</ref></char></note>“Kisa pou m ta fè, Senyè?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">“Senyè a te reponn mwen: <char style="wj">‘Leve, ale antre Damas. La ou va vin tande tout sa ki nome pou ou ta fè.’</char><verse eid="ACT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>“Men akoz ke m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:8">Trav 9:8</ref></char></note>pa t kab wè akoz briyans a limyè a, mwen te mennen pa lamen pa sila ki te avè m yo pou te vini Damas.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>“Yon sèten <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:10">Trav 9:10</ref></char></note>Ananias, yon mesye fidèl pa règ Lalwa a, e byen pale pa tout Jwif ki te rete la yo <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>te vin kote mwen, te kanpe toupre m, e te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:17">Trav 9:17</ref></char></note>‘Frè Saul, resevwa vizyon ou! Epi nan menm moman an, mwen te gade anlè e te wè li.<verse eid="ACT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>“Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:13">Trav 3:13</ref></char></note>‘Bondye a zansèt nou yo te nome ou pou konnen volonte l, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:17">Trav 9:17</ref></char></note>wè Sila Ki Jis la, e pou tande yon pawòl ki sòti nan bouch Li. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Paske ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:11">Trav 23:11</ref></char></note>yon temwen pou Li a tout moun de sila ou wè ak tande yo. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Koulye a poukisa ou fè reta? Leve, batize e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">Trav 2:38</ref></char></note>lave peche ou yo, pandan w ap rele non Li.<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>“Konsa li te rive ke lè m te retounen Jérusalem e t ap priye nan tanp lan, ke m te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:10">Trav 10:10</ref></char></note>tonbe nan yon pwofon somèy. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Epi mwen te wè Li t ap di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:29">Trav 9:29</ref></char></note><char style="wj">‘Fè vit! Sòti Jérusalem vit, paske yo p ap aksepte temwayaj ou de Mwen menm.’ </char> <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Epi mwen te di: ‘Senyè, yo menm yo konprann ke nan yon sinagòg apre lòt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Trav 8:3</ref></char></note>mwen te konn mete yo nan prizon, e te konn bat sila ki te kwè nan Ou yo. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Trav 7:58</ref></char></note>lè san a temwen ou, Étienne t ap vèse, mwen osi te kanpe byen dakò e t ap veye vètman a sila ki t ap touye l yo.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>“Men Li te di mwen: <char style="wj">‘Ale, pwiske Mwen va voye ou byen lwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kote pèp etranje yo.’</char>”<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Jiska pwen sa a, yo te koute l, e alò yo te leve vwa yo e te di: “Retire sou latè a yon nonm konsa; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:24">Trav 25:24</ref></char></note>li pa merite viv!”<verse eid="ACT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Pandan yo t ap rele konsa, yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Trav 7:58</ref></char></note>retire gwo vètman yo pou voye pousyè anlè, <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>kòmandan an te bay lòd pou yo mennen l anndan kazèn nan, e t ap di ke li ta dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:29">Trav 22:29</ref></char></note>egzamine plis avèk kout fwèt pou l ta kapab detèmine rezon an yo t ap rele kont li konsa.<verse eid="ACT 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Men lè yo te tire kò l avèk kòd fèt an kwi, Paul te di a santenye a ki te kanpe akote a: “Éske li pèmi pou ou fwete yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:37">Trav 16:37</ref></char></note>sitwayen Women ki pa menm kondane?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Lè santenye a te tande sa, li te ale kote kòmandan an, e te di l: “Kisa w ap fè? Paske nonm sa a se yon Women.<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Kòmandan an te parèt e te mande l: “Di mwen, “Èske se yon Women ou ye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">E li te di: “Wi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Kòmandan an te reponn: “Mwen te twouve tit sitwayen sa a ak yon gwo sòm lajan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paul te di: “Men mwen te ne sitwayen.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Konsa, sila ki t ap kesyone li yo, te lage L imedyatman; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:24">Trav 22:24</ref></char></note>kòmandan an osi te pè lè li te vin konprann ke se te yon sitwayen Women ke li te ye, paske li te mete li nan chèn.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Men nan pwochen jou a, akoz ke li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:28">Trav 23:28</ref></char></note>anvi konnen poukisa Jwif yo te akize l la, li te demare li, e li te bay lòd pou wo prèt yo avèk konsèy la reyini. Konsa yo te mennen Paul devan yo, e te fè l chita devan yo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Paul te gade konsèy la avèk atansyon, e te di: “Frè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:16">Trav 24:16</ref></char></note>mwen viv lavi m avèk yon trè bon konsyans devan Bondye jiska jodi a.”<verse eid="ACT 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Wo prèt la, Ananias te kòmande sila ki te kanpe akote l yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:22">Jn 18:22</ref></char></note>frape l sou bouch li.<verse eid="ACT 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Konsa, Paul te di li: “Bondye pral frape ou, ou menm miray ki blanchi avèk lacho! Èske ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev 19:15</ref></char></note>chita pou jije m selon Lalwa a, e nan vyolasyon Lalwa a, ou pase lòd pou yo frape m?”<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Men sila ki te akote yo te di: “Èske se ensilte w ap ensilte wo prèt Bondye a?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Paul te reponn: “Mwen pa t okouran, frè m yo, ke li te wo prèt la. Paske sa ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Egz 22:28</ref></char></note>‘Nou pa pou pale mal a yon chèf a pèp nou an’”.<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Men byen konprann ke yon pati se te Sadiseyen yo, e lòt la, Farizyen yo, Paul te kòmanse kriye fò nan konsèy la: “Frè m yo, mwen menm se yon Fariziyen, yon fis a Farizyen. Mwen ap jije devan tribinal a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:15">Trav 24:15</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 24:21">21</ref></char></note>esperans nan rezirèksyon a mò yo!”<verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Pandan li te di sa, te vin rive gen yon gran dezakò antre Farizyen yo ak Sadiseyen yo, epi asanble a te divize. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Paske Sadiseyen yo di ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat 22:23</ref></char></note>nanpwen rezirèksyon, ni zanj, ni lespri, men Farizyen yo rekonèt yo tout.<verse eid="ACT 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Konsa, te vin rive gen yon gwo tapaj. Kèk nan skrib pati Farizyen yo te kanpe e te kòmanse diskite byen cho. Yo t ap di: “Nou pa twouve okenn fot avèk nonm sila a. Si se<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:29">Jn 12:29</ref></char></note> yon lespri oswa yon zanj te pale ak li, annou pa goumen kont Bondye!”<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Pandan konfli a t ap devlope, kòmandan an te pè pou yo pa ta chire Paul an mòso. Konsa, li te kòmande sòlda yo pou desann, retire li pami yo ak lafòs, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:34">Trav 21:34</ref></char></note>mennen l nan kazèn nan.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Men nan nwit swivan an, Senyè a te kanpe akote l e te di: <char style="wj">“Pran kouraj, paske</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Trav 19:21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">menm jan ke ou temwaye seryezman e konplètman pou kòz mwen Jérusalem nan, menm jan an ou oblije temwaye nan Rome osi.” </char><verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Lè jounen an te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Trav 9:23</ref></char></note>Jwif yo te fòme yon konplo. Yo te vin mare ansanm anba yon sèman, pou yo pa ta ni manje, ni bwè jiskaske yo te touye Paul. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Te gen plis ke karant moun ki te fòme konplo sila a. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Yo te vini a chèf prèt ak ansyen yo, e te di: “Nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:12">Trav 23:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 23:21">21</ref></char></note>mare ansanm anba yon sèman serye e konplè pou pa goute anyen jiskaske nou touye Paul. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Alò, konsa, ou menm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:30">Trav 22:30</ref></char></note>konsèy la avèti kòmandan an pou l mennen l desann kote nou, kòmsi nou t ap pral detèmine ka li a pi pre. E pou pati pa nou, nou prè pou touye l avan li rive pre kote a.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Men fis a sè Paul la te tande afè konplo sila a, e li te vin antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:34">Trav 21:34</ref></char></note>kazèn nan pou te enfòme Paul.<verse eid="ACT 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Konsa, Paul te rele youn nan santenye kote l yo e te di li: “Mennen jennonm sila a kote kòmandan an paske li gen yon rapò pou bay li.”<verse eid="ACT 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Alò li te pran li, e te mennen li bay kòmandan an e te di l: “Paul <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:1">Ef 3:1</ref></char></note>prizonye a te rele mwen vè jennonm sila a pou vin kote w akoz li gen yon bagay pou di w.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Kòmandan an te pran l pa lamen, e te rale l akote pou mande l an prive: “Kisa ou gen kòm rapò pou ban mwen an?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Li te di: “Jwif yo gen tan fin dakò pou mande ou mennen Paul devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:30">Trav 22:30</ref></char></note>konsèy la demen, kòmsi yo t ap pral mande plis enfòmasyon sou li menm. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Pa kwè yo, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:12">Trav 23:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 23:14">14</ref></char></note>plis ke karant nan yo ap tann pou atake l. Yo gen tan mare yo menm anba yon sèman pou yo pa ni manje ni bwè jiskaske yo touye l; koulye a y ap tann ou vin bay pèmisyon.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Kòmandan an te kite jennonm nan ale. Li te di l: “Pa di pèsòn ke ou pale bagay sa yo avè m.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Konsa, li te rele de nan santenye yo. Li te di yo: “Ale fè de-san sòlda prè pou twazyèm lè nwit lan, pou pati pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:40">Trav 8:40</ref></char></note>Césarée, avèk swasann-dis chevalye, ak de-san sòlda ak lans.” <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Yo te gen osi pou prepare cheval pou mete Paul, pou fè l rive sof kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:26">Trav 23:26</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 23:33">33</ref></char></note>Félix gouvènè a. <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Epi li te ekri yon lèt nan fòm sila a:<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>Claude Lysias, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:3">Luc 1:3</ref></char></note>trè ekselan Gouvènè Félix; Salitasyon.<verse eid="ACT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>“Lè mesye sa a te arete pa Jwif yo, e te prèt pou l te touye pa yo, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:32">Trav 21:32</ref></char></note>te vini sou yo avèk sòlda yo pou sekouri l, akoz ke m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:25-29">Trav 22:25-29</ref></char></note>te vin konprann ke li te yon sitwayen Women. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Epi akoz ke mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:30">Trav 22:30</ref></char></note>vle konprann chaj ke yo te pote kont li an, mwen te fè l rive devan Konsèy pa yo a. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Konsa, mwen te vin twouve ke li te akize sou kesyon konsènan pwòp lwa pa yo, men pa anba <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:9">Trav 23:9</ref></char></note>okenn akizasyon ki te merite lanmò oubyen prizon.<verse eid="ACT 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>“Lè m te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:20">Trav 23:20</ref></char></note>enfòme ke ta gen yon konplo kont li, mwen te voye li kote ou sibitman, e osi te enstwi akizatè li yo pou mennen chaj kont li yo devan ou.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Konsa, sòlda yo selon lòd pa yo, te pran Paul pou mennen l nan nwit lan devan Antipatris. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Men nan pwochen jou a yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:23">Trav 23:23</ref></char></note>kite chevalye yo ale avè l, e yo te retounen nan Kazèn nan. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Lè sa yo te rive Césarée e te livre lèt la bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:24">Trav 23:24</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 23:26">26</ref></char></note>Gouvènè a, yo te prezante Paul devan l.<verse eid="ACT 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Lè li te fin li l, li te mande nan ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:1">Trav 25:1</ref></char></note>pwovens li te sòti, e lè li te vin aprann ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:39">Trav 21:39</ref></char></note>se te Cilicie, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>li te di: “Mwen va bay ou yon odyans apre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:30">Trav 23:30</ref></char></note>akizatè ou yo vin rive tou.” Konsa, li te bay lòd pou yo ta kenbe l nan Pretwa Hérode la.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Apre senk jou wo prèt la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:2">Trav 23:2</ref></char></note>Ananias te vin desann avèk kèk ansyen, avèk yon sèten avoka ki te rele Tertulle. Yo te pote chaj kont Paul yo bay gouvènè a. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Apre Paul te fin konvoke, Tertulle te kòmanse akize l e te di a gouvènè a: “Akoz ke atravè ou menm, nou te rive gen anpil lapè, epi akoz vizyon ou menm, refòm ap fèt pou nasyon sila a, <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>nou rekonèt sa, nan chak aspè, e toupatou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:26">Trav 23:26</ref></char></note>trè ekselan Félix, avèk tout rekonesans. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Men pou m pa fatige ou plis, mwen mande w pou pèmèt nou nan bonte ou, pou tande nou an brèf.<verse eid="ACT 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>“Paske nou twouve nonm sila a yon vrè pès, e yon mesye ki soulve konfli pami tout Jwif yo nan tout mond lan, yon chèf de fil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:5">Trav 15:5</ref></char></note>sèkt a Nazareyen yo. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Li te menm eseye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:28">Trav 21:28</ref></char></note>souye tanp lan. Epi konsa, nou te arete li. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Men Lysias, kòmandan an te parèt, epi avèk anpil vyolans, te rache li nan men nou.<verse eid="ACT 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>“Lè ou egzamine li pou kont ou konsènan tout bagay sila yo, ou kapab verifye bagay sou sila nou akize li yo.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 2:16">I Tes 2:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jwif yo tou te vin jwenn nan atak la, e yo t ap sètifye ke tout bagay sila yo se te vrè.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:24">Trav 23:24</ref></char></note>gouvènè a te fè l sinyal pou l pale, Paul te reponn: “Byen konesan, ke depi anpil ane, ou se yon jij nan nasyon sila, se avèk jwa ke m ap fè defans mwen. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Akoz ke ou kapab note ke pa plis ke nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:18">Trav 21:18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 21:27">27</ref></char></note>douz jou pase mwen te monte Jérusalem pou m adore. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:8">Trav 25:8</ref></char></note>Ni nan tanp lan, ni nan sinagòg yo, ni nan vil la li menm, yo pa t janm twouve mwen nan diskisyon avèk okenn moun, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:18">Trav 24:18</ref></char></note>koze okenn boulvèsman. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:7">Trav 25:7</ref></char></note>Ni yo pa kapab pwouve ou de chaj sou sila yo akize mwen koulye a.<verse eid="ACT 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>“Men sa mwen admèt a nou, ke selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:2">Trav 9:2</ref></char></note>Chemen an, ke yo rele yon sèkt, se vrè ke m sèvi Bondye a zansèt nou yo, e kwè tout bagay ki an akò avèk Lalwa a ak sa ki ekri nan pwofèt yo. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Mwen posede yon esperans nan Bondye, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:12">Dan 12:12</ref></char></note>moun sa yo osi konsidere presye, ke an verite, va gen yon rezirèksyon ni pou sila ki jis yo ak sila ki enjis yo. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Akoz sa, mwen menm, tou, mwen fè tout sa ki posib pou toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:1">Trav 23:1</ref></char></note>kenbe yon konsyans ki tout tan san repwòch devan Bondye, ak devan lèzòm.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>“Alò, apre plizyè ane, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:29">Trav 11:29</ref></char></note>te vin pote yon don a nasyon mwen an e prezante ofrann m. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Nan sa a, yo te twouve mwen okipe nan tanp lan, deja <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:26">Trav 21:26</ref></char></note>pirifye, san okenn foul, ni konfli. Men te gen sèten Jwif ki sòti an Asie— <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>ki ta dwe prezan devan ou pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:30">Trav 23:30</ref></char></note>fè akizasyon, si yo ta gen anyen kont mwen. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Oubyen pito kite mesye sila yo, yo menm di ki move zak yo te twouve lè mwen te kanpe devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:22">Mat 5:22</ref></char></note>konsèy la, <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>ot ke sèl pawòl sa a ke m te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Trav 23:6</ref></char></note>rele lè m te kanpe pami yo a: ‘Pou rezirèksyon a mò yo y ap jije mwen jodi a.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Men Félix, ki te gen yon konesans pi egzakt de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:14">Trav 24:14</ref></char></note>Chemen an, te repouse yo, e t ap di: “Lè Lysias kòmandan an vin desann, mwen va deside ka ou a”. <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Answit Li te bay lòd a santenye a pou l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:35">Trav 23:35</ref></char></note>retire l nan gadavi a, men avèk yon sèten libète, e pa anpeche okenn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:16">Trav 23:16</ref></char></note>zanmi li yo sèvi li.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Men kèk jou pita, Félix te rive avèk Drusille, madanm li ki te yon Jwif, epi te voye rele Paul, pou koute li pale sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:21">Trav 20:21</ref></char></note>lafwa nan Jésus Kri a. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Men pandan li t ap diskite sou ladwati, tanperans, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:42">Trav 10:42</ref></char></note>jijman ki gen pou vini an, Félix te vin pè. Li te di: “Pou moman sa a, ale. Lè m jwenn tan, m a konvoke ou.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Nan menm tan an, tou, li t ap espere ke Paul ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:17">Trav 24:17</ref></char></note>bay li lajan pou lage l. Akoz sa, li te konn voye rele l souvan pou pale avè l.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Men apre dezan te pase, Félix te ranplase pa Porcius Festus, e pou te jwenn favè ak Jwif yo, li te kite Paul anprizone.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Konsa, Festus, apre twa jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:34">Trav 23:34</ref></char></note>nan pwovens lan, te kite Césarée pou monte Jérusalem.<verse eid="ACT 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Chèf prèt yo ak dirijan a pèp Jwif yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:1">Trav 24:1</ref></char></note>pote chaj kont Paul. Konsa, yo t ap mande yo favè <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>ke li ta fè pa yo nan jijman a kont Paul, pou fè l vini Jérusalem. Men yo te gen lentansyon pou touye l nan wout.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:24">Trav 9:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Answit Festus te reponn ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:23">Trav 24:23</ref></char></note>Paul t ap kenbe nan gadavi Césarée, e ke li menm t ap sòti talè. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>“Konsa”, li te di: “Kite prensipal moun pami nou yo ale avè m, e si gen yon bagay ki mal nan nonm sa a, kite yo pouswiv sa nan lajistis.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Apre Festus te fin pase plis ke di jou pami yo, li te desann Césarée. Nan pwochen jou a li te pran chèz li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:19">Mat 27:19</ref></char></note>devan tribinal la, e te kòmande yo fè Paul vini.<verse eid="ACT 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Apre Paul te rive, Jwif ki te desann sòti Jérusalem yo te kanpe antoure li. Yo t ap pote anpil chaj byen serye kont li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:13">Trav 24:13</ref></char></note>ke yo pa t kab pwouve.<verse eid="ACT 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Paul te di nan pwòp defans li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:13">Trav 6:13</ref></char></note>“Mwen pa fè okenn ofans ni kont Lalwa Jwif yo, ni kont tanp lan, ni kont César.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Men Festus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:3">Trav 12:3</ref></char></note>ki te vle plè Jwif yo, te reponn Paul. Li te di: “Èske ou dakò pou monte Jérusalem pou pase nan jijman devan mwen sou chaj sila yo?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Men Paul te di: “Mwen kanpe devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:19">Mat 27:19</ref></char></note>tribinal César a, kote mwen dwe jije a. Mwen pa fè okenn mal a Jwif yo, jan ou menm osi byen konnen an. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Si konsa, mwen se yon malfektè, e mwen fè yon bagay ki merite lanmò, mwen pa refize mouri; men si okenn nan bagay sila ke yo akize m yo pa verite, pèsòn pa kapab livre mwen a yo. Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:21">Trav 25:21</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 25:25">25</ref></char></note>fè apèl mwen a César.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Konsa Apre Festus te fè yon konferans avèk konseye li, li te reponn: “Se a César ke ou fè apèl; se a César ke ou va ale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Alò lè kèk jou te pase, Wa Agrippa avèk Bérnéice te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:40">Trav 8:40</ref></char></note>Césarée pou prezante omaj yo a Festus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Pandan yo t ap pase anpil jou la, Festus te mete ka a Paul la devan wa a, e t ap di: “Genyen yon sèten nonm ke Félix te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:27">Trav 24:27</ref></char></note>kite kòm prizonye. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Epi lè m te Jérusalem, chèf prèt avèk ansyen Jwif yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:1">Trav 24:1</ref></char></note>pote chaj kont li, pou mande yon santans kondanasyon kont li.<verse eid="ACT 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>“Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:4">Trav 25:4</ref></char></note>reponn yo ke se pa koutim a Women yo pou livre okenn moun avan sila ki akize a wè akizatè li yo fasafas e vin gen chans pou fè defans li kont chaj yo. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Donk, apre yo te fin ransanble la a, mwen pa t fè reta, men nan pwochen jou a, te pran chèz mwen sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:19">Mat 27:19</ref></char></note>tribinal la, e te kòmande mesye sila a vin devan mwen. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Lè akizatè yo te kanpe, yo te kòmanse pote chaj krim, men pa tankou mwen ta sipoze a. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Yo te senpleman gen kèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:15">Trav 18:15</ref></char></note>pwen malantandi sou relijyon pa yo, ak sou yon sèten mesye mouri, Jésus, ke Paul te pwoklame toujou vivan. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:9">Trav 25:9</ref></char></note>Kòmsi mwen pa t menm konprann jan pou m ta fè yon ankèt sou bagay sila yo, mwen te mande si li te dakò pou ale Jérusalem pou pase nan jijman sou zafè sila yo. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Men lè Paul te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Trav 25:11</ref></char></note>fè apèl pou desizyon Anperè a, mwen te kòmande li kenbe nan gadavi jiskaske m voye li kote César.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Answit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note>Agrippa te di a Festus: “Mwen ta renmen osi tande mesye sa mwen menm”.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Li te reponn: “Demen ou va tande l”.<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Konsa, nan pwochen jou a, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:13">Trav 25:13</ref></char></note>Agrippa te parèt ansanm avèk Bérnéice, pami gwo zafè, li te antre nan sal odyans lan, akonpanye ak kòmandan yo ak lòm pi enpòtan nan vil yo, epi sou kòmand Festus, Paul te mennen antre.<verse eid="ACT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Festus te di: “Wa Agrippa, e tout moun ki prezan avèk nou la a, ou wè nonm sila a, sou kilès <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:2">Trav 25:2</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 25:7">7</ref></char></note>tout pèp Jwif la te fè vin kote mwen, ni nan Jérusalem, ni isit la, pou te deklare byen fò ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:22">Trav 22:22</ref></char></note>li pa t dwe viv ankò a. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Men mwen te twouve ke li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:29">Trav 23:29</ref></char></note>pa t fè okenn bagay ki te merite lanmò; epi akoz ke li menm te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Trav 25:11</ref></char></note>fè apèl a Anperè a, mwen te deside voye l.<verse eid="ACT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>“Deja mwen pa gen anyen definitif pou ekri a mèt mwen. Donk mwen mennen li devan nou tout, e espesyalman devan ou, Wa Agrippa, pou lè ankèt la fèt, pou mwen kapab gen yon bagay pou m ekri. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Paske li sanble dwòl pou mwen voye yon prizonye, epi pou m pa endike osi chaj kont li.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Agrippa te di a Paul: “Ou gen dwa pale pou tèt ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Epi Paul te lonje men li pou te kòmanse fè defans li. <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>“Konsènan tout bagay ke mwen akize pa Jwif yo, mwen konsidere ke mwen gen gwo chans, Wa Agrippa, pou m kapab fè defans mwen devan ou jodi a; <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Sitou paske ou se yon ekspè nan tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:14">Trav 6:14</ref></char></note>koutim ak kesyon pami pèp Jwif yo. Pou sa, mwen mande w pou koute mwen avèk pasyans.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>“Alò konsa, tout Jwif yo konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:13">Gal 1:13</ref></char></note>kalite vi mwen depi nan jenès mwen, ki soti nan kòmansman an ki te pase pami pwòp nasyon mwen, ak nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Paske yo konnen mwen depi lontan, si yo dakò temwaye. Mwen te viv kon yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Trav 23:6</ref></char></note>Farizyen, selon sèkt ki pi disipline nan tout relijyon nou an.<verse eid="ACT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>“Konsa, koulye a, mwen kanpe devan tribinal la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:15">Trav 24:15</ref></char></note>pou lespwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:32">Trav 13:32</ref></char></note>pwomès ki te fèt pa Bondye a zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Pwomès pou sila douz tribi yo gen esperans wè reyalize, pandan yo rete fidèl nan sèvi Bondye lajounen ak lannwit. Se pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:15">Trav 24:15</ref></char></note>esperans sa a, o Wa, mwen akize pa Jwif yo. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Poukisa pami nou, nou twouve li enkwayab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Trav 23:6</ref></char></note>ke Bondye kapab leve mò yo?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>“Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:2">Jn 16:2</ref></char></note>mwen te reflechi a mwen menm, ke mwen te oblije aji avèk anpil fòs kont non a Jésus de Nazareth la. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Epi sa, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Trav 8:3</ref></char></note>te fè menm Jérusalem; non sèlman ke m te fèmen anpil nan sen sila yo nan prizon, men avèk otorite ke m te resevwa soti nan chèf prèt yo, lè yo te mete yo a lanmò mwen te dakò pou yo aji kont yo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:17">Mat 10:17</ref></char></note>pandan mwen te pini yo souvan nan tout sinagòg yo, mwen te eseye fòse yo fè blasfèm. Tèlman mwen te anraje avèk yo, mwen te kouri dèyè yo menm nan vil etranje yo.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>“Pandan mwen te angaje konsa, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-8">Trav 9:3-8</ref></char></note>fè yon vwayaj nan Damas avèk otorite ak pèmisyon a chèf prèt yo. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Nan mitan jounen an, O Wa, mwen te wè sou wout la yon gwo limyè ki sòti nan syèl la, pi briyan ke solèy la, ki te briye toupatou ozanviwon m ak sila ki t ap fè vwayaj la avè m yo. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Epi lè nou tout te tonbe atè, mwen te tande yon vwa ki t ap di m nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:40">Trav 21:40</ref></char></note>lang Ebre a: <char style="wj">‘Saul, Saul, poukisa w ap pèsekite Mwen? Se difisil pou ou pou voye pye ou kont pikan yo.’ </char><verse eid="ACT 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>“Konsa, mwen te reponn: ‘Ki moun Ou ye, Senyè?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">“E Senyè a te di: <char style="wj">‘Mwen se Jésus ke w ap pèsekite a. </char> <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/><char style="wj">Men leve kanpe sou pye ou. Se pou rezon sa ke m te parèt kote ou; pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:14">Trav 22:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nome ou kòm yon sèvitè ak yon temwen, non sèlman a bagay ke ou wè, men osi a bagay ke Mwen menm va fè vin parèt a ou menm;</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/><char style="wj">k ap delivre ou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:35">I Kwo 16:35</ref></char></note><char style="wj">de pèp Jwif la, ak pèp etranje yo, pami sila m ap voye ou yo,</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/><char style="wj">pou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">És 35:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">louvri zye yo pou yo kapab tounen kite tenèb la pou limyè a, e domèn Satan pou sila a Bondye, pou yo kapab resevwa padon peche yo ak yon eritaj pami sila ki sanktifye pa lafwa nan Mwen yo.’</char><verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>“Konsa, Wa Agrippa, mwen pa t dezobeyisan a vizyon selès la, <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>men mwen te kontinye deklare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:19">Trav 9:19</ref></char></note>premyèman a moun Damas yo, e osi ak moun Jérusalem yo, e answit moun tout rejyon Judée a, e menm ak pèp etranje yo, pou yo ta dwe repanti, vire vè Bondye, e fè zèv ki apatyen ak repantans lan.<verse eid="ACT 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>“Pou rezon sa a, kèk Jwif te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:27">Trav 21:27</ref></char></note>sezi mwen nan tanp lan e te eseye mete m a lanmò. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Alò, avèk èd Bondye ke m te twouve, mwen kanpe jiska jou sa a pou temwaye a piti kòm gran, pou pa pale anyen men sa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:43">Trav 10:43</ref></char></note>pwofèt yo ak Moïse te di ki t ap pral rive yo. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Ke Kris la te gen pou soufri, e akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:20">I Kwo 15:20</ref>,<ref loc="1CH 15:23">23</ref></char></note>rezirèksyon Li soti nan lanmò a, Li ta devni premye pou pwoklame limyè a, ni a pèp Jwif la, ni a pèp etranje yo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Pandan Paul t ap di sa nan defans li, Festus te di ak yon gwo vwa: “Paul, tèt ou fin pati! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:15">Jn 7:15</ref></char></note>Gran konesans ou fè ou vin fou.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Men Paul te reponn li: “Mwen pa pèdi tèt mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:26">Trav 23:26</ref></char></note>trè ekselan Festus, men mwen pale pawòl ak verite byen rezonen. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Paske Wa a okuran de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:3">Trav 26:3</ref></char></note>tout bagay sila yo, e mwen pale ak li osi avèk konfyans, akoz ke m konvenk ke anyen nan bagay sila yo pa kapab chape anba atansyon li, akoz ke nanpwen anyen ki fèt nan yon kwen. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Wa Agrippa, èske ou kwè nan pwofèt yo? Mwen konnen ke ou kwè.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agrippa te reponn a Paul: “Ak yon ti bourade konsa, ou vlè pèswade m pou devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Trav 11:26</ref></char></note>Kretyen?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Paul te reponn: “Mwen ta vle devan Bondye, ke menm si se ak piti, oswa ak gran, ke non sèlman ou menm, men tout sila ki koute mwen nan jou sa a, ta kapab vini menm jan ke mwen ye a, sof pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:33">Trav 21:33</ref></char></note>chèn sila yo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 25:23">Trav 25:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wa a te leve avèk gouvènè a, ak Bérnéice, ak sila ki te chita avèk yo. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Epi lè yo te ale akote, yo te kòmanse pale youn ak lòt. Yo t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:29">Trav 23:29</ref></char></note>“Mesye sila a p ap fè anyen ki merite lanmò oubyen prizon.”<verse eid="ACT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Epi Agrippa te di a Festus: “Mesye sa a ta gen dwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:18">Trav 28:18</ref></char></note>libere si li pa t fè apèl a César.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Lè yo te deside ke nou ta pran vwal pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Trav 18:2</ref></char></note>Italie, yo te pwosede livre Paul avèk kèk lòt prizonye bay yon santenye ki manm nan kowòt Auguste la, ki te nome Julius. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Nou te anbake nan yon bato Adramityen ki te prèt pou pran vwal pou rejyon akote kot Asie. Nou te monte nan lanmè a, akonpanye pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Trav 19:29</ref></char></note>Aristarque, yon Masedonyen ki soti Théssalonique.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Pwochen jou a nou te antre kote Sidon. Julius <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:43">Trav 27:43</ref></char></note>te byen trete Paul e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:23">Trav 24:23</ref></char></note>pèmèt li ale bò kote zanmi li yo, kote li te resevwa swen.<verse eid="ACT 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Soti la nou te monte sou lanmè a pou te pran vwal anba pwoteksyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref></char></note>Chypre akoz van an ki te kontrè. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Lè nou te fin travèse lanmè a toupre kot <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:39">Trav 21:39</ref></char></note>Cilicie ak Pamphylie, nou te rive nan Myra, nan Lycie. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>La santenye a te twouve yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:11">Trav 28:11</ref></char></note>bato Alexandryen ki t ap pran vwal pou Italie, e li te fè nou anbake. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Nou te navige byen lantman pandan anpil jou, epi avèk difikilte te rive akote Nid, akoz ke van pa t pèmèt nou ale pi lwen. Akoz sa nou te pran vwal anba pwoteksyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:11">Trav 2:11</ref></char></note>Crète la, toupre Salmone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Konsa, avèk difikilte, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:13">Trav 27:13</ref></char></note>vwayaje pou rive a yon sèten kote ke yo te rele Beau-Ports, toupre lavil Lasea a.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Lè anpil tan te fin pase, vwayaj la te vin andanje akoz ke tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:29-31">Lev 16:29-31</ref></char></note>Fèt Jèn nan te fin pase, e Paul te kòmanse avèti yo. <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>Li te di yo, “Mesye yo, mwen prevwa ke vwayaj la va an verite gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:21">Trav 27:21</ref></char></note>donmaj ak gwo pèt, non sèlman pou bagay nou pote ak bato a, men anplis pou lavi nou.”<verse eid="ACT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Men santenye a te plis enfliyanse pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:17">Rev 18:17</ref></char></note>pilòt la ak kaptenn bato a, ke pawòl a Paul yo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Akoz pò a pa t bon pou pase sezon livè a, majorite a te rive a yon desizyon pou retounen sou lanmè a pou wè si yo ta kab rive Phoenix, yon pò nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:11">Trav 2:11</ref></char></note>Crète, anfas sidwès ak nòdwès pou pase sezon livè a la.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Lè yon van sid byen modere te vin parèt, avèk kalkil la ke yo vin reyisi plan an, yo leve lank bato a, e yo te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:8">Trav 27:8</ref></char></note>pran vwal pou swiv Crète, toupre kot la. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Men avan anpil tan, yon van vyolan, ke yo te rele Euraquilon te desann soti atè e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:37">Mc 4:37</ref></char></note>vin vole sou yo. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Konsa, lè bato a te pran nan li, li pa t kab fè fas a van an, e nou te kite l pran nou pou lèse nou pouse pa van an.<verse eid="ACT 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Pandan nou t ap kouri anba pwoteksyon a yon ti lil ke yo rele Clauda, nou te prèske pa t kab mete bato a anba kontwòl. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Lè yo te fin leve l, yo te sèvi ak kab pou ranfòse bato a. Akoz pè ke yo ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:26">Trav 27:26</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 27:29">29</ref></char></note>vin echwe nan bafon Syrte la, yo te desann gwo vwal la, epi konsa kite van an pouse yo avanse.<verse eid="ACT 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Nan demen, pandan nou t ap jete toupatou avèk vyolans akoz van a, yo te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:5">Jon 1:5</ref></char></note>vide chaj yo pote nan lanmè. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Nan twazyèm jou a, yo te jete tout aparèy pou manevre bato a nan lanmè avèk pwòp men yo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Akoz ni solèy, ni etwal pa t parèt pandan anpil jou, e se pa yon ti kras tanpèt ki t ap atake nou an, depi la, tout espwa pou nou ta sove te disparèt.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Lè yo te fin fè anpil tan san manje, Paul te kanpe nan mitan yo e te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:10">Trav 27:10</ref></char></note>“Mesye yo, nou te dwe swiv konsèy mwen an pou nou pa pran lanmè a soti Crète pou envite fè rive donmaj ak pèt sila yo. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Men koulye a mwen ankouraje nou pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:25">Trav 27:25</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 27:36">36</ref></char></note>pran kouraj, paske p ap gen pèt lavi pami nou, men sèlman chaj bato a. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Paske nan menm nwit sa a, yon zanj a Bondye a Sila ke m apatyen, e Sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:9">Wo 1:9</ref></char></note>ke m sèvi, te kanpe devan mwen. <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>Konsa li te di: ‘Pa pè anyen Paul. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:11">Trav 23:11</ref></char></note>Ou dwe kanpe devan César. Gade byen, Bondye gen tan ba ou tout sila ki ap vwayaje avèk ou yo.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Akoz sa, mesye yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:22">Trav 27:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 27:36">36</ref></char></note>pran kouraj. Paske mwen gen konfyans nan Bondye ke sa va fini menm jan ke Li te di mwen an. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Men fòk nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:29">Trav 27:29</ref></char></note>echwe sou yon sèten <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:1">Trav 28:1</ref></char></note>lil.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Men lè katòzyèm nwit lan te vin rive, pandan van a t ap pouse vire nou nan Lanmè Adriatique la, anviwon minwi, yo te kòmanse vin konprann ke yo t ap pwoche vè yon tè. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Lè Yo te sonde, yo te twouve ke se te a ven bwas pwofondè; epi yon ti kras pi lwen, yo te sonde ankò, e te twouve li a kenz bwas. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Nan pè pou nou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:17">Trav 27:17</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 27:26">26</ref></char></note>kouri atè yon kote sou wòch, yo voye kat lank pa dèyè bato yo e te espere pou jounen an vin rive. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Men pandan mesye lanmè yo t ap eseye chape kite bato a, yo te deja lonje desann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:16">Trav 27:16</ref></char></note>ti kannòt bato a nan lanmè a, sou pretèks ke yo t ap lonje lank pa devan yo, <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Paul te di santenye a ak sòlda yo: “Si moun sa yo pa rete nan bato a, nou menm nou p ap kab sove.”<verse eid="ACT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Alò, sòlda yo te koupe kòd a kannòt bato a, e te kite l tonbe lib.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Jiskaske joune a te prèt pou pwente, Paul t ap ankouraje yo tout pou pran kèk bagay pou manje, e t ap di: “Jodi a fè katòzyèm jou ke nou ap veye san rete, ale san manje, e pa pran anyen. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Konsa, mwen ankouraje nou pou pran kèk manje, paske sa se pou prezève nou; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:30">Mat 10:30</ref></char></note>pa menm yon cheve nan tèt a okenn nan nou p ap peri.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Lè l fin di sa, li te pran pen e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:19">Mat 14:19</ref></char></note>remèsye Bondye nan prezans a tout moun. Li te kase li e te kòmanse manje. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:22">Trav 27:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 27:25">25</ref></char></note>Yo tout te ankouraje e yo menm yo tout te pran manje. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Nou tout nan bato a se te de-san-swasann-sèz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:41">Trav 2:41</ref></char></note>moun. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Lè yo te manje kont yo, yo te kòmanse fè bato a pi lejè pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:5">Jon 1:5</ref></char></note>voye ble nan lanmè a.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Lè jounen an te vin rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:1">Trav 28:1</ref></char></note>yo pa t rekonèt tè a, men yo te wè yon pò avèk yon plaj, e yo te pran kouraj pou dirije bato a vè li si l te posib. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Konsa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:29">Trav 27:29</ref></char></note>jete lank yo, e te kite yo nan lanmè a, pandan nan menm moman an yo t ap lage kòd gouvènay yo, yo te monte vwal devan an pou van an pran l; konsa yo te tire vè plaj la. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Men yo te vin frape a yon resif kote de lanmè te rankontre, yo te kouri echwe batimán an; pwent avan bato a te kole rèd, e pa t kapab deplase, men dèyè a te kòmanse kraze an moso akoz gwo vag lanmè a.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Sòlda yo te fè plan pou touye tout prizonye yo, pou okenn nan yo pa ta chape naje nan lanmè a.<verse eid="ACT 27:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Men santenye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:3">Trav 27:3</ref></char></note>ki te vle fè Paul rive sof, te anpeche entansyon yo a, e te kòmande ke sila ki te kapab naje, vòltije nan lanmè a avan pou naje rive atè, <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>epi rès la ta swiv yo, kèk sou mòso bwa, e lòt yo sou plizyè lòt bagay pou kite bato a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 27:44">Konsa li te rive, ke yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:22">Trav 27:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 27:31">31</ref></char></note>tout te vin rive sof atè.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Lè yo tout te fin rive sof <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:39">Trav 27:39</ref></char></note>nou te vin twouve ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:26">Trav 27:26</ref></char></note>lil la te rele Malte. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:4">Trav 28:4</ref></char></note>Natif peyi yo te byen resevwa nou ak yon dousè ekstrawòdinè. Akoz lapli a ki te vin fèmen sou nou, avèk anpil fredi, yo te limen yon dife e te resevwa nou tout.<verse eid="ACT 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Men lè Paul te ranmase yon pakèt bwa e te mete yo sou dife a, yon vipè te sòti akoz chalè a e te tache nan men l.<verse eid="ACT 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Lè natif yo te wè bèt la k ap pann soti nan men li, yo te kòmanse di youn ak lòt: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:2">Luc 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:4">4</ref></char></note>“San dout mesye sa a se yon asasen, epi malgre li sove soti nan lanmè a, jistis p ap kite li viv.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Konsa, li te souke retire bèt la jete nan dife a, men l pa t gen anyen. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Men yo t ap atann ke li vin anfle e sibitman tonbe mouri. Men apre yo te tann pandan anpil tan e pa t wè anyen rive li, yo te reflechi yon lòt jan e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:11">Trav 14:11</ref></char></note>kòmanse di ke li te yon dye.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Alò, toupre kote sila a, te gen tè ki te pou mesye pi enpòtan nan lil la, ke yo te rele Publius, ki te bannou byenveni. Li te byen emab e li te bay nou lojman pandan twa jou.<verse eid="ACT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Li te vin rive ke papa a Publius te kouche byen malad avèk lafyèv ak dyare. Paul te ale wè li e lè li te fin priye pou li, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:18">Mat 9:18</ref></char></note>poze men l sou li e te geri li.<verse eid="ACT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Aprè sa te fin fèt, tout lòt moun sou lil la ki te gen maladi t ap vin kote li e t ap geri. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Anplis, yo te onore nou avèk anpil mak respè, e lè nou t ap pran vwal, yo te founi nou tout sa nou te bezwen.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Nan fen twa mwa yo nou te pran vwal sou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 27:6">Trav 27:6</ref></char></note>bato Alexandryen ki osi te pase sezon livè a nan lil la. Li te gen Frè Jimo yo kon òneman devan an kòm tèt bato a.<verse eid="ACT 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Apre nou te antre o pò nan Syracuse, nou te rete la pandan twa jou.<verse eid="ACT 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Soti la, nou te pran vwal pou antoure rive nan Reggio. Yon jou pita, yon van sid te parèt, e nan dezyèm jou a nou te rive Pouzzles. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>La nou te twouve kèk frè ki te envite nou rete avèk yo pandan sèt jou, e konsa nou te rive Rome.<verse eid="ACT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:15">Trav 1:15</ref></char></note>frè fidèl yo, lè yo te tande de nou, te vini la soti nan distans pou rive nan Mache Appuis la avèk Twa Tavernes pou rankontre nou. Lè Paul te wè yo, li te remèsye Bondye e te pran kouraj.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Lè nou te antre Rome, Paul te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:23">Trav 24:23</ref></char></note>jwenn pèmisyon pou rete pou kont li, avèk sòlda ki t ap veye l la.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Apre twa jou Paul te rele ansanm moun ki te pi enpòtan pami mesye Jwif yo. Lè yo te vin ansanm, li te kòmanse ap di yo: “Frè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:8">Trav 25:8</ref></char></note>malgre mwen pa t fè anyen kont pèp nou an, oubyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:14">Trav 6:14</ref></char></note>koutim zansèt nou yo, konsa, mwen te livre kòm prizonye soti Jérusalem nan men Women yo. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Epi lè yo menm te egzamine mwen, yo te dakò pou lage m paske yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:29">Trav 23:29</ref></char></note>pa t twouve baz pou mete m a lanmò. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Men lè Jwif yo te vin pa dakò, mwen te oblije fè apèl a César, pa akoz ke m te gen okenn akizasyon kont nasyon mwen an. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Pou rezon sa a, donk mwen te mande wè nou pou pale avèk nou, paske mwen ap pote chenn sa a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:5">Trav 24:5</ref></char></note>lespwa Israël la.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Yo te di li: “Nou pa t ni resevwa lèt sòti Judée konsènan ou, ni pa t gen okenn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:17">Trav 3:17</ref></char></note>frè yo ki te vin isit la pou rapòte oswa pale anyen mal de ou menm. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Men nou dezire tande de ou menm sa ke ou panse. Paske konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:14">Trav 24:14</ref></char></note>sèkt sa a, se byen koni pami nou menm ke yo pale kont li toupatou.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Lè yo te fikse yon jou pou Paul, yo te vini kote lojman li an an gran nonb. Li t ap eksplike yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Trav 1:3</ref></char></note>temwayaj klè e konplè de wayòm Bondye a ak nan eseye fè yo kwè konsènan Jésus, soti nan Lalwa Moïse la ak nan pwofèt yo depi granmmaten jis rive nan aswè. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:14">Trav 14:14</ref></char></note>Kèk te vin kwè akoz bagay ki te pale yo, men lòt yo te refize kwè. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Lè yo pa t dakò youn avèk lòt, yo te kòmanse pati lè Paul te fin pale dènye pawòl sila a: “Lespri Sen an te gen rezon lè l te pale atravè Ésaïe, pwofèt a zansèt nou yo, <verse eid="ACT 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>Lè l te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9">És 6:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>‘Ale nan pèp sa epi di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Nou va toujou tande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">men nou p ap konprann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Nou va toujou gade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">men nou p ap wè anyen.<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Paske kè a moun sa yo vin di.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Zòrèy pa yo, yo manke tande.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">E yo fèmen zye yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">otreman pou yo ta wè avèk zye yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">tande avèk zòrèy yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">konprann avèk kè yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">e retounen, pou Mwen ta geri yo.’<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>“Konsa, Kite l byen konnen a nou menm, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 98:3">Sòm 98:3</ref></char></note>delivrans sila gen tan voye osi a pèp etranje yo. Yo menm va koute.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Lè li te fin pale pawòl sa yo, Jwif yo te pati, e yo t ap diskite pami yo menm.<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Konsa, Paul te rete la pandan dezan nan pwòp chanm li ke li te lwe a. Li te trè kontan resevwa tout sila ki te vin wè li yo. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Li t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4:23</ref></char></note>preche wayòm Bondye a, e t ap enstwi konsènan Senyè a Jésus Kri, avèk tout libète, san anpèchman.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
